gle" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/68cb579550854032e4dfb8297bc87dfe12e2745f.png" alt="Visibility toggle" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Visibility toggle</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>Allows you to toggle the visibility of itemframes specifically placed by you.</span></div></a><a href="/mod/higher-snow-lines" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG9yy7ky/bc907d83b48f09d39b778d1126cef6e07fdd7c1f_96.webp" alt="Higher Snow Lines" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Higher Snow Lines</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>Snow starts at a higher altitude.</span></div></a><a href="/mod/an-enderman-that-is-weird" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFoiv3LN/856dccddda02950a0edf4320d3a0493cc672982b.png" alt="an enderman that is weird" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>an enderman that is weird</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>Joke mod suggested by @asterope-here on pixilart.</span></div></a><a href="/mod/project-determination" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/b5baa43ed07f37c5116cfbcc7f6dc2b9436ab5bf_96.webp" alt="Project DETERMINATION" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Project DETERMINATION</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>YOU ARE FILLED WITH DETERMINATION</span></div></a><a href="/mod/infernal-craft" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFps90Wz/7a9b1071280f6474b715b2cadca792435b28a47f_96.webp" alt="Infernal Craft" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Infernal Craft</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>New blocks, plants, crafts, trees, mobs and most importantly the Infernalgrove biome</span></div></a><a href="/modpack/vaguely-vanilla" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6Gyvm3/d2ce020d66348eb825442e6da2dd338de225c953.png" alt="Vaguely Vanilla" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Vaguely Vanilla</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>A cosy vanilla+ modpack with useful tweaks 🔧 and aesthetic ✨ improvements.</span></div></a><a href="/mod/pipphone" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/7561ace2ea774798ebfaecc0740b005d9d47a306_96.webp" alt="PIPphone" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>PIPphone</span><span class="description" data-v-f81a2b1e>Modern in-game phone HUD and app menu with CarLib integration for Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric.</span></div></a><a href="/mod/pie-plus+" class="project button-animation" data-v-f81a2b1e><img class="avatar shrink-0" style="--_size:3rem;" src="https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/3369fad4de8909aa6b86a791b1b846f8487d7998_96.webp" alt="Pie Plus+" loading="lazy" data-v-f81a2b1e data-v-1114031b><div class="project-info" data-v-f81a2b1e><span class="title" data-v-f81a2b1e>Pie Plus+</span><span class="