ne">Share instances with friends</h3><p class="m-0 text-sm leading-tight text-primary">Play more easily with friends without having to share .mrpack files.</p><div class="mt-auto text-sm text-secondary">July 24, 2026</div></div></article><!--]--></a></div><div class=""><a href="/news/article/proud-of-you-2026/" class="active:scale-[0.99]! group flex flex-col transition-all ease-in-out hover:brightness-125 cursor-pointer"><!--[--><article class="flex h-full grow flex-col gap-4"><img src="/news/article/proud-of-you-2026/thumbnail.webp" class="aspect-video w-full rounded-xl border-[1px] border-solid border-button-border object-cover"><div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 text-base leading-tight group-hover:underline">Proud of you all</h3><p class="m-0 text-sm leading-tight text-primary">Over 2,400 of you came together to raise more than $40,000 for charity this Pride month!</p><div class="mt-auto text-sm text-secondary">July 2, 2026</div></div></article><!--]--></a></div><div class="max-xl:hidden"><a href="/news/article/modpack-permissions/" class="active:scale-[0.99]! group flex flex-col transition-all ease-in-out hover:brightness-125 cursor-pointer"><!--[--><article class="flex h-full grow flex-col gap-4"><img src="/news/article/modpack-permissions/thumbnail.webp" class="aspect-video w-full rounded-xl border-[1px] border-solid border-button-border object-cover"><div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 text-base leading-tight group-hover:underline">Improving Modpack review delays</h3><p class="m-0 text-sm leading-tight text-primary">Reducing the back-and-forth needed to get your modpack approved.</p><div class="mt-auto text-sm text-secondary">June 23, 2026</div></div></article><!--]--></a></div><!--]--></div><div class="mx-2 my-8 flex w-full items-center justify-center"><div class="btn-wrapper text-base" style="--_bg:var(--color-brand);--_text:var(--color-accent-contrast);--_hover-bg:var(--color-brand);--_hover-text:var(--color-accent-contra