g and fixing minecraft by various means...\n\nThis pack has a collections of \"cursed\" mods (and dome others), like eating everything, flying foxes or the ability to bucket (almost) all mobs. None of the mods should empose too great of a change (balance be ignored) to the vanilla gameplay mechanics through adding mostly a few fun new things to discover and nothing that would make the game unenjoyable or even borderline unplayable, despite providing a somewhat ... unique experience if one wants to try to spice up their game a little without altering any major parts of the game drastically.","2025-11-29T00:12:48.065804Z","2025-12-20T23:28:26.902244Z","2025-12-17T02:16:10.078550Z","2025-12-10T11:06:48.880893Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved",296,0,[153,162],[],[354,385],[29951,29952],"yntHWe3u","ckVO4wBA","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGMZmVZe/3a2f0333bd601e929402b6dccc01545685135e4c_96.webp",[],[],16053492,"y0dAXfKU","monetized",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":29961,"id":29962,"slug":29963,"project_type":12,"team":29964,"organization":29965,"title":29966,"description":29967,"body":29968,"body_url":3607,"published":29969,"updated":29970,"approved":29971,"queued":29972,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":29973,"downloads":29976,"followers":29977,"categories":29978,"additional_categories":29979,"loaders":29980,"versions":29981,"icon_url":29983,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":29984,"donation_urls":29985,"gallery":29986,"color":30005,"thread_id":30006,"monetization_status":29958},"unsupported",[862,856,853,850,847,844,841,838,835,832,829,826,808,805,802,799,796,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,571,568,565,562,559,556,553,550,547,544,541,538,535,532,529,526,523,520,517,514,511,508,505,502],"AFjUHPhq","syrexx-dark-gui","1G4jaLMl","9MTKPkFI","Syrexx's Dark GUI","Here to protect your eyes.","\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>1.26.2 when?\u003C/summary>\n\nSoon! So sorry. It overwhelmes me for some unknown reason.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n# Syrexx's Dark GUI\n### Here to protect your eyes.\n\nSyrexx's Dark GUI is a resource pack designed to lower the brightness of every UI element so your eyes won't burn anymore. It focuses on delivering a darker than usual GUI making it easyer to open any container without getting flash-banged.\n\n---\n\n### Features:\n- **Dark Container UI's**\n\n- **Dark Tooltips**\n\n- **Dark Hotbar**\n\n- **Dark Widgets**\n\n---\n\n### Why Choose Syrexx's Dark GUI?\nWhile most \"Dark GUI\" resource packs focus on making the interface just a little darker, Syrexx's Dark GUI focuses on bringing an even darker version of the GUI to the table.\n\n---\n\n### Stay updated!\nWhether you want to know when a new project gets released, when a project gets updated or if you want to know what I am working on in the background via teasers, you should consider joining my [Discord Server](https://discord.gg/ZSzpjzNcZE) to stay up-to-date with [Syrexx's Workshop](https://modrinth.com/organization/syrexx-workshop)!.\n\n---\n\n© 2026 Syrexx ∘ [Syrexx Creative Usage Terms](https://gist.github.com/JustSyrexxx/4c71f954b49a44f1dfabea8ba5e2714a)","2026-05-12T03:33:09.315360Z","2026-05-12T04:00:11.586713Z","2026-05-13T19:56:29.465074Z","2026-05-12T04:31:16.754746Z",{"id":29974,"name":10,"url":29975},"LicenseRef-Syrexx-Creative-Usage-Terms","https://gist.github.com/JustSyrexxx/4c71f954b49a44f1dfabea8ba5e2714a",307,1,[139,300,307],[],[377],[29982],"PjlapN3O","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/2930711a85f1f9302fd5c164648addeb0288274f.png","https://discord.gg/ZSzpjzNcZE",[],[29987,29992,29997,30001],{"url":29988,"raw_url":29989,"featured":439,"title":29990,"description":3607,"created":29991,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/159ce0a08db5315f870fa824732defadefd85573_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/159ce0a08db5315f870fa824732defadefd85573.png","Hotbar","2026-05-12T04:28:32.196887Z",{"url":29993,"raw_url":29994,"featured":439,"title":29995,"description":3607,"created":29996,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/7a8ff09f188a66421bf8dced41f416c74517bdfa_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/7a8ff09f188a66421bf8dced41f416c74517bdfa.png","Containers","2026-05-12T04:28:24.258740Z",{"url":29998,"raw_url":29998,"featured":439,"title":29999,"description":3607,"created":30000,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/e3f60dbfb69c256094ad4c927c6945ca077a7595.png","Tooltip","2026-05-12T04:28:40.707719Z",{"url":30002,"raw_url":30002,"featured":864,"title":30003,"description":3607,"created":30004,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjUHPhq/images/e593cd705a44316fb3346913ce79046eff51bd22.png","Cover","2026-05-12T04:28:12.950065Z",2894892,"1CTZwVMd",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30009,"id":30010,"slug":30011,"project_type":31,"team":30012,"organization":3607,"title":30013,"description":30014,"body":30015,"body_url":3607,"published":30016,"updated":30017,"approved":30018,"queued":30019,"status":29919,"requested_status":29922,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30020,"downloads":30023,"followers":30024,"categories":30025,"additional_categories":30026,"loaders":30027,"versions":30028,"icon_url":30036,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30037,"donation_urls":30038,"gallery":30039,"color":30052,"thread_id":30053,"monetization_status":29958},"optional",[1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1148,1145,1142,1112,1109,1106,1103,1100,1097,1094,1064,1058,1055,1052,1049,1046,1043,1025,1022,1019,1016,1013,1010,1007,1004,1001,998,995,992,989,983,977,974,971,968,965,962,959,956,953,950,947,944,941,938,935,929,926,923,920,917,914,911,908,905,899,896,893,890,887,884,881,878,875,872,869,866,862,856,853,850,847,844,841,838,835,832,829,826,808,805,802,799,796,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502,453],"AGJCd8j1","visibility-toggle","FXWIxnUK","Visibility toggle","Allows you to toggle the visibility of itemframes specifically placed by you.","This datapack simply allows you to toggle the visibility of an itemframe that you have placed by using the command:\n```\n/trigger visibility\n```\n\n### Installation\n**If you get a message saying the pack is not supported in lower versions I have marked it as working in, ignore this as it will still work**\n\n**Datapack installation:**  \n1. Locate the datapack folder for the specific world  \n2. Drag the Itemframes.zip file into the datapack folder  \n3. Enable the datapack with /datapack enable \"file/Itemframes.zip\"  \n\n**Mod installation:**  \n1. Follow the instructions on how to install your prefered modloader (be it Forge, Fabric, NeoForge or Quilt)\n2. Drag the downloaded .jar file into (on windows) %appdata%\\.minecraft\\mods\n3. Launch the world and start playing\n\n**Please report any problems on my discord server.**","2026-01-16T09:08:48.294233Z","2026-06-17T07:06:58.307442Z","2026-01-21T01:48:06.234930Z","2026-01-16T09:38:58.179914Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},"MIT","MIT License",1102,3,[100,303],[],[342,346,354,385,409],[30029,30030,30031,30032,30033,30034,30035],"VpFQTYZQ","ewhtCjQO","c6mdKxM6","Z0NBaqyM","Qtaoj1Vh","If9clghM","JTywjNMW","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/68cb579550854032e4dfb8297bc87dfe12e2745f.png","https://discord.gg/Td3WJf5Yy4",[],[30040,30046],{"url":30041,"raw_url":30042,"featured":864,"title":30043,"description":30044,"created":30045,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/images/5a1f52fac5670cc751f6022185ca58c38505d87e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/images/5a1f52fac5670cc751f6022185ca58c38505d87e.png","Visibility changed","An invisible itemframe holding an item","2026-01-16T09:17:40.462704Z",{"url":30047,"raw_url":30048,"featured":439,"title":30049,"description":30050,"created":30051,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/images/aca3b65411a6835a52252b848a1c5739c3046392_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGJCd8j1/images/aca3b65411a6835a52252b848a1c5739c3046392.png","Wrong owner","You don't own this item frame and thus can't change its visibility","2026-01-16T09:19:05.129112Z",14459924,"cyJSGMey",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30055,"id":30056,"slug":30057,"project_type":31,"team":30058,"organization":3607,"title":30059,"description":30060,"body":30061,"body_url":3607,"published":30062,"updated":30063,"approved":30064,"queued":30065,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30066,"downloads":30067,"followers":30068,"categories":30069,"additional_categories":30070,"loaders":30071,"versions":30072,"icon_url":30084,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30085,"gallery":30086,"color":30087,"thread_id":30088,"monetization_status":29958},[1058,856,775,685,676,670],"AG9yy7ky","higher-snow-lines","rLDKCQfo","Higher Snow Lines","Snow starts at a higher altitude.","# Higher Snow Lines\n\nThis simple mod raises the snow lines across all biomes (the elevation at which water freezes and snow forms) for better results with modified world generation beyond the vanilla world height.\n\nTemperature dropoff rate affecting snow lines is hardcoded into the game and can't be changed by a datapack, so I made this a separate mod to deal with this. Try it with my other mod/datapack, [AmpXtreme](https://modrinth.com/datapack/ampxtreme)!","2025-01-15T22:35:00.157570Z","2025-08-21T00:25:42.344201Z","2025-01-18T00:24:42.663517Z","2025-01-15T23:01:12.477029Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},4579,24,[316],[],[346],[30073,30074,30075,30076,30077,30078,30079,30080,30081,30082,30083],"sizx8iXk","H32PmB3c","rmDTW11W","Cy6X9rVg","EeWrGV8L","Tr4eN4pz","DyhxT2YM","mHvP5gN4","kJqHt3KV","kRW6EZwi","M7Tdt92m","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG9yy7ky/bc907d83b48f09d39b778d1126cef6e07fdd7c1f_96.webp",[],[],3425085,"LyExSBNG",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30090,"id":30091,"slug":30092,"project_type":31,"team":30093,"organization":3607,"title":30094,"description":30095,"body":30096,"body_url":3607,"published":30097,"updated":30098,"approved":30099,"queued":30100,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30101,"downloads":30102,"followers":30103,"categories":30104,"additional_categories":30105,"loaders":30106,"versions":30107,"icon_url":30109,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30110,"gallery":30111,"color":30117,"thread_id":30118,"monetization_status":29958},[1187],"AFoiv3LN","an-enderman-that-is-weird","4j1NXf8Z","an enderman that is weird","Joke mod suggested by @asterope-here on pixilart.","Welcome\n-----------------\nThis is a joke mod that adds a powerful foe: The enderman that is weird! \n\nAbout the mob\n-----------------\nThe weird enderman is a powerful creature that can spawn in groups of 1 - 5. These enderman are very fast and deal little damage, however in larger groups they can be a serious problem. Once defeated, they drop 2 ender pearls which makes for a great way to get ender pearls!","2023-11-05T17:57:00.604782Z","2023-11-05T17:59:40.562283Z","2023-11-07T18:22:42.795066Z","2023-11-05T18:01:42.995662Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},586,4,[93,191],[],[354],[30108],"qDaJSKfm","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFoiv3LN/856dccddda02950a0edf4320d3a0493cc672982b.png",[],[30112],{"url":30113,"raw_url":30113,"featured":864,"title":30114,"description":30115,"created":30116,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFoiv3LN/images/856dccddda02950a0edf4320d3a0493cc672982b.png","w e i r d ","e n d e r m a n","2023-11-05T18:00:54.483541Z",1581092,"7amSdc1x",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30120,"id":30121,"slug":30122,"project_type":31,"team":30123,"organization":30124,"title":30125,"description":30126,"body":30127,"body_url":3607,"published":30128,"updated":30129,"approved":30130,"queued":30131,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30132,"downloads":30133,"followers":30134,"categories":30135,"additional_categories":30136,"loaders":30137,"versions":30138,"icon_url":30140,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30141,"gallery":30142,"color":30165,"thread_id":30166,"monetization_status":29958},[1058],"AGducIYg","project-determination","YCEv2GSY","D4yXBoST","Project DETERMINATION","YOU ARE FILLED WITH DETERMINATION","**Record start**\n_THIS NEXT EXPERIMENT\nSEEMS\nVERY\nVERY\nINTERESTING\n...\nWHAT DO YOU THINK?_\n**Record end**\n\n\n**Record start**\n_I've done it.\nUsing the blueprints, I've extracted it from the human SOULs.\nI believe this is what gives their SOULs the strength to persist after death.\nThe will to keep living... The resolve to change fate.\nLet's call this power...\n\"Determination.\"_\n**Record end**\n\n**Record start**\nEveryone that had fallen down...\n... has woken up.\nThey're all walking around and talking like nothing is wrong.\nI thought they were goners...?\n**Record end**\n\nThe DETERMINATION injected into the vessel allows you to gain the power of an ANGEL.\n\n![Syringe craft](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ec373a3358561569934b4a52cbbafec15dd70c67.png)\n![Injection craft](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/28c23e5179ddc85fa1b526176baa50a3b2473ec4.png)\n![Injection second craft](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/adc7090a2930b8bd071a800efcd1e93726b34ded.png)\n\nThe power of SAVE and RETURN.\n\n![Save Star](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c80d2138365e43a7f44df8082e8b160deec6af7f.png)\n\n![Save screen](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/37440c25514a5b5be895357d3c941a45086130af.png)\n\nBut what will happen to ordinary beings if they gain power that does not belong to them? They're called AMALGAMATES.\n\n![Amalgamate](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dcdbd574f5ede56a67fbdf84beb7bf5478006521.png)\n","2026-01-27T18:04:05.536068Z","2026-01-27T18:06:57.448724Z","2026-01-29T21:59:43.119379Z","2026-01-27T18:39:42.734436Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},83,2,[30,134,171],[],[354],[30139],"UGvyRCYM","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/b5baa43ed07f37c5116cfbcc7f6dc2b9436ab5bf_96.webp",[],[30143,30147,30151,30155,30159,30162],{"url":30144,"raw_url":30145,"featured":864,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30146,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/28c23e5179ddc85fa1b526176baa50a3b2473ec4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/28c23e5179ddc85fa1b526176baa50a3b2473ec4.png","2026-01-27T18:23:44.776460Z",{"url":30148,"raw_url":30149,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30150,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/37440c25514a5b5be895357d3c941a45086130af_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/37440c25514a5b5be895357d3c941a45086130af.png","2026-01-27T18:24:52.488334Z",{"url":30152,"raw_url":30153,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30154,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/adc7090a2930b8bd071a800efcd1e93726b34ded_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/adc7090a2930b8bd071a800efcd1e93726b34ded.png","2026-01-27T18:23:59.775855Z",{"url":30156,"raw_url":30157,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30158,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/c80d2138365e43a7f44df8082e8b160deec6af7f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/c80d2138365e43a7f44df8082e8b160deec6af7f.png","2026-01-27T18:25:01.642145Z",{"url":30160,"raw_url":30160,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30161,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/dcdbd574f5ede56a67fbdf84beb7bf5478006521.png","2026-01-27T18:25:08.339281Z",{"url":30163,"raw_url":30163,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30164,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGducIYg/images/ec373a3358561569934b4a52cbbafec15dd70c67.png","2026-01-27T18:24:07.414879Z",13415428,"MPRnzd8y",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30168,"id":30169,"slug":30170,"project_type":31,"team":30171,"organization":3607,"title":30172,"description":30173,"body":30174,"body_url":3607,"published":30175,"updated":30176,"approved":30177,"queued":30178,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30179,"downloads":30182,"followers":30103,"categories":30183,"additional_categories":30184,"loaders":30185,"versions":30186,"icon_url":30189,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30190,"gallery":30191,"color":30196,"thread_id":30197,"monetization_status":29958},[1112],"AFps90Wz","infernal-craft","iffus91f","Infernal Craft","New blocks, plants, crafts, trees, mobs and most importantly the Infernalgrove biome","Infernal Craft Update Alpha 3.0.0!\n\nNew Biome, New Structures, New Dimension.\nThe new update is very quiet but why not? You should visit the Silent Mansion and you will find out the secrets of the New Dimension or not.\nExplore the world with the mod Infernal craft!\n\nIf you found a bug or have a suggestion email us at : infernalcraft678@gmail.com\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Kjkhacbp8os\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>![dungeon](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/98d7ea89d625fca92674f17308f1b8685d23b933.png)","2024-02-13T12:53:03.143345Z","2024-04-02T14:37:28.360881Z","2024-04-03T06:14:09.286136Z","2024-04-02T14:43:03.849231Z",{"id":30180,"name":30181,"url":3607},"MPL-2.0","Mozilla Public License 2.0",245,[30,93,100],[131,191,288],[354],[30187,30188],"ZO14AYcT","XrIJPEWv","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFps90Wz/7a9b1071280f6474b715b2cadca792435b28a47f_96.webp",[],[30192],{"url":30193,"raw_url":30194,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30195,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFps90Wz/images/828945b1f470f2f2810fc3bfd5642f1b534797c4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFps90Wz/images/828945b1f470f2f2810fc3bfd5642f1b534797c4.png","2024-04-02T14:34:33.845541Z",7548201,"ViK6lWNu",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30199,"id":30200,"slug":30201,"project_type":34,"team":30202,"organization":3607,"title":30203,"description":30204,"body":30205,"body_url":3607,"published":30206,"updated":30207,"approved":30208,"queued":3607,"status":29920,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30209,"downloads":30210,"followers":29977,"categories":30211,"additional_categories":30212,"loaders":30213,"versions":30214,"icon_url":30217,"issues_url":30218,"source_url":30219,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30220,"gallery":30224,"color":30225,"thread_id":30200,"monetization_status":29958},[1187],"AG6Gyvm3","vaguely-vanilla","ZCWocUIU","Vaguely Vanilla","A cosy vanilla+ modpack with useful tweaks 🔧 and aesthetic ✨ improvements.","# Vaguely Vanilla\n\nA cosy vanilla+ modpack with useful tweaks 🔧 and aesthetic ✨ improvements.\n\n## Mods List\n\n### Server-side\n\n- Additional Additions\n- Additional Structures\n- Amplified Nether\n- Cammie's Minecart Tweaks\n- Capybara\n- Charm\n- Copper Golem\n- Creeper Overhaul\n- Immersive Weathering\n- Incantationem\n- More Axolotls Variants\n- More Frogs\n- More Geodes\n- Nullscape\n- Plasmo Voice\n- Repurposed Structures\n- Structory\n- Terralith\n- Yung's Better Desert Temples\n- Yung's Better Dungeons\n- Yung's Better Mineshafts\n- Yung's Better Ocean Monuments\n- Yung's Better Strongholds\n- Yung's Better Witch Huts\n- Yung's Bridges\n- Yung's Extras\n\n### Environmental/Ambience\n\n- Auditory\n- Charmonium\n- Falling Leaves\n- Lambda Better Grass\n- Lamb Dynamic Lights\n- Particle Rain\n- Presence Footsteps\n- Sound Physics\n- Visuality\n\n### Tools\n\n- Easier Villager Trading\n- Fabrishot\n- Inventory Tabs\n- Logical Zoom\n- Mod Menu\n- WTHIT\n- Xaero's Mini Map (fairplay addition)\n- Xaero's World Map\n\n### Improvements\n\n- 3d Skin Layers\n- Animatica\n- Better F3\n- Better Mount HUD\n- Better Recipe Books\n- Better Third Person\n- Cherished Worlds\n- Clickthrough\n- Continuity\n- Elytra Physics\n- Enhanced Block Entities\n- I Know What I'm Doing\n- Leaves Us In Peace\n- No Chat Reports\n- No Telemetry\n- Paxi\n- Not Enough Animations\n- Raised Clouds\n- Shulkerbox Tooltip\n\n### Random\n\n- The Box Trot\n\n### Rendering\n\n- Iris\n- Indium\n- Sodium (Replay Compatible)\n- Reese's Sodium Options\n\n### Performance\n\n- Cull Less Leaves\n- Dynamic FPS\n- Entity Culling\n- Ferrite Core\n- LazyDFU\n\n### Dependencies\n\n- Architectury\n- Bad Packets\n- Chime\n- Cloth API\n- Cloth Config\n- Fabric API\n- Fabric Language Kotlin\n- GeckoLib\n- Moonlight Lib\n- Pehkui\n\n### Datapacks\n\n- Anti Enderman Grief\n- More Mob Heads\n- Player Head Drops\n- Spectator Conduit Power\n- Spectator Night Vision\n- Wandering Trades\n\n### Credits\n\n- [Amplified Nether](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amplified-nether), [Terralith](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith), [Nullscape](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nullscape) and [Structory](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory), by Starmute with [permission](https://stardustlabs.miraheze.org/wiki/Stardust_Labs_Wiki:About#License)\n- [Capybara](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/capybara-fabric)\n- [Moonlight Lib](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene), with [permission](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene?page=3#comments)\n- [Xaero's Mini Map (fairplay addition)](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap) and [Xaero's World Map](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map)\n","2022-11-16T18:19:13.401516Z","2022-12-06T16:28:58.829098Z","2022-11-22T18:50:06.245612Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},538,[30,162,200],[],[346],[30215,30216],"b9NvYXXT","Af6cV5lM","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6Gyvm3/d2ce020d66348eb825442e6da2dd338de225c953.png","https://github.com/SamuelMcGowan/mildly-modded/issues","https://github.com/SamuelMcGowan/mildly-modded/",[30221],{"id":3155,"platform":30222,"url":30223},"Bmac","https://www.buymeacoffee.com/dwnsdp",[],15842040,{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30227,"id":30228,"slug":30229,"project_type":31,"team":30230,"organization":3607,"title":30231,"description":30232,"body":30233,"body_url":3607,"published":30234,"updated":30235,"approved":30236,"queued":30237,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30238,"downloads":30239,"followers":29977,"categories":30240,"additional_categories":30241,"loaders":30242,"versions":30243,"icon_url":30245,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30246,"donation_urls":30247,"gallery":30248,"color":30269,"thread_id":30270,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AHALFnPm","pipphone","6KPWfq1Z","PIPphone","Modern in-game phone HUD and app menu with CarLib integration for Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric.","PIPphone\n\nPIPphone brings a modern in-game phone system to Minecraft!\nDesigned for immersive gameplay and vehicle integration, this mod adds a sleek phone HUD and app menu directly into your world.\n\nBuilt with compatibility for CarLib, PIPphone can display live vehicle telemetry and driving information while keeping a clean and stylish interface.\n\nFeatures\n📱 Fully integrated in-game phone UI\n🚗 CarLib support and telemetry integration\n🖥️ Custom HUD overlay\n⚡ Lightweight and optimized\n🎮 Designed for immersive roleplay and driving experiences\n🔧 Built for Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric\nRequirements\nFabric Loader\nFabric API\nCarLib\nCompatibility\nMinecraft 1.21.1\nJava 21+\nWhy PIPphone?\n\nPIPphone is perfect for players who want a more realistic and interactive Minecraft experience, especially when using vehicle or city-style mods. Whether you're cruising around your world or building a modern roleplay server, PIPphone adds a futuristic touch to gameplay.","2026-05-28T05:20:00.951811Z","2026-05-28T05:21:36.799652Z","2026-05-31T11:41:22.669517Z","2026-05-30T12:06:44.301665Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},84,[275,288],[],[346],[30244],"pRyivnuu","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/7561ace2ea774798ebfaecc0740b005d9d47a306_96.webp","https://discord.gg/tCWFX8UzpW",[],[30249,30254,30259,30264],{"url":30250,"raw_url":30251,"featured":439,"title":30252,"description":3607,"created":30253,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/0bd20d2f2181ecbb72bd34a9a80cf7ff39eeeb1a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/0bd20d2f2181ecbb72bd34a9a80cf7ff39eeeb1a.png","menu","2026-05-30T12:00:38.255407Z",{"url":30255,"raw_url":30256,"featured":439,"title":30257,"description":3607,"created":30258,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/6484714c563a0be2c6ca22e93ee29f349c5f29ed_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/6484714c563a0be2c6ca22e93ee29f349c5f29ed.png","normall menu","2026-05-30T12:01:36.936272Z",{"url":30260,"raw_url":30261,"featured":439,"title":30262,"description":3607,"created":30263,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/708787ea041fd579e38f63f84b2bfa6bd2d255ab_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/708787ea041fd579e38f63f84b2bfa6bd2d255ab.png","gps","2026-05-30T12:01:59.402173Z",{"url":30265,"raw_url":30266,"featured":864,"title":30267,"description":3607,"created":30268,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/e206dfd5369442ae44291912f8a82bd50b9f6ea8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHALFnPm/images/e206dfd5369442ae44291912f8a82bd50b9f6ea8.png","screen","2026-05-30T11:59:35.119958Z",12769249,"se3RX6bw",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30272,"id":30273,"slug":30274,"project_type":31,"team":30275,"organization":3607,"title":30276,"description":30277,"body":30278,"body_url":3607,"published":30279,"updated":30280,"approved":30281,"queued":30282,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30283,"downloads":30284,"followers":30134,"categories":30285,"additional_categories":30286,"loaders":30287,"versions":30288,"icon_url":30294,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30295,"gallery":30296,"color":30315,"thread_id":30316,"monetization_status":29958},[977,619],"AFeSVHpn","pie-plus+","oYt6J7o6","Pie Plus+","You ever just want to eat pies in Minecraft. Well do I have a mod for you.","Pie Plus+ is a mod which aims to add a wide variety of vanilla style pies to the game for the players enjoyment. \n![Pies Displayed on a Hill](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/64ae553bfb6bb09085fbb5e1ddc39edd20db202d.png)\n\n![3 new pies atop a cherry blossom hill](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/20b39dba034f5a61003e4cd190b7a86eef690661.png)\n\n![A lone Buttermilk Pie](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/7336b7fce08b0b8595f3531fd5d08d26e613d397.png)\nCurrently Pie Plus+ adds 14 different pies to the game which can all be crafted in a crafting table. Recipes don't get complicated just being the pumpkin pie recipe with the pumpkin exchanged.\n\nSome of these pies grant effects when eaten such as Glowberry Pie giving the player the Glowing status effect.","2024-03-11T20:30:03.971615Z","2025-11-13T20:22:23.521962Z","2024-03-14T05:44:25.867407Z","2024-03-11T21:01:08.781721Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},378,[131],[],[346,385],[30289,30290,30291,30292,30293],"bp5lXMIF","LTU4Aos9","xq1KmdV7","6zig4RBq","NgVtOTHh","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/3369fad4de8909aa6b86a791b1b846f8487d7998_96.webp",[],[30297,30303,30309],{"url":30298,"raw_url":30299,"featured":864,"title":30300,"description":30301,"created":30302,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/20b39dba034f5a61003e4cd190b7a86eef690661_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/20b39dba034f5a61003e4cd190b7a86eef690661.png","The 3 new pies from PiePlus+ 2.4 atop a cherry blossom hill","You can see the 3 new pies added in the PiePlus+ 2.4 update along with a horse on the right. I like that horse.","2025-11-01T07:28:54.614058Z",{"url":30304,"raw_url":30305,"featured":439,"title":30306,"description":30307,"created":30308,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/7336b7fce08b0b8595f3531fd5d08d26e613d397_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/7336b7fce08b0b8595f3531fd5d08d26e613d397.png","A lone Buttermilk Pie","The lone Buttermilk Pie added in the PiePlus+ 2.5.0 update.","2025-11-12T23:28:11.374377Z",{"url":30310,"raw_url":30311,"featured":439,"title":30312,"description":30313,"created":30314,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/b9dab2b0d0b6ae8ca2ab57c5d6ebf8baa2d20232_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFeSVHpn/images/f1b43c8245a175c52fb7236c0daf89c815404342.png","All 10 pies framed on a hill.","What a sight to behold.","2024-03-11T20:45:16.913150Z",16143423,"8Jld53yp",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30318,"id":30319,"slug":30320,"project_type":31,"team":30321,"organization":3607,"title":30322,"description":30323,"body":30324,"body_url":3607,"published":30325,"updated":30326,"approved":30327,"queued":30328,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30329,"downloads":30332,"followers":30333,"categories":30334,"additional_categories":30335,"loaders":30336,"versions":30337,"icon_url":30351,"issues_url":30352,"source_url":30353,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30354,"gallery":30355,"color":30370,"thread_id":30371,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502],"AFr7Fm0h","better-loading-screen-mod","u5i7WPee","Better loading screen","Enjoy a more beautiful loading screen when you load world!","# 更好的加载屏幕\n\n此 Mod 彻底重构了原版游戏传统的存档加载界面，将其替换为更具现代感的全新加载动画与 UI。\n\n![1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c61eab411aec2eaba917939754d4d116321aed12.png)\n\n_(包含优雅的 LOADING 文本提示、实时进度百分比以及平滑的加载动画)_\n\n此外，该优化界面同样完美支持玩家在切换维度（如进入下界、末地）时的加载过程，带来全程无缝、统一的视觉体验。\n\n![2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/91ffd529774e7528c422096214f28c279aa92cac.png)\n![3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8bc4c16b89aeb90cca7a3ba89cfe7be3345ebcb3_0.webp)\n\n# Better loading screen\n\nThis mod completely reconstructs the vanilla game's traditional world-loading interface, replacing it with a more modern new loading animation and UI.\n\n![1](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c61eab411aec2eaba917939754d4d116321aed12.png)\n\n_(Features a clean \"LOADING\" text, real-time progress percentage, and smooth loading animations)_\n\nFurthermore, this enhanced loading screen seamlessly applies to dimension transitions (e.g., traveling to the Nether or the End), ensuring a consistent and visually pleasing experience throughout your journey.\n\n![2](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/91ffd529774e7528c422096214f28c279aa92cac.png)\n![3](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8bc4c16b89aeb90cca7a3ba89cfe7be3345ebcb3_0.webp)","2026-05-24T14:13:10.349371Z","2026-05-28T14:05:25.741158Z","2026-05-28T22:36:12.525932Z","2026-05-25T10:18:19.449487Z",{"id":30330,"name":30331,"url":3607},"GPL-3.0-only","GNU General Public License v3.0 only",1843,6,[100,211,303],[],[346],[30338,30339,30340,30341,30342,30343,30344,30345,30346,30347,30348,30349,30350],"RIeZ7ax9","AKQHdX2W","u1x5DOMe","Gzk9QDSO","3ux9TvNy","XSAwfIlR","PBSpFvD9","wTnw5ZN8","a6pMREkz","eHdQZXXs","YOOLsTP6","jngwpfzO","grTKmYM5","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/be42f7c461f9b3752e148a8d24a9c5d4e0fafa65_96.webp","https://github.com/isHuaMouRen/better-loading-screen-mod/issues","https://github.com/isHuaMouRen/better-loading-screen-mod",[],[30356,30361,30365],{"url":30357,"raw_url":30358,"featured":864,"title":30359,"description":3607,"created":30360,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/images/c61eab411aec2eaba917939754d4d116321aed12_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/images/c61eab411aec2eaba917939754d4d116321aed12.png","World-loading screen","2026-05-25T10:14:22.917223Z",{"url":30362,"raw_url":30362,"featured":439,"title":30363,"description":3607,"created":30364,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/images/91ffd529774e7528c422096214f28c279aa92cac.png","nether loading screen","2026-05-25T10:14:41.435100Z",{"url":30366,"raw_url":30367,"featured":439,"title":30368,"description":3607,"created":30369,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/images/8bc4c16b89aeb90cca7a3ba89cfe7be3345ebcb3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFr7Fm0h/images/8bc4c16b89aeb90cca7a3ba89cfe7be3345ebcb3.png","the end loading screen","2026-05-25T10:15:03.711633Z",6578517,"B9Jx0Ura",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30373,"id":30374,"slug":30375,"project_type":31,"team":30376,"organization":3607,"title":30377,"description":30378,"body":30379,"body_url":3607,"published":30380,"updated":30381,"approved":30382,"queued":30383,"status":29920,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30384,"downloads":30385,"followers":30386,"categories":30387,"additional_categories":30388,"loaders":30389,"versions":30390,"icon_url":30393,"issues_url":30394,"source_url":30395,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30396,"donation_urls":30397,"gallery":30401,"color":30407,"thread_id":30408,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AFkhqml4","cobblemon-hostile-spawners","Y0QUYKQw","Cobblemon Hostile Spawners","This datapack adds trial spawners that are able to spawn hostile cobblemon!","This datapack is aimed at map makers who want to break up the turn based combat that regular Cobblemon provides. To do this, this datapack provides your players a way to engage Cobblemon in regular Minecraft combat.\n\n![Cobblemon spawning in trial chambers](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e6723ea4765d9eca4e14ffd6731df2782d6b306d.png)\n\nObtain a spawner with\n```js\n/function cobspawners:get_spawner {normal_config: {pokemon: \"Ekans\", level: 10, damage: 4, attack_delay: 40}, ominous_config: {pokemon: \"Arbok\", level: 20, damage: 8, attack_delay: 20}}\n```\n\nWhere\n- `normal_config`: The config applied when the trial spawner is activated in regular mode\n    - `pokemon`: The pokemon spawned\n    - `level`: The level of the spawned pokemon\n    - `damage`: The hit damage of the spawned pokemon\n    - `attack_delay`: The delay between attacks (in ticks)\n- `ominous_config`: The config applied when the trial spawner is activated in ominous mode\n    - `pokemon`: The pokemon spawned\n    - `level`: The level of the spawned pokemon\n    - `damage`: The hit damage of the spawned pokemon\n    - `attack_delay`: The delay between attacks (in ticks)","2025-11-05T00:33:48.716809Z","2025-11-05T10:20:25.216639Z","2025-11-05T02:13:17.646122Z","2025-11-05T01:17:33.467557Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},1629,8,[30,134,191],[],[342],[30391,30392],"lZXbsVCD","fEBRjZoU","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkhqml4/4cdbc94c5d861a5e3644a48a49aeac1b6b91f1dc.png","https://github.com/WesselvanGils/cobspawners/issues","https://github.com/WesselvanGils/cobspawners","https://discord.com/invite/cobblemon",[30398],{"id":3158,"platform":30399,"url":30400},"Paypal","https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=84PUDM87RYMW6",[30402],{"url":30403,"raw_url":30404,"featured":439,"title":30405,"description":3607,"created":30406,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkhqml4/images/e6723ea4765d9eca4e14ffd6731df2782d6b306d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkhqml4/images/e6723ea4765d9eca4e14ffd6731df2782d6b306d.png","Cobblemon Spawners in a Trial Chamber","2025-11-05T01:13:15.572675Z",1910570,"ftLEREvK",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30410,"id":30411,"slug":30412,"project_type":31,"team":30413,"organization":3607,"title":30414,"description":30415,"body":30416,"body_url":3607,"published":30417,"updated":30418,"approved":30419,"queued":30420,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30421,"downloads":30424,"followers":30425,"categories":30426,"additional_categories":30427,"loaders":30428,"versions":30429,"icon_url":30439,"issues_url":30440,"source_url":30441,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30442,"gallery":30447,"color":30464,"thread_id":30465,"monetization_status":29958},[1025,983,977,862,727,685,676,670,625,619,453],"AG7Je2MZ","norse-adventure","tHtYIK49","Norse Adventure","Go viking in Minecraft!\nA Minecraft datapack adding viking ships.","# Norse Adventure\nGo viking in Minecraft!\nThis data pack adds three functioning viking-era ships to the game. The karve, knarr and skeid. Sail across the seas at record speeds and bring your friends along!\n\nTo get started, simply install the both the **datapack** and **resourcepack** and once in-game, check the advancments tab for guidance.\n\n### Versions 1.4.0 and onwards now require [ShipLib](https://modrinth.com/datapack/shiplib) to be installed.\n\nShould you encounter any bugs, please report them on GitHub or let me know by email at hexuar@gmail.com.\n\n## Karve\nAn all purpose vessel used for fishing, trading and transport.\n\u003CIMG src=\"https://github.com/Hexuar/Norse-Adventure/assets/97542759/9e7600e0-685e-4d19-bbde-3246fef35a17\"  alt=\"karve\"/>\n\n\n## Knarr\nA trading vessel with lots of storage.\n\u003CIMG src=\"https://github.com/Hexuar/Norse-Adventure/assets/97542759/592aa67f-c966-4038-b435-0626ec7a8e84\"  alt=\"knarr\"/>\n\n\n## Skeid\nA raiding and war ship, able to carry a large amount of warriors.\n\u003CIMG src=\"https://github.com/Hexuar/Norse-Adventure/assets/97542759/f7b1dc90-6281-40a0-96f8-b212f47a57fd\"  alt=\"skeid\"/>\n","2023-09-27T19:27:35.107588Z","2026-07-02T20:23:39.206961Z","2023-09-29T21:10:13.804794Z","2023-09-27T19:38:30.117011Z",{"id":30422,"name":30423,"url":3607},"GPL-3.0-or-later","GNU General Public License v3.0 or later",10565,65,[30,297],[],[342],[30430,30431,30432,30433,30434,30435,30436,30437,30438],"lZqUFVvp","irIcWV92","rX60OBsV","j2o6YwxF","OmKgCRIM","i1rC8bwJ","YiO2U0ZK","t39qwmlF","7s94VCVn","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/f553c6e5cf5eac6d7f930334dde1772f9502e8e0_96.webp","https://github.com/Hexuar/Norse-Adventure/issues","https://github.com/Hexuar/Norse-Adventure",[30443,30445],{"id":3158,"platform":30399,"url":30444},"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/hellogaming",{"id":3152,"platform":3153,"url":30446},"https://www.patreon.com/Hexuar",[30448,30453,30459],{"url":30449,"raw_url":30450,"featured":864,"title":30451,"description":3607,"created":30452,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/bd5878bb36a0dd82b6e96b0e56d2541619956f1a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/f710e2e0751ec5806defefba93ac3d36307f2030.jpeg","Thumbnail","2023-09-27T19:35:23.519488Z",{"url":30454,"raw_url":30455,"featured":439,"title":30456,"description":30457,"created":30458,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/ab18f340b46018927b042ebe9f56a286557abd61_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/ab18f340b46018927b042ebe9f56a286557abd61.png","Ships","The karve, skeid and knarr","2023-09-27T19:36:41.136465Z",{"url":30460,"raw_url":30461,"featured":439,"title":30462,"description":3607,"created":30463,"ordering":30024},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/e029f26cbeaa1fa2101e8f05574fadbe4ffb9f60_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG7Je2MZ/images/e029f26cbeaa1fa2101e8f05574fadbe4ffb9f60.png","Advancements","2023-09-27T19:36:56.921214Z",7769526,"KGlx6CI3",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30467,"id":30468,"slug":30469,"project_type":34,"team":30470,"organization":3607,"title":30471,"description":30472,"body":30473,"body_url":3607,"published":30474,"updated":30475,"approved":30476,"queued":30477,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30478,"downloads":30479,"followers":30480,"categories":30481,"additional_categories":30482,"loaders":30483,"versions":30484,"icon_url":30493,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30494,"donation_urls":30495,"gallery":30498,"color":30504,"thread_id":30505,"monetization_status":29958},[670,502],"AGRBToH5","relaksland-modpack","ALFj3Y7S","RelaksLand Modpack","RelaksLand Modpack - Сборка модов для игры на сервере RelaksLand.\nModpack for the game on the RelaksLand server.","\u003C/center>\n\u003Ccenter>\n\u003Ca href=\"https://relaks.land\">\n\u003Cimg alt=\"Создано для RelaksLand\" src=\"https://del1t.me/banner.gif\">\n\u003C/a>\n\u003C/center>\n\n\u003C/center>\n\u003Ccenter>\n\u003Ca href=\"https://relaks.land\">\n\u003Cimg alt=\"Создано для RelaksLand\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e5e723e7416451d8d9c7f50544bd08d5c6e871f1_0.webp\">\n\u003C/a>\n\u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/nicklyoptimized\">\n\u003Cimg alt=\"При поддержке NicklyOptimized\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6d3523a511c9dccfefe84f64c21c16eca6e21484_0.webp\">\n\u003C/a>\n\u003C/center>\n\n## Конвертировать модпак из .mrpack в .zip если не хотите использовать рекомендуемый лаунчер:\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n### [ТЫКНИ СЮДА](https://jamie.codeberg.page/mrpack-to-zip/)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## Бинды:\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n- \"V\" — Настройки SimpleVoiceChat\n- \"O\" — Меню мода Litematica\n- \"B\" — Колесо выбора эмоций мода EmoteCraft\n- \"M\" — Открыть расширенную карту мира\n- \"C\" — Приближение (комбинируется с колёсиком мыши)\n- \"Alt\" — Удерживание клавиши позволяет вам говорить в войс\n- \"`\" — Поиск по контейнерам\n- \"J\" — Вкл/выкл видимость путевых точек \n- \"K\" — Открыть меню путевых точек\n- \"L\" — Открыть DeathLog\n- \"Shift + Mouse Scroll\" — Регулировка громкости определённого игрока и пластинок в SimpleVoiceChat\n\n### Дополнительные бинды Litematic (в режиме редактирования):\n- \"U\" — easyPlaceToggle: переключает режим EasyPlace\n- \"BUTTON_3 (колёсико мыши)\" — easyPlaceUseKey: при удержании кнопки колёсика выполняется установка блоков согласно схеме с использованием EasyPlace.\n\u003C/details>\n\n**Просьба сообщать обо всех найденных багах мне в личные сообщения: https://del1t.me.\nЕсли возникнут какие-либо вопросы или пожелания, жду их также в своей личке.**","2024-07-28T04:55:56.044526Z","2026-05-23T10:25:12.707600Z","2024-07-30T05:54:55.096137Z","2024-07-29T03:30:53.020737Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},3464,5,[162,200,211],[],[346],[30485,30486,30487,30488,30489,30490,30491,30492],"qTbUPdpt","PWtAnxaf","eO67xRFC","aUz0CMws","EINGbTQy","gQST1fLf","6sLnepDb","RYKHB9yb","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGRBToH5/ce89dd0ae320bb88cd213a807ac171e58068d180.png","https://discord.gg/afHNR6Q5pZ",[30496],{"id":3167,"platform":3168,"url":30497},"https://donate.stream/del1tme",[30499],{"url":30500,"raw_url":30501,"featured":864,"title":30502,"description":3607,"created":30503,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGRBToH5/images/a80206045e3df92acf695b92e4f0f49774e608b7_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGRBToH5/images/a80206045e3df92acf695b92e4f0f49774e608b7.png","Background","2024-12-24T02:06:26.346541Z",15524032,"rF3Mls2i",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30507,"id":30508,"slug":30509,"project_type":34,"team":30510,"organization":3607,"title":30511,"description":30512,"body":30513,"body_url":3607,"published":30514,"updated":30515,"approved":30516,"queued":30517,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30518,"downloads":30519,"followers":29946,"categories":30520,"additional_categories":30521,"loaders":30522,"versions":30523,"icon_url":30527,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30528,"gallery":30529,"color":30530,"thread_id":30531,"monetization_status":29958},[805,775],"AFhlrDpu","optimized-and-reworked","I14v4GR0","Optimised and Reworked","Modpack focused, not only on optimisation , but also on gamplay expirience","##  Optimisation\nOptimised and Reworked improves minecraft perfomance and memory usage with such mods as Sodium, Concurrent Chunk Management Engine, Dynamic FPS, EntityCulling, ImmediatelyFast, Lithium, \nModernFix, Exordium, More Culling, ScalableLux and Sodium extra\n## Improvements\n- Adds a visualization of saturation and exhaustion to the HUD\n- Replaces the Vanilla statistics screen with an new and improved statistics screen\n- Improves third person camera view\n- Lets you see your held items when in a moving boat\n- Adds player heads next to their chat messages\n- Lets you click through signs and item frames\n- Lets you return to the Title Screen early while your world is still saving in the background\n- Adds shaders support\n- Reduces load times and adds fallbacks for languages\n- Adds a mod menu to view the list of mods you have installed\n- Removes small gaps in item and block models\n- Increases the length of the chat history\n- Enhances the inventory management by adding various additional functions to the usual mouse buttons\n- Removes chat reports\n- Lets you see what is in shulker box\n- Adds zoom\n","2025-02-16T09:08:59.259913Z","2025-02-16T10:31:11.461508Z","2025-02-22T08:14:50.945674Z","2025-02-16T10:33:08.006974Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},151,[162,200,211],[],[346],[30524,30525,30526],"YdD5XUcm","aMQVkySZ","VztZzqAm","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFhlrDpu/c769479b11dae8b807c8ad10c70226dbf16a6baa_96.webp",[],[],4856588,"1tILbmhz",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30533,"id":30534,"slug":30535,"project_type":31,"team":30536,"organization":3607,"title":30537,"description":30538,"body":30539,"body_url":3607,"published":30540,"updated":30541,"approved":30542,"queued":30543,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30544,"downloads":30545,"followers":30480,"categories":30546,"additional_categories":30547,"loaders":30548,"versions":30549,"icon_url":30564,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30565,"gallery":30566,"color":30577,"thread_id":30578,"monetization_status":29958},[727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502,453],"AHBCELUf","shingeki-no-craft-addon-titan-variants","2j1JdjZ6","[SNC ADDON] Titan Variants","This addon adds additional Titan Shifter variants based on specific inheritors. Examples include Marcel’s Jaw Titan, Eren Kruger’s Attack Titan, and More, each with traits reflecting their respective users.","# Information\nThis addon introduces additional Titan Shifter variants based on specific inheritors, expanding the variety of transformations available. The first release adds variants inspired by Marcel and Eren Kruger, each featuring unique head states, body decay stages, hardening and berserk abilities, custom ability icons, and dedicated bossbars to better reflect their individual traits.\n\nTake a look:\n![Preview](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2984e368a3a819c8e4d120734c3a441034e6dfd2.png)\n\n# **Requirements**\nShingeki no Craft - 2.4+\n\n[SNC ADDON] Shifter Form - Any (Optional)\n\n# **Developers Note**\nAs of the beta version \"Cadet Arlert\" and moving forwards, this is addon is essentially 1 singular file. This means it would be used for the datapack & resource pack. \n\n# **Credits**\n\nAllawie: Resource Pack Integration & Datapack Developer\n\nJinx: Texturing & Modeling","2026-03-09T12:41:55.104626Z","2026-05-03T18:59:02.270526Z","2026-03-12T08:30:36.786411Z","2026-03-09T12:56:39.995545Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},6396,[134,191],[],[342,346,354,377,385,409],[30550,30551,30552,30553,30554,30555,30556,30557,30558,30559,30560,30561,30562,30563],"bYh71iaG","geh3VNXf","s1T5zyRe","VBVDQH4S","p8RosxQT","RzZfnpQi","rgX5lW7b","NMOP7qtx","KFS0qtyE","S2ZO7T4o","tG3rF6iv","1n12Ku15","ArT9cbOg","zCJ39HwG","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHBCELUf/d47a74245d14c90fcd62d83fefa20e2a84fcd300.png",[],[30567,30572],{"url":30568,"raw_url":30569,"featured":864,"title":30570,"description":3607,"created":30571,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHBCELUf/images/a95ba05d4fcfdaba86003810aebd6a4ed7ac7262_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHBCELUf/images/a95ba05d4fcfdaba86003810aebd6a4ed7ac7262.png","Preview Image","2026-03-09T13:42:20.608490Z",{"url":30573,"raw_url":30574,"featured":439,"title":30575,"description":3607,"created":30576,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHBCELUf/images/aff6c371bbf06c194aa6cbc9e0cecff427f070c0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHBCELUf/images/aff6c371bbf06c194aa6cbc9e0cecff427f070c0.png","Roar Release","2026-03-09T13:42:41.325803Z",5589830,"JVa1mKKT",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30580,"id":30581,"slug":30582,"project_type":31,"team":30583,"organization":3607,"title":30584,"description":30585,"body":30586,"body_url":3607,"published":30587,"updated":30588,"approved":30589,"queued":30590,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30591,"downloads":30592,"followers":30593,"categories":30594,"additional_categories":30595,"loaders":30596,"versions":30597,"icon_url":30604,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30605,"donation_urls":30606,"gallery":30607,"color":30637,"thread_id":30638,"monetization_status":29958},[1058],"AGvjxjAT","powerborne-heroes","Gm1HHvoK","Powerborne Heroes","A superhero addon for Palladium that adds Marvel and DC heroes, suits, and powers","\u003Cp align=\"center\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Xu7ng43.png\" alt=\"Powerborne Banner\" width=\"800\">\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp align=\"center\">\n  \u003Ca href=\"https://discord.gg/Ymb5pufGFH\">\n    \u003Cimg alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1479881930873901186?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=f3d42f&link=https://discord.gg/Ymb5pufGFH\">\n  \u003C/a>\n  \u003Cimg alt=\"Minecraft\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.20.1-f3d42f?style=for-the-badge\">\n  \u003Cimg alt=\"Loader\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge%20%7C%20Fabric-f3d42f?style=for-the-badge\">\n\u003C/p>\n\nPowerborne is a Palladium-based superhero addon for Minecraft 1.20.1. Become Marvel and DC characters by exploring the world and completing each hero's unique path. Progress through skill trees to unlock new abilities and suit variants.\n\n**The mod is unfinished! More heroes and features will come in the future.**\n\n---\n\n\n## Features\n\n- **Unique abilities** — Each hero has a distinct ability set. Open the power screen to read descriptions in your skill tree.\n- **Skill trees & XP** — Earn XP through combat and using your powers, level up and unlock new abilities.\n- **Suit variants** — Customize your look with multiple cosmetic options per hero. Display suits on armor stands and switch between variants.\n- **World exploration** — Explore the world to find structures with loot.\n- **Companions** — Summon Krypto the Super-Dog with the Kryptonian Whistle.\n\n---\n\n## Firestorm\n\n\u003Cp>To become Firestorm you need to:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Craft a Quantum Splicer\u003C/strong> by combining 4 Redstone Flux Crystals, 2 Lead Ingots, 1 Titanium Ingot, 1 Quartz Circuit and 1 End Crystal in a crafting table.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_b2c646da-cba7-40ae-b2e5-63f910361529.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"201\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Buy a Firestorm Protocol\u003C/strong> from a Master level Cleric villager for 32 Emeralds and 16 Blaze Powder. Each bottle has 2 uses.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Mark your partner\u003C/strong> with \u003Cem>Firestorm Mark\u003C/em>:\u003Cbr>\u003Cstrong>&bull; Player\u003C/strong> &mdash; Drink the Firestorm Protocol.\u003Cbr>\u003Cstrong>&bull; Villager\u003C/strong> &mdash; Right-click any Master level villager with the Firestorm Protocol.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Equip the Quantum Splicer\u003C/strong> in your chest slot. With \u003Cem>Firestorm Mark\u003C/em> active on both you and your partner, merge by right-clicking them. Players will need to accept the merge.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\n\u003Ch2>Captain America\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>To become Captain America you need to:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Craft the Super-Soldier Serum\u003C/strong>&nbsp;by combining a Golden Apple with four Strong (level II) potions in a crafting table:&nbsp;\u003Cem>Strength\u003C/em>,&nbsp;\u003Cem>Regeneration\u003C/em>,&nbsp;\u003Cem>Leaping\u003C/em>, and&nbsp;\u003Cem>Swiftness\u003C/em>.\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_82dca36e-12f3-4463-b884-3f89771e4a2a.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"201\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Craft the Vibranium Shield.&nbsp;\u003C/strong>Find&nbsp;Vibranium Ore from Palladium underground meteor, found deep below a Heart-Shaped Herb.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Spoiler\u003C/summary>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"spoiler\">\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_039db177-0f90-4af9-9a46-484e7df5f22e.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"743\">\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\nCombine 4 Vibranium Ingots, 4 Iron Ingots and a Shield in a crafting table.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_66bcdc5d-e2ef-4b44-873c-b88b979c70bc.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"201\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Make Captain America Suit\u003C/strong>&nbsp;in the&nbsp;\u003Cstrong>Tailoring Bench\u003C/strong>. You need&nbsp;24 Diamonds,&nbsp;18 Light Blue Fabric,&nbsp;8 Red Fabric,&nbsp;6 White Fabric,&nbsp;4 Iron Ingots, and&nbsp;1 Super-Soldier Serum. Put your&nbsp;Vibranium Shield&nbsp;in the tailoring tool slot to complete the recipe.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_920d72a8-c0b4-48be-a8c4-aa4e4d5da0a6.png\" width=\"571\" height=\"201\">\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cbr>You can customize your Vibranium Shield by combining it with dyes in a crafting table.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_19530254-273d-43ce-910d-d7fde6095934.png\" width=\"424\" height=\"201\">\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\n## Sentry\n\n\u003Cp>To become Sentry you need to:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Brew the Golden Sentry Serum\u003C/strong> by combining an Awkward Potion with an Enchanted Golden Apple in a Brewing Stand. Drink it to get the \u003Cem>Unstable Radiance\u003C/em> effect.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Craft a Beacon\u003C/strong> and build a pyramid of at least 3 levels and set its primary effect to \u003Cem>Solar Ascension\u003C/em>.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7392f3432188234cc6e6a9d4c73f27f6e3c47ee.png\" alt=\"Beacon menu\" width=\"468\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>The ritual\u003C/strong> starts when you have both \u003Cem>Unstable Radiance\u003C/em> and \u003Cem>Solar Ascension\u003C/em> active. You'll be pulled toward the beacon and ascend. After, you'll receive the Sentry Suit.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\n\u003Cp>To become \u003Cstrong>The Void\u003C/strong> you need to complete Sentry's skill tree. Reach full Void Corruption by taking damage, killing mobs, or staying in darkness for a long time.\u003C/p>\n\n\n## Superman\n\n\u003Cp>To become Superman you need to:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Find a Crashed Kryptonian Pod\u003C/strong>. They generate in most biomes. Loot it to get \u003Cstrong>Sunstone Shards\u003C/strong> and \u003Cstrong>Kryptonite Shards\u003C/strong> (you may also find a Kryptonian Whistle for summoning Krypto).\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a99d4bb7b150e0e9b10564f3bbcdee0b290e8.png\" alt=\"Crashed kryptonian pod\" width=\"504\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Craft the Kryptonian Sun Totem\u003C/strong> by combining 4 Sunstone Shards, 2 Kryptonite Shards, 2 Gold Ingots, and a Totem of Undying in a crafting table.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/713f40860ac06f5d833e49397838e11fe91632ef.png\" alt=\"Kryptonian Sun Totem\" width=\"424\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Charge the Totem\u003C/strong> by holding it in your hand during the day while under open sky. It absorbs solar energy over time.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Once charged\u003C/strong>, right-click with the Sun Totem to become Superman.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\n## Thor\n\n\u003Cp>To become the God of Thunder you need to:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Find Mjolnir's Crash Site\u003C/strong>. A rare structure that generates in most biomes. It contains Mjolnir in the middle and some Uru scattered around.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e01a6a48fe96166c8fc3047344ccececfb7af0c7.png\" alt=\"Mjolnir crash site\" width=\"505\">\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Mjolnir cannot be lifted by the unworthy\u003C/strong>. You must complete the 2 advancements to become worthy:\u003Cbr>\u003Cstrong>&bull; Monster Slayer\u003C/strong> &mdash; Kill 200 hostile mobs\u003Cbr>\u003Cstrong>&bull; Hero of the Village\u003C/strong> &mdash; Successfully defend a village from a raid\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Lift Mjolnir\u003C/strong> by right-clicking it to pick it up. You'll receive the Thor Suit and the God of Thunder power.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\nTo get \u003Cstrong>Stormbreaker\u003C/strong>, combine a Nether Star and Uru Ingot with awakened Mjolnir at a smithing table. A Mjolnir becomes awakened when you enable the God Mode ability.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\n\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1480992/description_ba5ddb6d-c540-42b4-a3bc-3acbebab01a8.png\" alt=\"Stormbreaker recipe\" width=\"505\">\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\n## Suit Variants\n\n\u003Cp>Each hero has multiple suit variants inspired by comics, movies, and animated series. They change your appearance while wearing your hero suit and do not affect abilities. Equip them through the Palladium accessories menu.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9ddfd41401587c788e6d806792f321e527de8e63.png\" alt=\"Accessories button in inventory\" width=\"407\">\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Suit Scrolls\u003C/strong> unlock random accessories. Right-click with a scroll to unlock it permanently. Scrolls can drop from certain hostile mobs or be purchased from the Wandering Trader.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af6098a7098ec65596c07e53f3229f3d706f239c.png\" alt=\"Accessories menu\" width=\"527\">\n\n---\n\n## Required Dependencies\n\nPalladium, KubeJS, Geckolib, Pehkui, Architectury API, Rhino\n\n---\n\n## Commands\n\n`/powerborne set_property \u003Cplayer> \u003Cproperty> \u003Cvalue>` — Sets a hero property (e.g. energy bars, XP, levels)\n\nExample: /powerborne set_property @s energy_bar_void 200\n\n`/powerborne xp [add|set] \u003Cplayer> \u003Chero> \u003Camount> [xp|levels]` — Adds, removes, or sets XP/levels for a hero\n\nExample: /powerborne xp add @s thor 10 levels\n\n`/powerborne accessory [unlock_all|remove_all] \u003Cplayer>` — Unlocks/removes all accessories (suit variants) for a player\n\nExample: /powerborne accessory unlock_all @s\n\n`/ability \u003Clock/unlock> \u003Cplayer> \u003CpowerId> \u003Cability>` — Locks/unlocks abilities which have the ability to be bought\n\nExample: /ability unlock @s powerborne:superman all\n\n`/powerborne worthy` — Become worthy","2026-03-12T12:12:49.265203Z","2026-07-06T10:57:31.726084Z","2026-03-16T01:33:38.550973Z","2026-03-12T12:32:09.109181Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},14645,26,[30,115,288],[],[346,354],[30598,30599,30600,30601,30602,30603],"ZWraLPJw","RlmaAOAI","QVbvjt00","EAmRfZeL","E6IL6AlV","pcqizhJP","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/3953b96c30e49be58d6c3ca625b941d94bc7f2d5.gif","https://discord.gg/Ymb5pufGFH",[],[30608,30613,30618,30623,30628,30633],{"url":30609,"raw_url":30610,"featured":864,"title":30611,"description":3607,"created":30612,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/08c97e3252f9cce1b41a28959eb5fa6fbde92b8d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/08c97e3252f9cce1b41a28959eb5fa6fbde92b8d.png","Sentry","2026-03-12T12:31:24.348474Z",{"url":30614,"raw_url":30615,"featured":439,"title":30616,"description":3607,"created":30617,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/56d1cc0e97dd8c1c24d39b85d190e3f846df40f9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/56d1cc0e97dd8c1c24d39b85d190e3f846df40f9.png","Firestorm","2026-06-15T10:06:09.843872Z",{"url":30619,"raw_url":30620,"featured":439,"title":30621,"description":3607,"created":30622,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/1a5326839cb8120906a718751786f5f62ff9f6ba_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/1a5326839cb8120906a718751786f5f62ff9f6ba.png","Captain America","2026-04-23T11:56:06.442441Z",{"url":30624,"raw_url":30625,"featured":439,"title":30626,"description":3607,"created":30627,"ordering":30024},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/12be9cb30d02f9b60a9e6c2f96bb66e845ae2513_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/12be9cb30d02f9b60a9e6c2f96bb66e845ae2513.png","Superman","2026-03-12T12:31:37.160376Z",{"url":30629,"raw_url":30630,"featured":439,"title":30631,"description":3607,"created":30632,"ordering":30024},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/f6e288e9cdda97f2980cf6406940742170d22e12_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/f6e288e9cdda97f2980cf6406940742170d22e12.png","Thor","2026-03-12T12:31:47.655770Z",{"url":30634,"raw_url":30635,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30636,"ordering":30103},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/4035809f1d5222c6d68f0d6faed61fb29997493b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvjxjAT/images/4035809f1d5222c6d68f0d6faed61fb29997493b.png","2026-03-12T12:31:54.822312Z",13807655,"Z5IYN8LW",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30640,"id":30641,"slug":30642,"project_type":12,"team":30643,"organization":3607,"title":30644,"description":30645,"body":30646,"body_url":3607,"published":30647,"updated":30648,"approved":30649,"queued":30650,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30651,"downloads":30652,"followers":30653,"categories":30654,"additional_categories":30655,"loaders":30656,"versions":30657,"icon_url":30659,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30660,"donation_urls":30661,"gallery":30662,"color":30673,"thread_id":30674,"monetization_status":29958},[727],"AG0lR5EJ","muggets-flying-golems","M5TF9hIM","Mugget's Flying Golems","This small pack changes the iron golem's model and texture (and animations) to give it a steampunk theme/vibe.","# Mugget's Flying Golems\n\n _This small pack changes the iron golem's model and texture (and animations) to give it a steampunk theme/vibe._\n\n _The Iron Golems have. 50% chance of spawning with some little goggles._\n\n## *Requires EMF/ETF or OptiFine to work\n![Flying Golem GIF](https://i.postimg.cc/0NVNX4fV/iron-golem2.gif)","2025-06-21T02:40:13.916366Z","2025-06-21T02:42:37.064843Z","2025-06-23T05:39:28.396766Z","2025-06-21T02:50:10.344472Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},147,10,[15,197,307],[93,110,300],[377],[30658],"uOO0RsrP","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG0lR5EJ/0989f054c3dd833674aaedd54e2719413d14da9b_96.webp","https://discord.gg/qrdMTwHHnb",[],[30663,30669],{"url":30664,"raw_url":30665,"featured":439,"title":30666,"description":30667,"created":30668,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG0lR5EJ/images/57fa99f99e8cdd93c02374835891816488cc62b9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG0lR5EJ/images/57fa99f99e8cdd93c02374835891816488cc62b9.png","in-game screenshot","Shaders are SuperDuperVanilla","2025-06-21T02:44:58.459008Z",{"url":30670,"raw_url":30671,"featured":864,"title":30451,"description":3607,"created":30672,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG0lR5EJ/images/6c8b19f9619ebb8aa42343477b86f79c6ceb08fd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG0lR5EJ/images/6c8b19f9619ebb8aa42343477b86f79c6ceb08fd.png","2025-06-21T02:43:47.175271Z",6499105,"M83V9lXZ",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30676,"id":30677,"slug":30678,"project_type":34,"team":30679,"organization":3607,"title":30680,"description":30681,"body":30682,"body_url":3607,"published":30683,"updated":30684,"approved":30685,"queued":30686,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30687,"downloads":30688,"followers":29946,"categories":30689,"additional_categories":30690,"loaders":30691,"versions":30692,"icon_url":30694,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30695,"donation_urls":30696,"gallery":30697,"color":30708,"thread_id":30709,"monetization_status":29958},[727],"AFYRa53c","ang3licxls-simplistic-modpack","AYcojnn9","ANG3LICXL's Simplistic ModPack","A simplistic survival modpack. No big mods except for biomes o' plenty.","### A simplistic vanilla (ish) modpack\n\n================================================================================\n\n### Main Mods ->\nBiomes O' Plenty | Adds multiple different biomes to the game.\n\nSerene Seasons | Adds seasons to the game.\n\nTough As Nails | Adds thirst tempature to the game.\n\nSerene Seasons | Adds seasons to the game.\n\nFallings Treets/Veinminer | Mine a vein of ore/a tree and it'll all break down at once.\n\nTectonic | Adds an advanced world generation.","2025-06-13T20:26:48.887352Z","2025-06-20T19:50:23.090444Z","2025-06-24T18:24:35.464252Z","2025-06-20T19:57:27.370194Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},140,[30,200],[211],[346],[30693],"OPFPNU78","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFYRa53c/a5fd37e83a4578c4b51cbc8662a9db25ae9dc31f_96.webp","https://discord.gg/BEY6gwEKSQ",[],[30698,30703],{"url":30699,"raw_url":30700,"featured":439,"title":30701,"description":3607,"created":30702,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFYRa53c/images/7b4db10a2feab002f758f5e4d124e983b470c25a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFYRa53c/images/7b4db10a2feab002f758f5e4d124e983b470c25a.png","View","2025-06-20T19:55:40.626797Z",{"url":30704,"raw_url":30705,"featured":439,"title":30706,"description":3607,"created":30707,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFYRa53c/images/ed07dc6e2920d497c61a8231cdbb171b85612c87_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFYRa53c/images/ed07dc6e2920d497c61a8231cdbb171b85612c87.png","View 02","2025-06-20T19:56:53.472155Z",16180186,"MSfOf3Hr",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30711,"id":30712,"slug":30713,"project_type":31,"team":30714,"organization":3607,"title":30715,"description":30716,"body":30717,"body_url":3607,"published":30718,"updated":30719,"approved":30720,"queued":30721,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30722,"downloads":30723,"followers":29977,"categories":30724,"additional_categories":30725,"loaders":30726,"versions":30727,"icon_url":30730,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30731,"gallery":30732,"color":30773,"thread_id":30774,"monetization_status":29958},[1058,1025,983,977],"AFjrwDVY","allinone141","B1B2pP80","AllinOne","A modification that adds Biomes, structures, entities, minerals and much more!"," ### BIG UPDATE. GO TRY IT OUT\nHello Everyone, I'm gonna tell you what this mod is going to offer, shortly.\n\n## This mod adds 6 minerals;\n(for now) Ruby, Topaz, Anthracite Coal, Malachite, Ematite and Green Sapphire.\n\nAll these minerals can be found in the overworld, except for the Malachite which can be found both in the overworld and in the Nether.\n\n A biome was added in the latest update:\n ## The Ebony Forest\n Go check the wood out! There are also very diverse structures generating in it, so be prepared for the worst...\n\n## Many achievements \ncan be achieved by crafting various tools and wearing pieces of armor.\n\n## 4 new Entities: 2 Mobs and 2 Creatures\n\n**The Stranded Hellenic Traveler**: A Hellenic Traveler teleported from its dimension in space and time\n\n**The Stranded Hellenic Hoplomachus**: The Chief that controls the other Travelers. He's pretty strong and angry since he doesn't know where he is.\n\n**2 Hellenic Citizens**: They don't have a purpose for now, they are useful for the next update ;)\n\n \n\n\n\nThis is all FOR NOW. See ya soon! :D\n\n \n\nOther versions coming soon!\n\n\nUPDATE: I STARTED AGAIN WORKING IN THIS PROJECT. I HAVE LOTS OF CONTENT TO ADD!\n\n(JEI is suggested for recipes)\n\n(It's not recommended to play the 1.16.5 and even worse the 1.12.2 version of the mod since they were the start of the mod and they are full of bugs and they don't represent the final version of the mod. Play the 1.20 version instead!)\n\nFeel free to write a comment if you need help or if you simply have questions about the mod ;D\n\nI'm currently drowning in coding but I'm full of will to understand some of it\n\nAll textures are the property of the author of the mod. Therefore it's not permitted to use them for other purposes.","2024-02-27T13:40:18.797135Z","2024-07-12T00:34:44.264417Z","2024-02-29T08:41:02.122809Z","2024-02-27T22:42:08.816076Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},348,[115,191,316],[30,100],[354,385],[30728,30729],"1GPXfDrm","3rqGdxrq","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/f32b4956872cc7f9dda7b7ac48a6ddeb3b6c2b94_96.webp",[],[30733,30738,30743,30748,30753,30758,30763,30768],{"url":30734,"raw_url":30735,"featured":439,"title":30736,"description":3607,"created":30737,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/23798c0767ccea10e07f427a49c5e7ce1bb95e51_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/23798c0767ccea10e07f427a49c5e7ce1bb95e51.png","Transition between Oak forest and Ebony Forest","2024-02-27T21:30:29.893316Z",{"url":30739,"raw_url":30740,"featured":439,"title":30741,"description":3607,"created":30742,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/3c1f378d1efbcd28850e715ba48b75091a5a2c9a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/3c1f378d1efbcd28850e715ba48b75091a5a2c9a.png","Mod's minerals from another perspective","2024-02-27T21:22:46.382698Z",{"url":30744,"raw_url":30745,"featured":439,"title":30746,"description":3607,"created":30747,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/50bda6639aa993901e01f62a5245bb24fee6226a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/50bda6639aa993901e01f62a5245bb24fee6226a.png","River between two chunks of Ebony Forest with a Beached Ship","2024-02-27T21:33:50.858730Z",{"url":30749,"raw_url":30750,"featured":439,"title":30751,"description":3607,"created":30752,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/57ff145b772327c32f779248271022e5d0d2585e_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/57ff145b772327c32f779248271022e5d0d2585e.png","Beached Hellenic Ship inside an Ebony Forest","2024-02-27T21:23:23.200243Z",{"url":30754,"raw_url":30755,"featured":439,"title":30756,"description":3607,"created":30757,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/5f5c98057e671d3ef9de902f8c1ffeb3004933d2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/5f5c98057e671d3ef9de902f8c1ffeb3004933d2.png","Beached Hellenic Ship from a water-close perspective","2024-02-27T21:34:51.203184Z",{"url":30759,"raw_url":30760,"featured":439,"title":30761,"description":3607,"created":30762,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/b48e1934649e8cfe0f07bdabedf162112a7e4a48_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/b48e1934649e8cfe0f07bdabedf162112a7e4a48.png","Small pile of Marble inside a cavern","2024-02-27T21:34:23.388791Z",{"url":30764,"raw_url":30765,"featured":439,"title":30766,"description":3607,"created":30767,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/dda6f716278e41c8db5bac7214072e0a0a532378_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/dda6f716278e41c8db5bac7214072e0a0a532378.png","Beached Hellenic Ship from another perspective","2024-02-27T21:29:39.020876Z",{"url":30769,"raw_url":30770,"featured":439,"title":30771,"description":3607,"created":30772,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/f931bc55c55e16ce95d18dced9fae6e95b504dc0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFjrwDVY/images/d0160d8f986e092807bb00f0c8e0f2e15971c1e5.png","The Mod's minerals","2024-02-27T21:22:20.342485Z",394500,"BEvfSNrH",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30776,"id":30777,"slug":30778,"project_type":31,"team":30779,"organization":3607,"title":30780,"description":30781,"body":30782,"body_url":3607,"published":30783,"updated":30784,"approved":30785,"queued":30786,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30787,"downloads":30788,"followers":29977,"categories":30789,"additional_categories":30790,"loaders":30791,"versions":30792,"icon_url":30795,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":30796,"donation_urls":30797,"gallery":30798,"color":30824,"thread_id":30825,"monetization_status":29958},[453],"AFkQc3V3","extrachat","cHtQzQhr","Extra Chat","A Client-side mod that adds configurable extra chats.","# Extra Chat\n\n**Extra Chat** lets you split your chat into custom, filterable tabs — so you never have to scroll through a wall of trade spam to find the whisper you actually cared about.\n\nCreate as many chat windows as you want, each with its own set of rules deciding exactly which messages land in it. Every tab is a fully independent, movable, resizable HUD box that lives right alongside your normal chat.\n\n***\n\n## How It Works\n\n1.  Open **Mod Menu** → **Extra Chat** → **Configure**\n2.  Click **\\+ Add Tab** and give it a name\n3.  Add one or more filter rules (e.g. `Contains: /msg` to catch private messages, or `Contains: [Staff]` for staff chat)\n4.  Choose whether matched messages should also show in normal chat (**Show in All**)\n5.  Customize the tab's color, opacity, and border in **🎨 Appearance**\n6.  Position and resize your tabs from **HUD Pos**\n7.  Hit **Save & Close** — your new tab is live immediately\n\n***\n\n## Requirements\n\n| Requirement   |Version                                            |\n| ------------- |-------------------------------------------------- |\n| Minecraft     |26.2                                               |\n| Fabric Loader |0.19.3+                                            |\n| Fabric API    |Required                                           |\n| Mod Menu      |Optional, but required for the in-game settings UI |\n| Java          |25+                                                |\n\n> This mod is **client-side only**. It does not need to be installed on servers, and installing it won't affect other players.\n\n***\n\n## FAQ\n\n**Does this replace my normal chat?** No — your normal Minecraft chat still works exactly as before. Extra Chat adds separate, additional chat windows alongside it.\n\n**Can I use this on servers I don't run?** Yes. Since it's entirely client-side, you can use it on any server without needing permission or server-side installation.\n\n**Can I hide a tab's border completely?** Yes — turn off \"Show border\" in a tab's Appearance settings and only the message text will render, with no title bar, icon, or outline.\n\n**Can I use this mod in my modpack?** Yes, of course you can use Extra Chat in your modpack.\n\n***\n\n## Found a Bug or Have a Suggestion?\n\nPlease report issues or feature requests through the our Discord.","2026-07-02T08:20:36.585578Z","2026-07-24T11:10:26.260385Z","2026-07-17T16:29:06.915093Z","2026-07-11T13:28:46.104901Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},22,[275,303],[175],[346],[30793,30794],"3MDFmQlA","SdTAM826","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/c380361ba68975a029b51256479e57d7be5b01fa_96.webp","https://discord.gg/PcYPhcsTtS",[],[30799,30804,30809,30814,30819],{"url":30800,"raw_url":30801,"featured":439,"title":30802,"description":3607,"created":30803,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/04002ea75acc24418b546cc28d25cbf272b50be9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/04002ea75acc24418b546cc28d25cbf272b50be9.png","Chat Tab Settings","2026-07-24T11:37:35.734793Z",{"url":30805,"raw_url":30806,"featured":439,"title":30807,"description":3607,"created":30808,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/4e98a39671c768a102e1324abbffd372a395dc87_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/4e98a39671c768a102e1324abbffd372a395dc87.png","In-Game Preview","2026-07-24T11:36:09.381037Z",{"url":30810,"raw_url":30811,"featured":439,"title":30812,"description":3607,"created":30813,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/c10b50fbe7fd25b7837f600c8ed51c1364a90bf3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/c10b50fbe7fd25b7837f600c8ed51c1364a90bf3.png","Chat Tab Edit Screen","2026-07-24T11:38:01.743840Z",{"url":30815,"raw_url":30816,"featured":439,"title":30817,"description":3607,"created":30818,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/c78e1de8354fd806c0949dc1d45333ad6dfb7dbd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/c78e1de8354fd806c0949dc1d45333ad6dfb7dbd.png","Extra Chat Main Tabs Screen","2026-07-24T11:37:07.613404Z",{"url":30820,"raw_url":30821,"featured":439,"title":30822,"description":3607,"created":30823,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/d5464f91beeac142b17c2752076d713e048fc4cc_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFkQc3V3/images/d5464f91beeac142b17c2752076d713e048fc4cc.png","Extra Chat General Settings","2026-07-24T11:36:42.766Z",3684408,"B1knBPB9",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30827,"id":30828,"slug":30829,"project_type":34,"team":30830,"organization":3607,"title":30831,"description":30832,"body":30833,"body_url":3607,"published":30834,"updated":30835,"approved":30836,"queued":30837,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30838,"downloads":30839,"followers":29977,"categories":30840,"additional_categories":30841,"loaders":30842,"versions":30843,"icon_url":30857,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30858,"gallery":30859,"color":30860,"thread_id":30861,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AGChAo8N","billocraft","1sMi5QEo","Billocraft","Explore an improved version of vanilla minecraft with quality of life features, rather simple content expansion and optimization","![Billocraft Banner image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a132357dc80a0e933705a38e1f6d1a590db8b20c.png)\n\n# Quests \nThere are more mods in the pack but these are the features you need to actively know of.\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>English\u003C/summary>\n\n🛠️[Reforge your weapons and armor](https://modrinth.com/mod/tieredz)\n\n💍[Find many artifacts](https://modrinth.com/mod/artifacts)\n\n📦[Use a storage system](https://modrinth.com/mod/toms-storage)\n\n✈️[Fly with a hang glider](https://modrinth.com/mod/hang-glider)\n\n🛋️Decorate using cosmetic elements: [furniture](https://modrinth.com/mod/another-furniture), [plushies](https://modrinth.com/mod/plushie), [sawmill](https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-sawmill), [connectible chains](https://modrinth.com/mod/connectiblechains), [trims for tools](https://modrinth.com/mod/trimmable-tools), [rollercoasters](https://modrinth.com/mod/splinecart) and [more stone variants](https://modrinth.com/mod/stoneworks)\n\n🎵[Play custom music](https://modrinth.com/mod/vinurl) and [dance](https://modrinth.com/mod/emotecraft)\n\n🗝️[Discover enhanced trial chambers](https://modrinth.com/datapack/lukis-crazy-chambers) and other improved vanilla structures \n\n🔮[Upgrade your enchantments (Sharpness VI, Protection V, ...)](https://modrinth.com/mod/illager-invasion)\n--> (1) Kill _Invoker_ in Woodland Mansion; (2) Craft _Imbuing Table_; (3) Play raids for _Hallowed Gems_\n\n👹[Defeat new bosses for unique rewards](https://modrinth.com/mod/bosses-of-mass-destruction)\n\n**🔒The following features can be temporarily locked to slow progression on a server:**\n\u003Cbr>\n\n🔥[Explore the nether with new biomes](https://modrinth.com/mod/incendium) as well as [items and structures](https://modrinth.com/mod/eternal-nether)\n\n🏰[Get shulker boxes in new dungeons in the desert]([https://modrinth.com/mod/dungeonz](https://modrinth.com/mod/desert-dungeon-dungeonz-addon))\n\n🌀[Upgrade your netherite gear in a new warden dimension](https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker)\n\n🧀[Enter the end to fight a stronger dragon](https://modrinth.com/mod/true-ending)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>German\u003C/summary>\n\n🛠️[Reforge deine Waffen und Rüstung](https://modrinth.com/mod/tieredz)\n\n💍[Finde viele Artefakte](https://modrinth.com/mod/artifacts)\n\n📦[Benutze ein Lagersystem](https://modrinth.com/mod/toms-storage)\n\n✈️[Fliege mit einem Hängegleiter](https://modrinth.com/mod/hang-glider)\n\n🛋️Nutze Dekoration: [Möbel](https://modrinth.com/mod/another-furniture), [plushies](https://modrinth.com/mod/plushie), [sawmill](https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-sawmill), [verbundene Ketten](https://modrinth.com/mod/connectiblechains), [trims auf tools](https://modrinth.com/mod/trimmable-tools), [Achterbahnen](https://modrinth.com/mod/splinecart) und [mehr Steinvarianten](https://modrinth.com/mod/stoneworks)\n\n🎵[Spiele eigene Musik](https://modrinth.com/mod/vinurl) und [tanze](https://modrinth.com/mod/emotecraft)\n\n🗝️[Finde überarbeitete trial chambers](https://modrinth.com/datapack/lukis-crazy-chambers) und andere verbesserte vanilla Strukuren\n\n🔮[Verbessere deine Verzauberungen (Sharpness VI, Protection V, ...)](https://modrinth.com/mod/illager-invasion)\n--> (1) Töte _Invoker_ in Woodland Mansion; (2) Crafte _Imbuing Table_; (3) Spiele Raids für _Hallowed Gems_\n\n👹[Besiege neue Bosse für besondere Belohnungen](https://modrinth.com/mod/bosses-of-mass-destruction)\n\n**🔒Die folgenden Funktionen können vorübergehend gesperrt werden, um den Fortschritt auf einem Server zu verlangsamen:**\n\u003Cbr>\n\n🔥[Erkunde den Nether mit neuen Biomen](https://modrinth.com/mod/incendium) und [Items und Strukturen](https://modrinth.com/mod/eternal-nether)\n\n🏰[Erhalte Shulker-Kisten durch neue Dungeons in der Wüste](https://modrinth.com/mod/desert-dungeon-dungeonz-addon)\n\n🌀[Verbessere dein Netherite-Equip in einer neuen Warden-Dimension](https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker)\n\n🧀[Betrete das End, um gegen einen stärkeren Drachen zu kämpfen](https://modrinth.com/mod/true-ending)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cbr>\n\n\n## How to lock/unlock features:\n\nHas to be configured serverside or just for singleplayer\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Nether\u003C/summary>\n  \n**Lock:** Use command \"/noportals disableNetherPortal true\".\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Unlock:** Use command \"/noportals disableNetherPortal false\".\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Explanation:** Allows the creation of nether portals but playes will be unable to enter the dimension.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>End\u003C/summary>\n  \n**Lock:** Open \"config/item_obliterator.json5\" and remove the two slashes (\"//\") at the beginning of the line with \"minecraft:ender_eye\".\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Unlock:** Just add the dashes again.\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Explanation:** This makes it impossible to right click ender eyes, which are necessary to find the stronghold and open the portal.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Warden Dimension\u003C/summary>\n  \n**Lock:** Open \"config/item_obliterator.json5\" and remove the two slashes (\"//\") at the beginning of the line with \"deeperdarker:heart_of_the_deep\".\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Unlock:** Just add the dashes again.\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Explanation:** This makes it impossible to obtain the \"Heart of the Deep\", which is necessary to open the portal.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Dungeons for shulker boxes\u003C/summary>\n\n**Lock:** Open \"config\\paxi\\datapacks\\desert_dungeon_dp\\data\\dungeonz\\dungeon\\desert_dungeon.json\" and add \" \"minecraft:dragon_egg\": 2 \" in the empty line for \"hard\" in \"required\" at the botton.\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Unlock:** Just remove the added line\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cbr>\n\n**Explanation:** This sets two dragon eggs as the required items to enter a dungeon and those are impossible to obtain.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n## Why should you use this modpack?\nThis modpack enhances the vanilla experience by optimizing the game, including many quality of life features and expanding the content. It is great for vanilla+ singleplayer and servers because it is simple to understand and not overwhelming while also adding more vanilla like aspects and progression.\n","2024-05-17T21:53:00.059132Z","2025-08-23T12:15:04.388230Z","2024-05-21T04:52:54.433117Z","2024-05-17T22:10:11.661134Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},446,[30,211,240],[77,200],[346],[30844,30845,30846,30847,30848,30849,30850,30851,30852,30853,30854,30855,30856],"LKYWpR8K","l1yGZAOC","LIKOL9ot","LWA5hsIU","r3YZPIXR","YtkHpequ","BhM7V2NZ","pVpzm2AD","XqIij4KT","x97qKta6","gQf2whhE","OpSczR05","VAZa29wZ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGChAo8N/08b5674b90f2e3e29a11043f4c43bd016871370f.png",[],[],15641451,"4Zp5xWNY",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30863,"id":30864,"slug":30865,"project_type":31,"team":30866,"organization":3607,"title":30867,"description":30868,"body":30869,"body_url":3607,"published":30870,"updated":30871,"approved":30872,"queued":3607,"status":29919,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30873,"downloads":30876,"followers":30788,"categories":30877,"additional_categories":30878,"loaders":30879,"versions":30880,"icon_url":30888,"issues_url":30889,"source_url":30890,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30891,"gallery":30892,"color":30905,"thread_id":30864,"monetization_status":29958},[1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,808,805],"AFsM7rYp","chunkmap","lXxgWlob","ChunkMap","A Minecraft mod to visualize chunk loading & generation.","# ChunkMap\n\nIn the map, a chunk is displayed as a quad with a color which provides some information.\n\n### Basic Operations\n\n- L : Switch to chunk loading viewer mode.\n\n- G : Switch to chunk generation viewer mode.\n\n- T : Switch to ticket vierer mode.\n\n- E : Toggle the entity overlay.\n\n- W,A,S and D : Move the center of the map.If one of these keys are pressed while the Alt key is down,the center of the map will be moved to 16 instead of 1 chunks away.\n\n- M : Open a dialog where you can move the center of the map to a given chunkpos.\n- H : Help.\n- 0 : Move to the Nether\n\n- 1 : Move to the Overworld.\n\n- 2 : Move to the End.\n- Double click a chunk : Get more information about the chunk,or load the chunk to a given level (31,or entity processing bydefault).\n\n\n### Known Problems\n\n- The MSPT it uses up may be too high(about 12).\n\n- If you want to interact with the window of the map,it is necessary to open the game to the LAN (Maybe it can never be fixed).\n\n- The manually loaded chunks may fail to be unloaded beacuse of a problem related to the synchornization of the ticket list.","2022-12-26T17:54:57.344332Z","2025-01-26T13:51:31.791337Z","2022-12-26T20:27:07.720663Z",{"id":30874,"name":30875,"url":3607},"CC0-1.0","Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal",10678,[134,303],[],[346],[30881,30882,30883,30884,30885,30886,30887],"NEDZ40Oi","mnVyLH3h","9KeQuSgc","etZoRroA","aZ5JuRXV","EbGT4vsB","SBznREKR","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFsM7rYp/c86ca50326f59b20a68ae39b620402e4bed6b02b_96.webp","https://github.com/lovexyn0827/Chunkmap/issues","https://github.com/lovexyn0827/Chunkmap",[],[30893,30897,30901],{"url":30894,"raw_url":30894,"featured":439,"title":30895,"description":3607,"created":30896,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFsM7rYp/images/5e82725482c07f8dc0a25ea5e44564b92ba8f4ef.png","Map","2022-12-26T18:35:40.291573Z",{"url":30898,"raw_url":30898,"featured":439,"title":30899,"description":3607,"created":30900,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFsM7rYp/images/6f94950fdea4305614c7fc40c7a627d00e9afef1.png","Help","2022-12-26T18:37:33.720248Z",{"url":30902,"raw_url":30902,"featured":439,"title":30903,"description":3607,"created":30904,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFsM7rYp/images/acf2596fe6797eb9d669a841e432e48d38f0ccf8.png","Chunk info","2022-12-26T18:36:56.368126Z",6052956,{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":30907,"id":30908,"slug":30909,"project_type":31,"team":30910,"organization":3607,"title":30911,"description":30912,"body":30913,"body_url":3607,"published":30914,"updated":30915,"approved":30916,"queued":30917,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30918,"downloads":30919,"followers":30333,"categories":30920,"additional_categories":30921,"loaders":30922,"versions":30923,"icon_url":30927,"issues_url":30928,"source_url":30929,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30930,"gallery":30935,"color":30940,"thread_id":30941,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AGaikMLU","cobblemon-quick-item-swap","BucTaD0s","Cobblemon Quick Item Swap","Add quick held item switching function to Cobblemon's PC","# Cobblemon Quick Item Swap\n\nThis mod adds faster held item management directly inside Cobblemon's PC screen.\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Open a Cobblemon PC.\n2. Click the inventory button added to the PC interface.\n3. Pick up an item from your inventory panel.\n4. Right-click a Pokémon in the PC or party area to swap its held item.\n5. Close the PC normally when finished.\n\n![Short GIF about quick inserting held item for Cobblemon PC](https://media4.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExeG8wMGR0YnJrZGp6ZnRjMWY3eG03Ync3YzUxYTl6a3hqdjI2d2JqMiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/IROmr809EEAvihTlbw/giphy.gif)\n\n## Dependencies\nOnly Cobblemon\n\n## Bugs???\nPlease report them in the github issue page","2026-05-31T09:13:58.246629Z","2026-07-04T20:43:08.256910Z","2026-06-01T22:13:21.741198Z","2026-05-31T10:30:57.791442Z",{"id":30330,"name":30331,"url":3607},3365,[175],[30,279],[346],[30924,30925,30926],"QJ77Muul","kQKZtmd8","SOCpGkYW","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGaikMLU/8ccbc7f876f44474d36a0df4a457ded676d0c33b_96.webp","https://github.com/domanhthang2110/cobblemon-quick-item-switcher/issues","https://github.com/domanhthang2110/cobblemon-quick-item-switcher",[30931,30933],{"id":3164,"platform":3165,"url":30932},"https://ko-fi.com/yukamineesan",{"id":3158,"platform":30399,"url":30934},"https://paypal.me/yukamineesan",[30936],{"url":30937,"raw_url":30937,"featured":864,"title":30938,"description":3607,"created":30939,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGaikMLU/images/ac3348278f3deb75444c3933ce78fe05828f35f2.gif","The mod in action","2026-05-31T10:30:54.292343Z",5480558,"Cn5SWaa0",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30943,"id":30944,"slug":30945,"project_type":12,"team":30946,"organization":3607,"title":30947,"description":30948,"body":30949,"body_url":3607,"published":30950,"updated":30951,"approved":30952,"queued":30953,"status":29920,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30954,"downloads":30955,"followers":30386,"categories":30956,"additional_categories":30957,"loaders":30958,"versions":30959,"icon_url":30962,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":30963,"gallery":30964,"color":30977,"thread_id":30978,"monetization_status":29958},[905,899,862],"AFesFvJl","simple-3d-lantern","AJCzARsq","Simple 3D Lantern","A pack that simply add new lantern item model","This is a simple resource pack that adds a new lantern model for the vanilla version of Minecraft.\n\nThis does not require OptiFine.","2024-04-23T23:09:15.891460Z","2024-07-26T17:19:00.041041Z","2024-04-24T07:15:45.759611Z","2024-04-23T23:19:32.463031Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},2300,[15,148,307],[],[377],[30960,30961],"VXyOImim","9YnS7YvT","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/e85ec897d594b83567c7c976b5cc779aed278fe6_96.webp",[],[30965,30969,30973],{"url":30966,"raw_url":30967,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30968,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/1b5081c01c05857198e7cc0766ca1e3bf04618ff_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/7424f84f6f6220eda63f3ac34311fe9a0e701920.png","2024-04-23T23:17:01.515835Z",{"url":30970,"raw_url":30971,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30972,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/75dcd3a2515b9f9f3d263c73826e9b5b81f60ae8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/75dcd3a2515b9f9f3d263c73826e9b5b81f60ae8.png","2024-04-23T23:17:12.289823Z",{"url":30974,"raw_url":30975,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":30976,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/f644db9acb897c042d6489f731d0711e6968c1ac_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFesFvJl/images/f644db9acb897c042d6489f731d0711e6968c1ac.png","2024-04-23T23:17:07.244785Z",2247762,"cSNzkcXG",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":30980,"id":30981,"slug":30982,"project_type":31,"team":30983,"organization":3607,"title":30984,"description":30985,"body":30986,"body_url":3607,"published":30987,"updated":30988,"approved":30989,"queued":30990,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":30991,"downloads":30992,"followers":30024,"categories":30993,"additional_categories":30994,"loaders":30995,"versions":30996,"icon_url":31023,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31024,"gallery":31025,"color":31048,"thread_id":31049,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574],"AGIBprpU","kill-effects-fx","sYrbRyWx","Kill Effects","Adds client sided kill effects and custom critical hit particles","# KillFX\n\n![general](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4fdd24a540c92a438eaddda24a648ed81eeb924_0.webp)\n\n**Fully client-side, ridiculously customizable kill effects for Minecraft.**\n\nTrigger **real lightning**, **3D skin-matched ghosts**, **custom PNG particles**, **fireworks**, **shockwaves**, and more the instant something dies — plus fully customizable **critical hit particles** and **hit sounds**.\n\n**No server install. No packets. Works on any server.**\n\n> Fabric • 1.21.4 • 1.21.10 • 1.21.11 • Java 21\n\n---\n\n## What is KillFX?\n\nKillFX is a fully client-side cosmetic mod that plays visual effects whenever an entity dies.\n\nEverything is rendered locally on your client:\n\n- No server installation required\n- No packets sent\n- No gameplay changes\n- Safe to use on any multiplayer server\n\nRather than being a single effect, KillFX is a complete customization toolkit with editable presets, entity filters, custom particles, and sound effects.\n\n---\n\n# Kill Effects\n\nCreate anything from simple kill flashes to over-the-top cinematic effects.\n\n### Included Effects\n\n- **Real Lightning**\n  - Spawns a client-side `minecraft:lightning_bolt`\n  - Uses vanilla lightning visuals and thunder\n  - No damage or fire\n\n- **3D Ghosts**\n  - Creates a translucent, skin-matched ghost of the victim\n  - Floats upward and fades away\n\n- **Custom PNG Particles**\n  - Import your own PNG images\n  - Render them as custom billboard particles\n\n- **Additional Effects**\n  - Fireworks\n  - Particle bursts\n  - Shockwaves\n  - Floating text\n  - And more\n\n### Advanced Customization\n\n![Effects](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ff685b6964a7797f14c562dc7097ca88628df96_0.webp)\n\nEvery effect supports:\n\n- Full RGB color control\n- Size scaling\n- Particle count\n- Lifetime\n- Motion settings\n- Gravity\n- Glow effects\n- Trails\n- Additive blending\n\n### Presets\n\nIncludes built-in presets such as:\n\n- PvP\n- Cosmic\n- Fire\n- Lightning\n- Minimal\n\nOr create your own from scratch.\n\n### Filters\n\nOnly trigger effects when:\n\n- Players die\n- Mobs die\n- Specific entities die\n- Custom conditions are met\n\n---\n\n# Critical Hits\n\nReplace Minecraft's vanilla crit particle with your own custom design.\n\n### Custom PNG Crit Particles\n\n![Crits](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/395b64f4ddbf8702515a43017c037ad394acbc37_0.webp)\n\nImport any PNG and customize:\n\n- Size\n- Opacity\n- Particle count\n- Rotation\n- RGB colors\n- Rainbow mode\n- Additive blending\n- Trails\n- Gravity\n- Spread\n\nIncludes a one-click **\"Match Vanilla\"** option.\n\n### Configuration Tabs\n\n- Setup\n- Appearance\n- Motion\n- Texture\n\n---\n\n# Hit Sounds\n\nPlay a custom sound whenever you land a hit.\n\n### Features\n\n- Choose from built-in sounds\n- Import your own `.ogg` files\n- Volume control\n- Pitch control\n- Crit-only playback\n- ▶ Sound preview button\n\n### Vanilla Sound Override\n\nMute Minecraft's default hit and crit sounds so your custom sound completely replaces them.\n\n---\n\n# Share Your Setup\n\nExport and import your entire configuration.\n\nIncludes:\n\n- Global settings\n- All presets\n- Effect configurations\n- Crit particle settings\n- Sound settings\n\nConfigurations can be copied directly to the clipboard or saved to a file for easy sharing.\n\n---\n\n# Quality & Compatibility\n\n### Built for Multiple Versions\n\nSupports:\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.4\n- Minecraft 1.21.10\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n\nAll versions are built from a single source using proper production mappings.\n\n### Modern Codebase\n\n- Java 21\n- Fabric\n- Mixins\n- Tested before release\n\n### Easy Configuration\n\nAccess settings through:\n\n- A dedicated keybind\n- Mod Menu integration\n\n---\n\n# Installation\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Fabric Loader 0.16+\n- Fabric API\n\n### Steps\n\n1. Install Fabric Loader and Fabric API for your Minecraft version.\n2. Download the matching `killfx-\u003Cversion>+\u003Cmc>.jar` from the latest release.\n3. Place the file inside your `mods/` folder.\n4. Launch Minecraft.\n\n### Optional\n\nInstall Mod Menu for quick access from the Mods screen, or assign the KillFX keybind in Controls.\n\n---\n\n**Create anything from subtle PvP effects to complete visual chaos — all client-side, all customizable, and compatible with any server.**","2026-06-04T18:42:54.802925Z","2026-06-16T22:48:31.925208Z","2026-06-07T04:43:04.679349Z","2026-06-05T00:02:13.114818Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},1194,[100,134,303],[171],[346],[30997,30998,30999,31000,31001,31002,31003,31004,31005,31006,31007,31008,31009,31010,31011,31012,31013,31014,31015,31016,31017,31018,31019,31020,31021,31022],"rjVw95Ol","5gkDNIb3","N8Th7P8X","bRNuTtVh","Ik07D8V6","GITi62VK","yI9sqok6","vPNrdOql","gqIZcSSL","ip39pkNq","pBNV19gD","taY0Sj7o","KsTgRzMR","3Ss9PhOw","hNbaPy46","qjh3Vr9B","2yf90nDF","QmpY7MUx","RvkzxQfm","hlj31cJA","3trhP8uO","CSs3hJG8","qRVehT5f","GCyMOBkd","eqwXBSPp","OOTPFVAr","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/5bbefaa29884667b3b417b86e59d9860637d90d8.jpeg",[],[31026,31030,31035,31039,31044],{"url":31027,"raw_url":31028,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31029,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/395b64f4ddbf8702515a43017c037ad394acbc37_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/395b64f4ddbf8702515a43017c037ad394acbc37.png","2026-06-08T22:16:04.339149Z",{"url":31031,"raw_url":31032,"featured":439,"title":31033,"description":3607,"created":31034,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/4b3001bad6314d713f12155d81321d6691c0d8de_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/4b3001bad6314d713f12155d81321d6691c0d8de.png","Custom crit particles","2026-06-05T00:03:01.560379Z",{"url":31036,"raw_url":31037,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31038,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/4ff685b6964a7797f14c562dc7097ca88628df96_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/4ff685b6964a7797f14c562dc7097ca88628df96.png","2026-06-08T22:15:57.592339Z",{"url":31040,"raw_url":31041,"featured":864,"title":31042,"description":3607,"created":31043,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/9ce399f8922a19942abd63cb0d34cf5617172be4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/9ce399f8922a19942abd63cb0d34cf5617172be4.png","ghost kill effect and shockwave","2026-06-04T19:42:37.154891Z",{"url":31045,"raw_url":31046,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31047,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/a4fdd24a540c92a438eaddda24a648ed81eeb924_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGIBprpU/images/a4fdd24a540c92a438eaddda24a648ed81eeb924.png","2026-06-08T22:16:14.299979Z",7285930,"EttvLaSn",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31051,"id":31052,"slug":31053,"project_type":12,"team":31054,"organization":3607,"title":31055,"description":31056,"body":31057,"body_url":3607,"published":31058,"updated":31059,"approved":31060,"queued":31061,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31062,"downloads":31063,"followers":29946,"categories":31064,"additional_categories":31065,"loaders":31066,"versions":31067,"icon_url":31069,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31070,"gallery":31071,"color":31072,"thread_id":31073,"monetization_status":29958},[2186,2180,2177,2120,2111,2102,1943,1919,1910,1793,1784,1769,1754,1730,1661,1655,1646,1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502,453],"AGBqPawV","3d-chiken-totem","rfThTU29","Chiken Totem","This resource pack replaces the regular totem with a сhiken!","## ****\"3D TotemChiken\"**** is a resource pack that replaces the immortality totem with a 3D Chiken\n\n> ###     What does it change?\n>\n> - Replaces the texture of the immortality totem with a 3D Chiken model.\n> - Changes the sound of the Totem of Immortality to a rooster crowing.\n> - Supports all versions starting from 1.11\n\n> ###       Important\n>\n> - This resource pack is not compatible with the [Small Totem Pop](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/small-totem-pop/), [Small Totem Pops](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/small-totem-pops/), [Small Totem Render](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/small-totem-render/), [Small Totem Overlay](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/small-totem-overlay/), [small totem pop1](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/small-totem-pop1) resource pack (model conflict)","2025-08-05T07:52:56.040759Z","2025-08-05T08:04:05.480466Z","2025-08-07T06:32:41.089238Z","2025-08-05T08:06:20.456087Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},553,[19,50,197],[77,115,245,307],[377],[31068],"ohHDQppU","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGBqPawV/b1bfb5526a9b13c37e3985dc940719a7981f3c97_96.webp",[],[],9472430,"SmRxcWD8",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31075,"id":31076,"slug":31077,"project_type":31,"team":31078,"organization":31079,"title":31080,"description":31081,"body":31082,"body_url":3607,"published":31083,"updated":31084,"approved":31085,"queued":31086,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31087,"downloads":31088,"followers":30024,"categories":31089,"additional_categories":31090,"loaders":31091,"versions":31092,"icon_url":31110,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":31111,"discord_url":31112,"donation_urls":31113,"gallery":31116,"color":31129,"thread_id":31130,"monetization_status":29958},[2957,2954,2951,2948,2945,1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502,453],"AHAls57P","core-teams","XMcYePst","i9L3BnCN","Core Teams","CoreTeams is a lightweight, modern, and highly configurable team management plugin designed for Spigot/Paper servers (1.20+). It features unique gradient-based team visuals, string-based IDs for custom team names, and a comprehensive admin GUI.","# CoreTeams (CoreSeries)\n\n**CoreTeams** is a lightweight, modern, and highly configurable team management plugin designed for Spigot/Paper servers (1.20+). Built with a focus on professional aesthetics and performance, it provides a seamless experience for both players and administrators through its \"Elegant Midnight\" design language.\n\n## Features\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **VISUAL IDENTITY**\nEvery team is assigned a unique, persistent RGB gradient based on their ID. These visuals are automatically applied to chat messages and tab-lists, ensuring your team stands out with a premium feel.\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **STRING-BASED IDS**\nBreak away from generic numbering. Teams can use custom text IDs like `Admins`, `Red-Rebels`, or `Pros`. Perfect for roleplay or competitive environments.\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **ADMINISTRATIVE SUITE**\nManage the entire server's team structure via `/teamadmin`. The intuitive GUI allows admins to monitor members, teleport to players, and disband teams with a single click.\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **TOGGLEABLE MODULES**\n*   **Global PVP**: Toggle team-based PVP dynamics instantly.\n*   **Creation Control**: Restrict team creation to specific ranks or disable it globally.\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **COMMUNICATION & UTILITIES**\n*   **Invitation System**: Professional click-to-accept chat prompts.\n*   **Team Chat**: Private channel for strategic coordination (`/tc`).\n*   **Location Ping**: Broadcast your coordinates to teammates with a resonant sound effect.\n*   **Voice Integration**: Native support for **Simple Voice Chat** group synchronization.\n\n### **CORETEAMS** » **DATA & INTEGRATIONS**\n*   **Persistence**: All data is saved securely to `teams.yml` or SQLite.\n*   **PlaceholderAPI**: Full support for custom placeholders in scoreboards/tab-lists.\n*   **Version Checker**: Stay updated with automatic Modrinth version notifications.\n\n## Placeholders\n\n- %coreteams_team% : The raw team name/ID (e.g. `12`)\n- %coreteams_prefix% : The team prefix formatted with legacy color codes (e.g. `§x§f§f§5§5§5§5[12]§r`)\n- %coreteams_prefix_modern% : The team prefix formatted with modern MiniMessage tags (e.g. `\u003Cgradient:#ff5555:#ffaa00>[12]\u003C/gradient>\u003Creset>`)\n- %coreteams_color% : The team's raw color/gradient code (e.g. `\u003Cgradient:#ff5555:#ffaa00>`)\n- %coreteams_members% : Number of players in the team (e.g. `3`)\n- %coreteams_team_size% : Number of players in the team (e.g. `3`)\n- %coreteams_is_leader% : Returns `Yes` or `No` depending on if the player is team leader\n- %coreteams_sort% : Sorting key for TAB/scoreboard configurations (e.g. `01_0012_1`)\n  \n## Commands\n\n### Player Commands\n*   `/team create \u003Cname>` » Establish a new team\n*   `/team invite \u003Cplayer>` » Invite a player to join\n*   `/team join \u003Cid>` » Join an existing team\n*   `/team leave` » Depart from your current team\n*   `/team disband` » Dissolve the team (Leader only)\n*   `/team ping` » Alert teammates to your location\n*   `/tc \u003Cmessage>` » Send a message to team chat\n\n### Admin Commands\n*   `/teamadmin` » Open the Management GUI\n*   `/teamadmin setid \u003Cp> \u003Cid>` » Force player into a team\n*   `/teamadmin pvp \u003Con|off>` » Toggle global PVP status\n\n## Configuration\n\n```yaml\n# CoreTeams | Professional Configuration\n\n# Generation: SEQUENTIAL (001) or RANDOM (842)\ngeneration-mode: RANDOM\n\n# Gameplay Dynamics\npvp-enabled: true\ncreation-enabled: true\nallow-custom-names: true\n\n# Visual Branding\nvisuals:\n  prefix-mode: true # [ID] Name vs Name [ID]\n\n# Messaging System (MiniMessage Supported)\nmessages:\n  prefix: \"\u003Cbold>\u003C#F8F9FA>CORETEAMS\u003C/#F8F9FA>\u003C/bold> \u003C#636E72>»\u003C/#636E72> \"\n  no-team: \"\u003C#D63031>You are not currently in a team.\"\n  success: \"\u003C#55EFC4>Action completed successfully.\"\n```\n[![bStats](https://bstats.org/signatures/bukkit/CoreTeams.svg)](https://bstats.org/plugin/bukkit/CoreTeams/29852)","2026-02-03T21:20:24.082457Z","2026-07-11T16:06:19.436943Z","2026-02-04T01:34:44.038656Z","2026-02-03T21:33:35.309311Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},1347,[134,175,275],[100,105,185,288],[329,350,401,405,417],[31093,31094,31095,31096,31097,31098,31099,31100,31101,31102,31103,31104,31105,31106,31107,31108,31109],"mpqHYiOO","8eyAp3N8","xqUOiJVj","VCyDn2hk","tLmQZ8HI","FlVT4yrn","i44K3yyT","KM4S4mbb","dcIvlgUy","5ugSHxzx","BBISECsg","Bhsg5V5v","zcKC1kyj","uZyaIKo2","EFgy9pQ1","MTG28poN","PrsDWCRn","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHAls57P/fa0eea6aa77665262e76874635b1584c7b9a42c0_96.webp","https://vexcore.the-best.uk/docs/coreteams","https://discord.gg/zwj5sEbmDs",[31114],{"id":3152,"platform":3153,"url":31115},"https://www.patreon.com/cw/vxcore",[31117,31121,31125],{"url":31118,"raw_url":31118,"featured":864,"title":31119,"description":3607,"created":31120,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHAls57P/images/202aa973718cfb866936b99b5889dbc7d70c90c9.png","Team manger","2026-02-03T21:23:53.241284Z",{"url":31122,"raw_url":31122,"featured":439,"title":31123,"description":3607,"created":31124,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHAls57P/images/b5290436e1895285bebb051e470ed65faeaffa52.png","Admin Gui","2026-02-03T21:23:44.472713Z",{"url":31126,"raw_url":31126,"featured":439,"title":31127,"description":3607,"created":31128,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AHAls57P/images/bfb39849f3a16d33a28c1b9e2ffba92b1cc00bf3.png","Gradient Team Number","2026-02-03T21:23:26.195671Z",263172,"zeAbPhh2",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31132,"id":31133,"slug":31134,"project_type":12,"team":31135,"organization":3607,"title":31136,"description":31137,"body":31138,"body_url":3607,"published":31139,"updated":31140,"approved":31141,"queued":31142,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31143,"downloads":31144,"followers":30386,"categories":31145,"additional_categories":31146,"loaders":31147,"versions":31148,"icon_url":31152,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31153,"gallery":31154,"color":31180,"thread_id":31181,"monetization_status":29958},[625,619,574],"AG6UyI1k","alya-kujou","LOTLH9R5","Alya Kujou","A Fanmade Pack By Ray Senpai 🌟","Alya 16x Texture Pack\nby Ray Senpai\n\n• Custom UI & GUI\n\n• Custom Low Fire\n\n• Custom Ender Pearl\n\n• Custom Golden Apple\n\n• Custom Sky\n\n• No Explosion Particles\n\n• No Eating Particles\n\n• Custom Armour\n\n• Custom Items\n\nClean. Smooth. Competitive.\n\nIf you don’t download Alya 16x, you’re missing a next-level Minecraft experience.\n\nPerfect for PvP.\nPerfect for Anime lovers.\nPerfect for Clean gameplay.\n\n🔥 Made by Ray Senpai/Aki Senpai\n📺 YouTube: Shadow Ray Senpai\n\nDownload now — don’t be the one who skips this pack.","2026-01-01T14:20:58.416566Z","2026-03-19T16:21:16.843281Z","2026-01-05T03:33:56.187658Z","2026-01-02T08:40:07.335340Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},8776,[57,77,139],[],[377],[31149,31150,31151],"XvKuptxl","xrhMr5BL","SBF27bo5","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/14bcfc96b688865ee48a9d8264436c0b87f18d04.gif",[],[31155,31160,31165,31170,31175],{"url":31156,"raw_url":31157,"featured":439,"title":31158,"description":3607,"created":31159,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/8e04ce5a0b2ae4afe4ca891e97605b64712a84c7_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/8e04ce5a0b2ae4afe4ca891e97605b64712a84c7.png","Day Sky 1","2026-01-01T14:22:02.328426Z",{"url":31161,"raw_url":31162,"featured":439,"title":31163,"description":3607,"created":31164,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/4f6e3baffecd2a8e61f73c571c163210f7eed657_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/4f6e3baffecd2a8e61f73c571c163210f7eed657.png","Day Sky 2","2026-01-01T14:22:38.505327Z",{"url":31166,"raw_url":31167,"featured":439,"title":31168,"description":3607,"created":31169,"ordering":30024},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/d3aad207f1f34be9a8bc0a9f40ed69e8b2720a0a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/d3aad207f1f34be9a8bc0a9f40ed69e8b2720a0a.png","Night Sky 1","2026-01-01T14:23:17.125176Z",{"url":31171,"raw_url":31172,"featured":439,"title":31173,"description":3607,"created":31174,"ordering":30103},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/7dfc79e43a5df7302eb7d4f276c06db74611ba86_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/7dfc79e43a5df7302eb7d4f276c06db74611ba86.png","Night Sky 2","2026-01-01T14:23:47.311460Z",{"url":31176,"raw_url":31177,"featured":864,"title":31178,"description":3607,"created":31179,"ordering":30480},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/f33aa02b88874e92c410e21a636a75f3485f3c54_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG6UyI1k/images/f33aa02b88874e92c410e21a636a75f3485f3c54.png","Armour","2026-01-01T14:24:29.407432Z",16052971,"h60VNI7f",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31183,"id":31184,"slug":31185,"project_type":31,"team":31186,"organization":3607,"title":31187,"description":31188,"body":31189,"body_url":3607,"published":31190,"updated":31191,"approved":31192,"queued":3607,"status":29919,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31193,"downloads":31196,"followers":31197,"categories":31198,"additional_categories":31199,"loaders":31200,"versions":31201,"icon_url":31238,"issues_url":31239,"source_url":31240,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31241,"donation_urls":31242,"gallery":31245,"color":31269,"thread_id":31184,"monetization_status":29958},[1484,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1064,1058,1025,977,905,899,862,856,805,775],"AGhiJWsU","merchant-markers","QtG1eVGr","Merchant Markers","Adds custom markers above villagers based on their professions!","\u003Cp>Have you ever forgotten what different villager professions look like?&nbsp; Ever wanted to be able to quickly find specific merchants in your home village?\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Merchant Markers\u003C/strong> makes it easier than ever.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7vyLz82.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"722\" />\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>This mod will add custom markers above villagers to make them stand out and be easier to find than ever.&nbsp; There are several customization options, and the mod is built with modpacks in mind.&nbsp; Modded villagers are fully supported, and it even integrates with Xaero minimap, FTB Chunks, or JourneyMap for a much more cohesive experience!\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>This mod requires Iceberg, you can download it \u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/iceberg\">here\u003C/a>.  The fabric version also requires Forge Config API Port, you can download it \u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\">here\u003C/a>.\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch4>\u003Cstrong>Client / Server\u003C/strong>\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cp>This mod is fully client-side.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch4>\u003Cstrong>Configuration\u003C/strong>\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cp>The configuration file for the mod includes lots of different options for getting the markers to display just how you like.&nbsp; There are options for whether markers should show through walls, if an arrow icon should show under the markers, and the maximum distance away from villagers that markers should be visible.&nbsp; There are also four different options for the types of icons to display:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Custom\u003C/strong> - The default hand-drawn custom icons for each profession.&nbsp; (New ones for modded professions can be added via resource packs)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Items\u003C/strong> - Uses an item icon for an item associated with the profession.&nbsp; For example, shows an iron chestplate for armorers, etc.&nbsp; The associated items can also be reconfigured.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Jobs\u003C/strong> - Shows the texture of the job block used for the profession.&nbsp; These can't be changed but should automatically support modded professions.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Generic\u003C/strong> - Shows the same generic \"merchant\" icon for all villagers with a profession.&nbsp; (This icon can be changed via resource packs.)\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>There is also a profession blacklist, which contains \"none\" and \"nitwit\" by default so that only villagers with trades have markers.&nbsp; Finally, there are five different options for the icon \"overlay\", which is a smaller icon that is shown in the lower right corner of the marker: Backpack, emerald, coin stack, bag, or none.&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch4>\u003Cstrong>Compatibility\u003C/strong>\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cp>This mod should fully support modded villager professions, including custom icons when provided with resource packs.&nbsp; It also supports displaying markers on \u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\">Xaero's Minimap\u003C/a>, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\">FTB Chunks\u003C/a>, or \u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\">JourneyMap \u003C/a>in place of standard villager head icons.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cem>You are free to use this mod in modpacks.\u003C/em>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://discord.gg/S5NQjbXPnb\" rel=\"nofollow\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yX0xrk0.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"68\" />\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Problems, feature request, something else?&nbsp; Join us on Discord!\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>","2022-11-16T06:10:40.668625Z","2025-02-25T19:01:03.591874Z","2022-11-17T00:09:02.175189Z",{"id":31194,"name":31195,"url":3607},"CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial No Derivatives 4.0 International",745644,529,[30,134,303],[100],[346,354,385],[31202,31203,31204,31205,31206,31207,31208,31209,31210,31211,31212,31213,31214,31215,31216,31217,31218,31219,31220,31221,31222,31223,31224,31225,31226,31227,31228,31229,31230,31231,31232,31233,31234,31235,31236,31237],"nPluVRpX","6P58UJtA","PNmAwImh","WAVTYKiy","QcOT3YMj","VsrSxzIj","d6TlAT81","GHvt7fG7","rE24wMtM","KkOHerew","8fmfdMjc","1ZzSKObB","9JD3inri","AV50BIkP","D2Chvu4Q","F26aEOdk","ZOgdT0YL","Cl4lpt6l","5IkZSVIL","LoOkKcEu","1bKdy0MD","jkfQa6Vl","3uwXNE0y","TnD8wEFX","iy2Pc70S","LutC354h","K8SKl58G","uVG5r9A0","ZNHyxtG2","yEdfZHIw","38SW89KS","AIy06o3Q","Uyd2VJ8K","guv4URio","aH2sSwUn","I7zHeAa1","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/07b18620de3f65b2aae9bc3eee18e633cc18ffc5_96.webp","https://discord.gg/UCKjnamDaW","https://github.com/AHilyard/MerchantMarkers/","https://discord.gg/S5NQjbXPnb",[31243],{"id":3158,"platform":30399,"url":31244},"https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=NYKUAV883JKA2&no_recurring=0&item_name=Thank+you+for+considering+a+donation.+It+helps+to+support+me+by+allowing+me+to+spend+more+time+making+mods+and+games.&currency_code=USD",[31246,31251,31257,31263],{"url":31247,"raw_url":31247,"featured":439,"title":31248,"description":31249,"created":31250,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/162ecfbffefa219594e11492e0bf12935c395791.png","Full support for Xaero's Minimap and FTB Chunks!","Displays custom items for villagers that have a profession, right on the mini map. So convenient!","2022-11-16T06:18:58.361718Z",{"url":31252,"raw_url":31253,"featured":439,"title":31254,"description":31255,"created":31256,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/2ed76cf403c3a460270ec2a25c6e59f96ac26b61_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/2ed76cf403c3a460270ec2a25c6e59f96ac26b61.png","Custom icons for every vanilla profession!","Hand-drawn icons for every vanilla profession are included.","2022-11-16T06:18:57.463404Z",{"url":31258,"raw_url":31259,"featured":439,"title":31260,"description":31261,"created":31262,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/c9c71f45e0b50986890001249e2924661ee43c5a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/c9c71f45e0b50986890001249e2924661ee43c5a.png","Profession level overlay!","Optionally, you can display the profession level of each villager right on the marker!","2022-11-16T06:18:59.793056Z",{"url":31264,"raw_url":31265,"featured":439,"title":31266,"description":31267,"created":31268,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/dbad17a55580a59f88598cdf55b4b2b0cf5a7520_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhiJWsU/images/1c862494993049d95fd765b0ae33f30964320da3.png","Lots of customization options!","Here's a weaponsmith with the custom marker and \"coin stack\" overlay icon.","2022-11-16T06:18:55.685664Z",9921048,{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31271,"id":31272,"slug":31273,"project_type":31,"team":31274,"organization":3607,"title":31275,"description":31276,"body":31277,"body_url":3607,"published":31278,"updated":31279,"approved":31280,"queued":31281,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31282,"downloads":31285,"followers":29946,"categories":31286,"additional_categories":31287,"loaders":31288,"versions":31289,"icon_url":3607,"issues_url":31296,"source_url":31297,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31298,"gallery":31299,"color":3607,"thread_id":31300,"monetization_status":29958},[670],"AFrLMPfl","smacksutils","qg3f3wx4","SmacksUtils","This Mod implements some simple QoL improvements i enjoy playing with and i will add features as i have time and ideas.","This Mod implements some simple QoL improvements i enjoy playing with and i will add features as i have time and ideas.\n\n \n\nCurrently this mod implements Backpacks, Veinminer, Item/Xp Magnet, Light Wand, Enchanting Tool, Teleportation Tablet, fast block placement, fast eating. Many things can be configured using the \"Mods\" button added by the mod \"Mod Menu\".","2025-07-26T12:03:07.604103Z","2025-08-31T19:49:44.910987Z","2025-08-23T01:52:34.848176Z","2025-08-22T12:31:28.491243Z",{"id":31283,"name":10,"url":31284},"LicenseRef-CC0-1.0-Universal","https://github.com/smacksplays/SmacksUtil/blob/develop_1.20.4/LICENSE",108,[303],[],[346,385],[31290,31291,31292,31293,31294,31295],"8ZCAyKVJ","telXc9yj","CcqdfStg","4FbXR1oq","1BAFSFuS","SivZHkgV","https://github.com/smacksplays/SmacksUtil/issues","https://github.com/smacksplays/SmacksUtil",[],[],"ZbvDvLtp",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31302,"id":31303,"slug":31304,"project_type":31,"team":31305,"organization":3607,"title":31306,"description":31307,"body":31308,"body_url":3607,"published":31309,"updated":31310,"approved":31311,"queued":31312,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31313,"downloads":31314,"followers":29946,"categories":31315,"additional_categories":31316,"loaders":31317,"versions":31318,"icon_url":31321,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31322,"donation_urls":31323,"gallery":31324,"color":31355,"thread_id":31356,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AH3l3DLC","easyportal","yrJ5MDPT","EasyPortal","EasyPortal Mod revolutionizes Minecraft travel by enabling custom-shaped, PIN-secured portals with seamless 1:1 linking through an intuitive in-game GUI.","\u003Ch1>⚡ EasyPortal\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>EasyPortal\u003C/b> revolutionizes Minecraft travel by enabling custom-shaped, PIN-secured portals with seamless 1:1 linking through an intuitive in-game GUI.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cblockquote>Built for \u003Cb>Minecraft 1.21.1\u003C/b> on \u003Cb>Fabric\u003C/b> — by \u003Cb>SoloDev\u003C/b>\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>✨ Features\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3>🎨 Portal Shape Designer\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>16×16 Grid Editor\u003C/b> — Draw any portal frame shape you want, block by block.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Left-Click to draw\u003C/b>, \u003Cb>Right-Click to erase\u003C/b> — supports click-and-drag painting.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Inventory-Aware\u003C/b> — The block palette is sourced directly from your inventory. Choose any block you have as the frame material.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Reset Canvas\u003C/b> button to start fresh at any time.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🔗 Portal Linking\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>OneWay\u003C/b> — Teleport to a saved coordinate destination (one-directional exit).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Bidirectional Link\u003C/b> — Create a two-way connection between two portals.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>1:1 Exclusive Linking\u003C/b> — Each portal can only be linked to one other portal at a time. No multi-linking allowed.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Automatic Destination Resolution\u003C/b> — Link portals by name; the mod resolves coordinates automatically.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🔒 Security System\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Private Portals\u003C/b> — Mark any portal as private to restrict access.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>PIN Code Protection\u003C/b> — Set a numeric PIN that guests must enter via a pop-up GUI.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Session-Based Auth\u003C/b> — Enter the PIN once per session; no re-entry until you disconnect.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Owner Bypass\u003C/b> — Portal owners always pass through without being prompted.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Admin Bypass\u003C/b> — Server operators (OP Level 2+) or players with \u003Ccode>easyportal.admin\u003C/code> can bypass all PIN gates.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Shared PIN for Links\u003C/b> — When linking two portals, a PIN set on one side is automatically shared with the linked portal.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Auth Cooldown\u003C/b> — After cancelling the PIN prompt, it won't re-appear instantly. A cooldown triggers before the prompt shows again.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🌈 Portal Colors\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>9 Built-In Colors\u003C/b>: Cyan, Purple, Red, Green, Blue, Magenta, Yellow, Orange, Pink.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Hex Color Picker\u003C/b> — Use the advanced color picker in the GUI to set any custom RGB hex color for portal particles and gateway blocks.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Animated Portal Gateway\u003C/b> — Each portal has a custom-rendered, translucent animated block with your chosen color.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>👻 Preview &amp; Placement\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Ghost Preview\u003C/b> — After designing your portal, a translucent holographic outline follows your crosshair showing exactly where it will be built.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Rotation\u003C/b> — Press \u003Cb>[R]\u003C/b> to rotate the portal (North → East → South → West).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Orientation Toggle\u003C/b> — Press \u003Cb>[Middle Mouse]\u003C/b> to switch between \u003Cb>Vertical\u003C/b> (wall) and \u003Cb>Horizontal\u003C/b> (floor/ceiling) alignment.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Right-Click to Confirm\u003C/b> — Place the portal with a right-click.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Left-Click to Cancel\u003C/b> — Abort placement at any time.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Block Requirements HUD\u003C/b> — While placing, a live checklist on the left of the screen shows required blocks vs. what you have (e.g., \u003Ccode>Dirt 4/5\u003C/code>). Missing blocks are highlighted.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Key Hints HUD\u003C/b> — On-screen hints on the right side remind you of all placement controls.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>⚙️ Behavior Settings\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Teleport Cooldown\u003C/b> — Set a 0–60 second cooldown between consecutive teleports per portal (slider in the GUI).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Entity Teleportation\u003C/b> — Toggle \"Allow Mobs / Items / Entities\" to let non-player entities (mobs, dropped items, etc.) pass through portals.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Resistance Buff\u003C/b> — Players receive 3 seconds of Resistance V after teleporting, preventing fall damage.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Teleport Effects\u003C/b> — Particles and ender teleport sound play at both origin and destination.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Dimension Overlay\u003C/b> — When teleporting across dimensions, a colored screen overlay effect (matching portal color) fades in and out.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>📋 Portal Network Dashboard\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Open with \u003Cb>[Right Shift]\u003C/b> or \u003Ccode>/easyportal gui\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Portal List\u003C/b> — View all your portals in a sleek, searchable table.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Search\u003C/b> — Filter portals by name, owner, or destination.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Delete\u003C/b> — Remove portals with a confirmation popup.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>\"+ NEW PORTAL\"\u003C/b> button to jump directly into the Portal Designer.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Admin View\u003C/b> — Admins can see and manage all players' portals.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🌍 Cross-Dimension Support\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Portals work across all dimensions — Overworld, Nether, End, and modded dimensions.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Destinations store dimension identifiers and resolve them at teleport time.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🏗️ Survival Friendly\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Portal frames consume blocks from your inventory in Survival mode.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Creative mode bypasses block requirement checks.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🛡️ Frame Integrity\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Automatic Destruction\u003C/b> — If a player breaks a block that is part of a portal's frame, the portal is destroyed and the player is notified.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Periodic Validation\u003C/b> — When \u003Ccode>validateFrame\u003C/code> is enabled in the config, the server periodically checks portal integrity and removes broken portals.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>🗂️ Configuration\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>The mod generates \u003Ccode>easyportal.json\u003C/code> in the config directory with the following options:\u003C/p>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Option\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Default\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Description\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>defaultPortalLimit\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Maximum number of portals per player.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>enableClaimProtection\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>true\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Prevents building portals in claimed areas.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>validateFrame\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>false\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Enables periodic server-side frame integrity checks.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>🚀 Installation\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Install \u003Cb>Minecraft 1.21.1\u003C/b> with \u003Cb>Fabric Loader\u003C/b> (≥ 0.18.4).\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Install \u003Cb>Fabric API\u003C/b>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Download \u003Ccode>easyportal-1.21.1.jar\u003C/code> and place it in your \u003Ccode>.minecraft/mods\u003C/code> folder.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Launch the game!\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>📖 How to Use\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3>1. Open the Portal Dashboard\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Press the default keybind: \u003Cb>[Right Shift]\u003C/b>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Or run the command: \u003Ccode>/easyportal gui\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>This opens the \u003Cb>Portal Network Dashboard\u003C/b> where you can view all your portals, search, delete, or create new ones.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>2. Create a New Portal\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Click \u003Cb>\"+ NEW PORTAL\"\u003C/b> in the dashboard to open the \u003Cb>Portal Designer\u003C/b>. The designer has two panels:\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch4>Left Panel — Shape Editor\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Draw\u003C/b> your portal frame on the 16×16 grid.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Left-Click\u003C/b> (or drag) to paint blocks. \u003Cb>Right-Click\u003C/b> (or drag) to erase.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Select your frame block from the \u003Cb>Frame Material\u003C/b> section (sourced from your inventory).\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch4>Right Panel — Configuration\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cp>The configuration sidebar has 5 collapsible sections:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>1. Identity &amp; Network\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Portal Name\u003C/b> — Give your portal a unique name.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Network Mode\u003C/b> — Choose \u003Ccode>Oneway (Exit Only)\u003C/code> or \u003Ccode>Bidirectional Link\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Target Destination\u003C/b> — Select from available destinations/portals.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>2. Gateway Aura\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Atmosphere Tint\u003C/b> — Pick a color for portal particles and blocks using the color picker.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>3. Frame Material\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Browse and select any block from your inventory as the portal frame.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>4. Security\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Private Portal\u003C/b> checkbox — Restricts access.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Portal PIN\u003C/b> — Required when private is enabled. Guests must enter this PIN.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>When linking to a portal that already has a PIN, the existing PIN is automatically shared.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>5. Behavior\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Teleport Cooldown\u003C/b> — Slider from 0 to 60 seconds.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Allow Mobs / Items / Entities\u003C/b> — Enable entity pass-through.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>3. Preview &amp; Place\u003C/h3>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cb>\"PREVIEW &amp; PLACE\"\u003C/b> to close the designer and enter placement mode.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>A ghost outline of your portal appears at your crosshair.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Rotate\u003C/b>: Press \u003Cb>[R]\u003C/b>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Toggle Orientation\u003C/b>: Press \u003Cb>[Middle Mouse Button]\u003C/b> to switch between wall and floor/ceiling.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Confirm\u003C/b>: \u003Cb>Right-Click\u003C/b> to build the portal.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Cancel\u003C/b>: \u003Cb>Left-Click\u003C/b> to abort.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cblockquote>\u003Cb>Note:\u003C/b> In Survival, you must have the required blocks in your inventory. The block requirement HUD on screen shows what you have vs. what's needed.\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch3>4. Using Portals\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Simply \u003Cb>walk into the portal gateway blocks\u003C/b> to teleport. The mod detects your position and triggers teleportation automatically.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Public portals\u003C/b> — Anyone can use them.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Private portals\u003C/b> — A PIN entry GUI appears. Enter the correct PIN to unlock.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Once authenticated, you won't be prompted again until you log out (session-based).\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch3>5. Managing Destinations\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Create standalone coordinate destinations for OneWay portals using commands:\u003C/p>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Command\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Description\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>/easyportal setDest &lt;name&gt;\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Saves your current position as a destination.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>/easyportal delDest &lt;name&gt;\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Deletes a saved destination (with tab-completion).\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Cp>These destinations appear in the Portal Designer's \u003Cb>Target Destination\u003C/b> dropdown when using OneWay mode.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3>6. Managing Portals\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>View\u003C/b>: Open the dashboard with \u003Cb>[Right Shift]\u003C/b>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Search\u003C/b>: Use the search bar to filter by portal name, owner, or destination.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Delete\u003C/b>: Click the \u003Cb>DEL\u003C/b> button next to any portal, then confirm.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cb>Auto-Destruction\u003C/b>: Breaking a frame block in-world destroys the portal automatically.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>🤝 Permissions\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Permission\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Level\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Description\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>easyportal.admin\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>OP 2+\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Bypass PIN protection, view &amp; manage all players' portals.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>🛠️ Dependencies\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Dependency\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Version\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Minecraft\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1.21.1\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Fabric Loader\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>≥ 0.18.4\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Fabric API\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Any\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Java\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>≥ 21\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Ch2>⌨️ Default Keybinds\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Key\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Action\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>Right Shift\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Toggle Portal Dashboard\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>R\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Rotate portal during placement\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>Middle Mouse\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Toggle vertical/horizontal orientation during placement\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>Right-Click\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Confirm portal placement\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>Left-Click\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Cancel portal placement\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Cb>ESC\u003C/b>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Close any GUI\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ci>Created by SoloDev\u003C/i> ⚡\u003C/p>","2026-02-11T13:22:52.252911Z","2026-02-16T11:36:29.854568Z","2026-02-12T05:44:24.097572Z","2026-02-11T13:29:45.831930Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},187,[297],[100,134,175],[346],[31319,31320],"tBdcdlYl","TkUNTQwq","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/71453381f325427bdaa31f43e25205450c94e890_96.webp","https://discord.gg/vEFjyG76fH",[],[31325,31330,31335,31340,31345,31350],{"url":31326,"raw_url":31327,"featured":439,"title":31328,"description":3607,"created":31329,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/0395c71cb85d42d00a5b4b1f976032d1d9bcb49d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/0395c71cb85d42d00a5b4b1f976032d1d9bcb49d.png","Auth for private portals","2026-02-16T11:41:37.553420Z",{"url":31331,"raw_url":31332,"featured":439,"title":31333,"description":3607,"created":31334,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/23641fa9f9b56864f01cc9fb1ff5848356a62b15_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/23641fa9f9b56864f01cc9fb1ff5848356a62b15.png","Portal Dashboard","2026-02-16T11:39:29.783368Z",{"url":31336,"raw_url":31337,"featured":439,"title":31338,"description":3607,"created":31339,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/e1d137e742db53f1bf4ddcad8690260f3f44bd33_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/e1d137e742db53f1bf4ddcad8690260f3f44bd33.png","Horizontal portals","2026-02-16T11:41:09.725426Z",{"url":31341,"raw_url":31342,"featured":439,"title":31343,"description":3607,"created":31344,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/e9ca00b887a5d710510089dc3cac763749bc5262_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/e9ca00b887a5d710510089dc3cac763749bc5262.png","Preview mode","2026-02-16T11:40:33.095608Z",{"url":31346,"raw_url":31347,"featured":439,"title":31348,"description":3607,"created":31349,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/f51098a5cf3f34c82eaf8cd524338745ab6c9a11_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/f51098a5cf3f34c82eaf8cd524338745ab6c9a11.png","Portal Designer","2026-02-16T11:39:55.844889Z",{"url":31351,"raw_url":31352,"featured":439,"title":31353,"description":3607,"created":31354,"ordering":30103},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/9b1fde5f550ec5111c4d4484d1515105e2e2dfa7_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH3l3DLC/images/9b1fde5f550ec5111c4d4484d1515105e2e2dfa7.png","Output","2026-02-11T13:29:00.116533Z",4526912,"wzkTckGi",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31358,"id":31359,"slug":31360,"project_type":31,"team":31361,"organization":3607,"title":31362,"description":31363,"body":31364,"body_url":3607,"published":31365,"updated":31366,"approved":31367,"queued":31368,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31369,"downloads":31372,"followers":31373,"categories":31374,"additional_categories":31375,"loaders":31376,"versions":31377,"icon_url":31383,"issues_url":31384,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31385,"gallery":31386,"color":31434,"thread_id":31359,"monetization_status":29958},[1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,727],"AGwutJJF","biome-moss","7U9JbeVk","Biome Moss","Adds biome color variants for all moss.","Adds biome color variants for all moss.\n\nThis includes:\u003Cbr>\n • Moss Block\u003Cbr>\n • Moss Carpet\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Cobblestone\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Cobblestone Slab\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Cobblestone Stairs\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Cobblestone Wall\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Stone Bricks\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Stone Brick Slab\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Stone Brick Stairs\u003Cbr>\n • Mossy Stone Brick Wall\u003Cbr>\n • Infested Mossy Stone Bricks\n\n","2023-06-03T18:34:29.589679Z","2025-05-19T22:52:20.857422Z","2023-06-04T01:03:40.424323Z","2023-06-03T19:45:22.785044Z",{"id":31370,"name":31371,"url":3607},"Apache-2.0","Apache License 2.0",287184,237,[100],[],[346],[31378,31379,31380,31381,31382],"jbOQOx8t","fRc4IXHA","8KJTGL72","z44hm2zt","8Uf5ipN8","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/3a8dc5cb4524b069343c29650a033ec209a44bd0.png","https://github.com/TheDarkCoder/Issues/issues",[],[31387,31392,31397,31402,31407,31412,31417,31422,31428],{"url":31388,"raw_url":31389,"featured":439,"title":31390,"description":3607,"created":31391,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/71c9c32e3810272efd24548a289a91c748509b15_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/71c9c32e3810272efd24548a289a91c748509b15.png","Plains tint","2023-06-03T19:34:44.487692Z",{"url":31393,"raw_url":31394,"featured":439,"title":31395,"description":3607,"created":31396,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/de324aefec943a0921deeb3d65a073f60feea8f5_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/de324aefec943a0921deeb3d65a073f60feea8f5.png","Forest tint","2023-06-03T19:35:09.308270Z",{"url":31398,"raw_url":31399,"featured":439,"title":31400,"description":3607,"created":31401,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/bb107dd6719f2145297e0d19f358849e169ef6d4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/bb107dd6719f2145297e0d19f358849e169ef6d4.png","Mountain tint","2023-06-03T19:35:28.420711Z",{"url":31403,"raw_url":31404,"featured":439,"title":31405,"description":3607,"created":31406,"ordering":30024},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/0d0bc2d87382af0f43dd8042c18e0d46d9693c62_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/0d0bc2d87382af0f43dd8042c18e0d46d9693c62.png","Badlands tint","2023-06-03T19:34:32.596922Z",{"url":31408,"raw_url":31409,"featured":864,"title":31410,"description":3607,"created":31411,"ordering":30103},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/e81313603be712e19280d1434103457d11df930d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/b19a5cc29ad5917acf90113b279f5bc3f9a9dedd.png","Jungle tint","2023-06-03T19:37:43.056102Z",{"url":31413,"raw_url":31414,"featured":439,"title":31415,"description":3607,"created":31416,"ordering":30480},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/4b805a44e5b39f1d51996302a12cdae67f74731a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/4b805a44e5b39f1d51996302a12cdae67f74731a.png","Swamp tint","2023-06-03T19:38:51.783596Z",{"url":31418,"raw_url":31419,"featured":439,"title":31420,"description":3607,"created":31421,"ordering":30333},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/9db734e0529750c912b1b5f8c1a1780dcb0554cb_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/9db734e0529750c912b1b5f8c1a1780dcb0554cb.png","Mossy wall tint transition","2023-06-03T19:42:58.984741Z",{"url":31423,"raw_url":31424,"featured":439,"title":31425,"description":3607,"created":31426,"ordering":31427},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/5653ffe65be75066048a09734d216226194a2e85_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/5653ffe65be75066048a09734d216226194a2e85.png","Ruined portal with tinted moss","2023-06-03T19:44:25.765753Z",7,{"url":31429,"raw_url":31430,"featured":439,"title":31431,"description":31432,"created":31433,"ordering":30386},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/c1e829bc64f7f4e929785307623a917dfde5fe43_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwutJJF/images/c1e829bc64f7f4e929785307623a917dfde5fe43.png","Moss carpet hidden light in swamp","Normally, the brighter green of moss carpet would make this light anything but hidden, but by using this mod, it blends right in with the biome.","2023-06-03T19:49:27.203598Z",6123824,{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31436,"id":31437,"slug":31438,"project_type":31,"team":31439,"organization":3607,"title":31440,"description":31441,"body":31442,"body_url":3607,"published":31443,"updated":31444,"approved":31445,"queued":31446,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31447,"downloads":31451,"followers":29946,"categories":31452,"additional_categories":31453,"loaders":31454,"versions":31455,"icon_url":3607,"issues_url":31458,"source_url":31459,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31460,"gallery":31461,"color":3607,"thread_id":31462,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502],"AFaeE3Yw","nofakehiteffects","fMaitFrq","NoFakeHitEffects","Fabric client-side mod that removes fake predicted hit effects.","# NoFakeHitEffects\n\nNoFakeHitEffects suppresses locally predicted critical-hit and enchanted-hit particles against remote players on multiplayer servers.\n\nWithout NoFakeHitEffects, vanilla can render those particles before the server validates the attack, so a rejected hit can still show hit effects.\n\n## Installation\n\nInstall on the client. A server-only install will not affect client-predicted hit effects.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Suppresses predicted critical-hit particles against remote players.\n- Suppresses predicted enchanted-hit particles against remote players.\n- Still renders server-confirmed hit effects.\n\n## Supported versions\n\n- Minecraft Java 1.21 through 1.21.11\n- Minecraft Java 26.1 through 26.1.2\n\n## License\n\nNoFakeHitEffects is released under the Unlicense.\n","2026-05-27T18:42:14.530447Z","2026-05-27T18:42:33.084145Z","2026-05-29T18:51:45.493302Z","2026-05-27T18:43:07.252681Z",{"id":31448,"name":31449,"url":31450},"Unlicense","The Unlicense","https://unlicense.org/",117,[134,303],[],[346],[31456,31457],"fTkBXDZH","R6VgDHjY","https://github.com/shardmods/NoFakeHitEffects/issues","https://github.com/shardmods/NoFakeHitEffects",[],[],"XvWLPwbm",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31464,"id":31465,"slug":31466,"project_type":34,"team":31467,"organization":3607,"title":31468,"description":31469,"body":31470,"body_url":3607,"published":31471,"updated":31472,"approved":31473,"queued":31474,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31475,"downloads":31476,"followers":29946,"categories":31477,"additional_categories":31478,"loaders":31479,"versions":31480,"icon_url":31482,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31483,"gallery":31484,"color":31485,"thread_id":31486,"monetization_status":29958},[1058],"AFaIST1U","life-in-a-grid","ynWL2xWW","Life in a Grid","A creative city-building modpack for Minecraft. Design modern or medieval towns, plan streets, and bring your world to life!","### 🏙️ **Life in a Grid**\n\n**Build. Design. Live.**\n\nWelcome to **Life in a Grid**, a creative-focused Minecraft modpack designed for **city builders, town planners, and virtual architects**!  \nInspired by games like **Cities: Skylines**, **The Sims 4**, and others, this pack turns Minecraft into a sandbox for crafting beautiful and functional **settlements of any era** — from **rustic medieval villages** to **bustling modern cities**.\n\n***\n\n### 🌆 **What You Can Do**\n\n*   🏗️ **Plan and build your dream city** — grid-based streets, cozy suburbs, or towering downtowns.\n    \n*   🏰 **Mix styles freely** — combine **modern**, **medieval**, **fantasy**, or **industrial** themes to create unique worlds.\n    \n*   🏡 **Simulate life** — populate your world with villagers, citizens, or NPCs to make your cities feel alive.\n    \n*   🛠️ **Use powerful building tools** — world editing, decoration mods, and quality-of-life features to make construction fun and fast.\n    \n*   🌇 **Design like a city planner** — organize neighborhoods, manage layouts, and bring order (or chaos) to your world’s architecture.\n    \n\n***\n\n### 🧱 **Features**\n\n*   Extensive **building and decoration** mod selection\n    \n*   **Creative tools** for planning and layout\n    \n*   **Optional survival elements** for players who want a challenge\n    \n*   Balanced mix of **modern, fantasy, and historical** building options\n    \n\n***\n\n### 🪙 **Your World, Your Rules**\n\nWhether you’re designing a medieval kingdom, a futuristic metropolis, or a cozy countryside town — **Life in a Grid** gives you the freedom and tools to shape your perfect world… one block at a time.","2025-10-21T17:28:22.586979Z","2025-10-21T17:39:24.738411Z","2025-10-22T12:48:51.600575Z","2025-10-21T17:40:56.166839Z",{"id":30422,"name":30423,"url":3607},435,[30,200,240],[153,288],[354],[31481],"MlsH2BT4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFaIST1U/863c0b2fd76ef3aa5eb9f3c2b9fcc5706a270d0b_96.webp",[],[],6376246,"wXEhWipU",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31488,"id":31489,"slug":31490,"project_type":34,"team":31491,"organization":31492,"title":31493,"description":31494,"body":31495,"body_url":3607,"published":31496,"updated":31497,"approved":31498,"queued":31499,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31500,"downloads":31501,"followers":30024,"categories":31502,"additional_categories":31503,"loaders":31504,"versions":31505,"icon_url":31519,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31520,"gallery":31521,"color":31539,"thread_id":31540,"monetization_status":29958},[670],"AGvmSg3M","freshvanilla-byjnn","jsnSx38g","dbj1wqgJ","FreshVanilla","Modpack by JustNoName83 that makes your game more immersive","# **RU**\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Сборка FreshVanilla добавляет живости в мир Minecraft, преображая игровой процесс и создавая уникальную атмосферу. Она включает в себя:**\n\n>**📚Изменения интерфейсов блоков:**  \nЭстетические и функциональные обновления, которые делают интерфейс более удобным и приятным для глаза.\n\n>**🍃Улучшенная погода и природа:**  \nЖивописные изменения в погодных условиях и окружающем мире, которые делают каждую игровую сессию более захватывающей.\n\n>**✨Новые анимации для игроков и мобов:**  \nБолее плавные анимации, которые делают взаимодействие с игровым миром более увлекательным.\n\n>**📷Полная переработка камеры:**  \nНовая перспектива восприятия мира, позволяющая глубже погрузиться в атмосферу игры.\n\n>**🎙️Обновленные звуки окружения:**  \nБолее живые и разнообразные звуковые эффекты, которые заставлят мр заиграть новыми красками.\n\n>**🗒️Множество другого контента:**  \nДополнительные функции и элементы, которые делают игрой процесс еще более интересным и захватывающим.\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Следующий апдейт\u003C/summary>\n\nБудут добавлены объемные объекты.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n\n\n![.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cd9558ba9db01de0b5e18e2bdd36a92b4c7289fa.png)\n\n\n# **ENG**\n\n\n\nThe Fresh Vanilla pack is the perfect choice for those who want to refresh their experience in Minecraft!\n-\n**The FreshVanilla modpack adds liveliness to the Minecraft world, transforming the gameplay and creating a unique atmosphere. It includes:**\n\n>**📚Changes to Block Interfaces:**  \nAesthetic and functional updates that make the interface more user-friendly and visually pleasing.\n\n>**🍃Improved Weather and Nature:**  \nPicturesque changes in weather conditions and the surrounding environment, making each gaming session more exciting.\n\n>**✨New Animations for Players and Mobs:**  \nMore realistic and smooth animations that make interactions with the game world more engaging.\n\n>**📷Complete Camera Overhaul:**  \nA new perspective on the world, allowing deeper immersion into the game atmosphere.\n\n>**🎙️Updated Ambient Sounds:**  \nMore lively and diverse sound effects that fill the world with new sounds.\n\n> **🗒️A Wealth of Other Content:**  \nAdditional features and elements that make the game even more interesting and captivating.\n\n_P.S.\nSorry, I translated the entire text using a translator and there may be errors in it.😓\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Next update\u003C/summary>\n\nVoluminous objects will be added.\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n","2025-10-13T18:36:30.682060Z","2025-11-27T09:53:13.209573Z","2025-10-15T18:41:19.475520Z","2025-10-15T17:52:06.785699Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},526,[30,200,211],[],[346],[31506,31507,31508,31509,31510,31511,31512,31513,31514,31515,31516,31517,31518],"dT2vAGfO","NhOIwm2P","zF9T5rIP","x6E2euzP","uTmkgssh","AX6aq6gh","21TFv9io","buMqJEf8","nL2a9DDZ","TijSzbZN","N9OWBcFZ","7uqN4hEA","PdIvVzbJ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/58a1083b04154802ed436f8edbad70d7e1e2e945_96.webp",[],[31522,31527,31531,31535],{"url":31523,"raw_url":31524,"featured":864,"title":31525,"description":3607,"created":31526,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/17f07a0e7651f25f5574b9262053b0b44ab19735_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/17f07a0e7651f25f5574b9262053b0b44ab19735.png","FV world of colors","2025-10-24T15:59:24.984002Z",{"url":31528,"raw_url":31529,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31530,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/7d03f615736bfec8f5b8b37849e6664eb11a90d1_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/7d03f615736bfec8f5b8b37849e6664eb11a90d1.png","2025-10-14T12:08:17.231507Z",{"url":31532,"raw_url":31533,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31534,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/b68c85e89e36b6bbd4f84f61d98603b9a2bfc6c3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/b68c85e89e36b6bbd4f84f61d98603b9a2bfc6c3.png","2025-10-17T20:49:27.152307Z",{"url":31536,"raw_url":31537,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31538,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/b7f60c0a899b8a6265942f28db1f3ddbd90f6377_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGvmSg3M/images/b7f60c0a899b8a6265942f28db1f3ddbd90f6377.png","2025-10-13T19:27:55.173893Z",12343113,"uRnjxvMd",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31542,"id":31543,"slug":31544,"project_type":31,"team":31545,"organization":3607,"title":31546,"description":31547,"body":31548,"body_url":3607,"published":31549,"updated":31550,"approved":31551,"queued":3607,"status":29920,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31552,"downloads":31553,"followers":30134,"categories":31554,"additional_categories":31555,"loaders":31556,"versions":31557,"icon_url":31559,"issues_url":31560,"source_url":31561,"wiki_url":31561,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31562,"gallery":31565,"color":31566,"thread_id":31543,"monetization_status":29958},[1391,1286,1229,1196,1187],"AGwGHsOd","fabridash","MlMUmPQU","Fabridash","A dash mod (and API) for Fabric!","# Fabridash Mod\nWith this mod you will be able to dash across your world, using 3 different items! And also, if you are a developer you may use this mod as an API to integrate dashing (get it? eheh) into your project!\n\n## The Dash items\nUnlike other mods, to perform a dash with this mod you will need to find some treasure first! A **Dash Globe** to be precise, and it can be found inside treasure chests from ancienty cities, mineshafts and such! (with a chance that goes from a minimum of 12% in mineshafts to 30% in the end city).\n\nOnce you obtain the core item, you may craft the actual \"dashers\" (yeah, I kinda like making puns):\n\nYou can dash by right clicking the dasher item. \n### Iron Dasher\nThe most basic (yet powerful) item that will let you dash to your next journey, you can craft it like this:\n\n![iron_dasher_crafting](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190399028-f819dfd4-29bd-4d30-a572-cc95c38bff68.JPG)\n(It will require a Dash Globe, 4 Iron Blocks, 4 Redstone Blocks)\n\nIt will provide a decent boost (multiplier of 1) and it has a cooldown of 80 ticks.\n\n![irondashergif](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190407499-c01c96f9-4dd9-47a3-a813-25e6f7707551.gif)\n\n### Diamond Dasher\nThe advanced version of the iron dasher, which you can craft like this:\n\n![diamond_dasher_crafting](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190399957-6fa7297d-87ff-4fc2-8aa4-d1c087a1049d.JPG)\n(It will require a Dash Globe, 4 Diamond Blocks, 4 Redstone Blocks) (yes pretty expensive)\n\nIt will provide a bigger boost (multiplier 2) with a cooldown of 120 ticks.\n\n![diamondashergif)](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190407984-add714c6-5944-49f2-84a5-509291d59a02.gif)\n\n### Obsidian Dasher\nThe weird and \"reversed\" version of the diamond dasher, craftable like so:\n\n![obsidian_dasher_crafting](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190400323-f01b4d84-f7dd-476d-849c-cf3ad0a1beed.JPG)\n(It will require a Diamond Dasher, 4 Obisidian)\n\nThis item will let you do a *backwards* dash, with a multiplier of 2 and a cooldown of 120 ticks (just like the diamond one, but reversed in direction)\n\n![obsidiandashergif](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29462910/190408729-e8e78885-b2e9-4a1e-99e4-85fc27d96788.gif)\n\nWhenever one of this gets activated you will hear a dash sound effect, and see some particles! \n\n## Sponsor\n[![bisecthosting](https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e9c85d2a-cafa-4e2f-98bf-4f62bd9e951c.png)](https://www.bisecthosting.com/LightDev)\n\nIf you like the mod you can always buy me a kofi\n\n[![ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg)](https://ko-fi.com/S6S88307C)\n\n## Config & gamerule\nTo have a higher boost for the dash you can use the `dashMultiplier` gamerule. This value will be *multiplied* by the default value of the items.\n\nThere is also a config file, where you can disable the items entirely and only use this as an API\n\n## For developers\nOnce you've got the mod implemented into you project (See setup), you will simply need to call `Fabridash.dash(Entity entity, float power, boolean reversed)`\nThe `entity` is the one that will perform the dash, the `power` is how far it will go and the `reversed` on **true** will make the entity go **backwards** instead of forward. And that's it.\n\n## Coming soon-ish \nI will probably expand the ways in which you will be able to dash, going from a key press to maybe a \"passive\" ability, or a command. All of which will be togglable. This mod was born to create an API for future projects in need of a dash ability. Like my other (kind of \"main\") project [LightWithin](https://modrinth.com/mods/LightWithin)! (actually it was born because of that project like a few of my other libs)\n\n\n## Setup\n### Users\nDrag and drop the .jar file you have downloaded from curseforge/modrinth and drop it into your mods folder!\n### Developers\nIf you want to use the api module of the mod, add it in your build.gradle, using modrnith's repo like this:\n```gradle\nrepositories {\n    maven {\n        name = \"Modrinth\"\n        url = \"https://api.modrinth.com/maven\"\n        content {\n            includeGroup \"maven.modrinth\"\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    modImplementation \"maven.modrinth:fabridash:\u003Cversion>\"\n}\n```\nYou could even extract the API module and use it as is, but remember to register the client reciver!\n\n## License\n\nThis mod is available under the MIT license.\n","2022-09-15T13:10:34.574369Z","2022-09-15T13:10:34.576313Z","2022-09-15T19:04:48.715613Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},807,[30,115,157],[288,303],[346,409],[31558],"XnZUCBkY","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGwGHsOd/85a2483ee90ded7ad2cfb20524beb22b2cab0dfe_96.webp","https://github.com/Emafire003/Fabridash/issues","https://github.com/Emafire003/Fabridash",[31563],{"id":3164,"platform":3165,"url":31564},"https://ko-fi.com",[],2110021,{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31568,"id":31569,"slug":31570,"project_type":12,"team":31571,"organization":3607,"title":31572,"description":31573,"body":31574,"body_url":3607,"published":31575,"updated":31576,"approved":31577,"queued":31578,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31579,"downloads":31580,"followers":29946,"categories":31581,"additional_categories":31582,"loaders":31583,"versions":31584,"icon_url":31586,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31587,"donation_urls":31588,"gallery":31589,"color":31604,"thread_id":31605,"monetization_status":29958},[1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899],"AH6n8rNt","mtr-british-rail-class-378-capitalstar","TJDldNVf","[MTR3/4] British Rail Class 378 Capitalstar","An MTR resource pack that adds the Class 378 Capitalstar.","# **About**\nThe British Rail Class 378 _Capitalstar_ is an electric multiple unit passenger train specifically designed for the London Overground network. It is part of Bombardier Transportation's Electrostar family. A total of 57 five-car trains have been built, most of which were originally built as three- or four-car units.\n# **Function**\nThis resource pack adds the Class 378 _Capitalstar_ in **Overground** and **Overground (Black)** liveries.","2025-07-31T13:23:31.392462Z","2025-07-31T13:56:08.092160Z","2025-08-03T22:17:46.845293Z","2025-07-31T13:56:28.781876Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},5408,[245],[],[377],[31585],"BJ1Fx8cB","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/9a7e5381dbc112d8ac2e33a0cde70ca7c016700d.png","https://discord.gg/Kr6vESz7",[],[31590,31594,31599],{"url":31591,"raw_url":31591,"featured":439,"title":31592,"description":3607,"created":31593,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/images/9a7e5381dbc112d8ac2e33a0cde70ca7c016700d.png","Icon","2025-07-31T13:50:47.313956Z",{"url":31595,"raw_url":31596,"featured":439,"title":31597,"description":3607,"created":31598,"ordering":29977},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/images/26daeee31da090ef08640e398895c2852216260a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/images/26daeee31da090ef08640e398895c2852216260a.png","Class 378 (Overground)","2025-07-31T13:53:50.426975Z",{"url":31600,"raw_url":31601,"featured":439,"title":31602,"description":3607,"created":31603,"ordering":30134},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/images/7dbe1a3967919592b60043e179b1ee88661f2032_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH6n8rNt/images/7dbe1a3967919592b60043e179b1ee88661f2032.png","Class 378 (Overground Black Livery)","2025-07-31T13:54:25.675546Z",3155278,"4UDZIMCW",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31607,"id":31608,"slug":31609,"project_type":12,"team":31610,"organization":3607,"title":31611,"description":31612,"body":31613,"body_url":3607,"published":31614,"updated":31615,"approved":31616,"queued":31617,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31618,"downloads":31619,"followers":29946,"categories":31620,"additional_categories":31621,"loaders":31622,"versions":31623,"icon_url":31626,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31627,"donation_urls":31628,"gallery":31629,"color":31650,"thread_id":31651,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856],"AFmmAhBI","ore-hearts-avayt","Zftnbf0U","Ore Hearts Avayt","Tired of regular hearts? Want something new and love ores? This resource pack is for you! Replaces almost all vanilla hearts. Yes","![Golden Hearts](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0da2d24bcae8e00a0c997f8657572f2163d3e3f3.png)![Normal Hearts](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df7dfbc1e28e7ba29fc32c5017aa3a133a9cd8e3.png)![Poisoned Hearts](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0e2273ce105e2ae59c0f9c45e55cdc774f7712b2.png)![Withered Hearts](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e493d63dde4ab8d8fa0ce9949328a41ab972eb.png)![Frostbitten Hearts](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f7f5835187a195f97aec90563898721cb9873df.png)    \n\n\nTired of regular hearts? Want something new and love ores? This resource pack is for you! Replaces almost all vanilla hearts. Yes\nP.S THX FOR 100 DONWLOADS","2025-05-01T15:17:42.456044Z","2025-05-02T18:40:33.164485Z","2025-05-04T02:37:07.323643Z","2025-05-01T15:57:07.724624Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},125,[139,292,307],[15],[377],[31624,31625],"I1DRIF00","aOpGH0io","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/aca2912f9132ef2ec85a276856716be14bc78eee.png","https://discord.gg/twn3E4F4ha",[],[31630,31634,31638,31642,31646],{"url":31631,"raw_url":31631,"featured":439,"title":31632,"description":3607,"created":31633,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/images/0da2d24bcae8e00a0c997f8657572f2163d3e3f3.png","Golden Hearts","2025-05-02T18:30:51.367594Z",{"url":31635,"raw_url":31635,"featured":439,"title":31636,"description":3607,"created":31637,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/images/0e2273ce105e2ae59c0f9c45e55cdc774f7712b2.png","Poisoned Heart","2025-05-01T15:43:41.409531Z",{"url":31639,"raw_url":31639,"featured":439,"title":31640,"description":3607,"created":31641,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/images/0f7f5835187a195f97aec90563898721cb9873df.png","Frozen Hearts","2025-05-01T15:44:54.929818Z",{"url":31643,"raw_url":31643,"featured":439,"title":31644,"description":3607,"created":31645,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/images/47e493d63dde4ab8d8fa0ce9949328a41ab972eb.png","Withered Hearts","2025-05-01T15:46:40.936096Z",{"url":31647,"raw_url":31647,"featured":439,"title":31648,"description":3607,"created":31649,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFmmAhBI/images/df7dfbc1e28e7ba29fc32c5017aa3a133a9cd8e3.png","Normal Heart","2025-05-02T18:30:09.748037Z",16042572,"ddegVflO",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31653,"id":31654,"slug":31655,"project_type":12,"team":31656,"organization":3607,"title":31657,"description":31658,"body":31659,"body_url":3607,"published":31660,"updated":31661,"approved":31662,"queued":31663,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31664,"downloads":31665,"followers":31427,"categories":31666,"additional_categories":31667,"loaders":31668,"versions":31669,"icon_url":31672,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31673,"donation_urls":31674,"gallery":31677,"color":31683,"thread_id":31684,"monetization_status":29958},[1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,856,808,805,775,727],"AGNTGC9V","i-got-a-headache","o3mPTytK","Do you have any ibuprofen?","Replaces totems with the \"Do you have any ibuprofen?\" meme","Adds everyone's favourite meme, [\"Do you have any ibuprofen?\"](https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/do-you-have-any-ibuprofen-i-got-a-headache) as your totem :3\n\n## ALL NEW!\n32x texture!\n![Preview of the 32x texture](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/58e2cc506773eacf617e4667ac8ae2d3a981ebb3_0.webp)\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4toej8KBsUc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>","2025-01-29T12:28:16.942273Z","2025-06-06T07:02:51.100059Z","2025-02-01T08:11:40.072459Z","2025-01-29T12:47:21.134286Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},1180,[50,93,148],[139,300],[377],[31670,31671],"aMcR3kmF","YvG8gvF7","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGNTGC9V/22f8098917039a562830c6bb5c4194dc24026f04_96.webp","https://artrinix.xyz/discord",[31675],{"id":3164,"platform":3165,"url":31676},"https://ko-fi.com/cephaloncosmic",[31678],{"url":31679,"raw_url":31680,"featured":864,"title":31657,"description":31681,"created":31682,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGNTGC9V/images/42c35fba49160e981d10f543c4494cd78cd0a249_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGNTGC9V/images/42c35fba49160e981d10f543c4494cd78cd0a249.jpeg","I got a headache","2025-01-29T12:38:49.899384Z",13354952,"XX7SbZQI",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31686,"id":31687,"slug":31688,"project_type":31,"team":31689,"organization":3607,"title":31690,"description":31691,"body":31692,"body_url":3607,"published":31693,"updated":31694,"approved":31695,"queued":31696,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31697,"downloads":31698,"followers":31699,"categories":31700,"additional_categories":31701,"loaders":31702,"versions":31703,"icon_url":31707,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31708,"gallery":31711,"color":31716,"thread_id":31717,"monetization_status":29958},[1058,856],"AG1mMSbb","the-day-of-the-beast","In9ePszH","The Day Of The Beast","Introduces The Devil, a new boss fight in the game.","![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32b879b1cbdf0d3bf80b85e49c4b3e51232f9bf2_0.webp)\n\n                                           About The Day of the Beast\n\nThe FazBrick Studios Team presents The Day of the Beast, a dark and disturbing Minecraft mod centered entirely around satanism, occult rituals, and psychological horror. Fully compatible with multiplayer and regularly updated for the latest versions of the game.\n\nFace The Devil, a powerful and ruthless enemy that will test your skills to the limit. This boss fight is the core of the mod and provides a tough, intense challenge for players looking for a real fight.\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c22b2e8cbc9c47350951b8e10360df0d8d508333.png)\n\n                                            I can put this in Modpacks?\nOf course! Feel free to add this mod to your modpacks. I encourage you to do so, just don't forget to give credit.\n\n                                                   Getting Started\nTo progress in The Day of the Beast, you must hunt and kill goats scattered around the world. Each goat has a very low drop chance to give you a Goat Heart, making it extremely difficult to obtain. \n\nCombine the Goat Heart with a Nether Wart and Blaze Powder to craft a Demon Heart\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f15a0376fdb1228162348c4581f13f8ec8e6185c.png)\n\nOnce you have the heart, you will need to find a monument in the plains of the Minecraft world. Combined with the Demon Heart, this will generate a large structure where you can face this abomination of the world face to face.\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0352cf1e6333401c470444f20869d2b3394a08b2_0.webp)\n\n                                                    Boss Fight\nWhen the monument is generated, The Devil will appear in an enormous size, summoning lightning and small demons while hurling large fireballs at you to counterattack. It will be immune to explosions and fire, but very weak to projectiles.\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c4ea1add48836b9972febe7aa45e09f7093c6d9.png)\n\nIn its second phase, it will return to its original size and become much weaker and stronger, trading power for great attack speed and abilities. It will chase you throughout the arena, jumping and stalking you while charging, summoning ally demons, and launching flames to scorch you. It constantly regenerates, making this final phase the most difficult and challenging.\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f7c31ceefaa28dccc290f1530dd936fa161917c.png)\n\nWhen you deplete its entire health bar, it will kneel down and disappear amidst a malevolent laugh and smoke, leaving you with a special item as a reward.\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c22b2e8cbc9c47350951b8e10360df0d8d508333.png)\n\n                                            Redistribution License\nYou are not allowed to upload or redistribute this mod on websites or domains other than Curseforge. \n\nThis specifically includes RU-Minecraft.\n\n![Replace this with a description](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/763df986484ee7c89cefde7f1d3a60de2fdb7472.png)","2025-08-16T16:18:19.597856Z","2025-09-02T20:01:04.230006Z","2025-08-20T20:52:06.458272Z","2025-08-16T16:25:35.853922Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},23264,41,[30,115,191],[134,171,316],[354,385],[31704,31705,31706],"JUFSJEeD","nAVLw4N7","9sxE4nhc","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG1mMSbb/bfe5f79a56c0e18b36297feb73af3236eb8e8f06_96.webp",[31709],{"id":3152,"platform":3153,"url":31710},"https://www.patreon.com/c/FazBrickStudios",[31712],{"url":31713,"raw_url":31714,"featured":864,"title":31690,"description":3607,"created":31715,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG1mMSbb/images/6fdab3caa3131226541ba6658dd150cb2e2307a2_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG1mMSbb/images/6fdab3caa3131226541ba6658dd150cb2e2307a2.png","2025-08-16T16:24:54.671310Z",918532,"UZqGFWMn",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31719,"id":31720,"slug":31721,"project_type":31,"team":31722,"organization":3607,"title":31723,"description":31724,"body":31725,"body_url":3607,"published":31726,"updated":31727,"approved":31728,"queued":31729,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31730,"downloads":30210,"followers":30103,"categories":31734,"additional_categories":31735,"loaders":31736,"versions":31737,"icon_url":31754,"issues_url":31755,"source_url":31756,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31757,"gallery":31758,"color":31763,"thread_id":31764,"monetization_status":29958},[775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574,520,514,502,453],"AFnD7foe","did-you-mention-me","wi2InQfV","Did You Mention Me?","No more worries about someone calling you when you are AFK.","Thank you for 500 downloads!!\n\n## No more worries about someone calling you when you are AFK.\n\n![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/did-you-mention-me?logo=data:image/svg%2bxml;base64,&style=for-the-badge&color=blue) ![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me?logo=data:image/svg%2bxml;base64,&style=for-the-badge)\n\nThis will make a notification sound whenever someone says your nickname and the Minecraft window isn't in focus mode.\n\nFully customizable and lightweight for Minecraft version 1.21.4 and above!\n\nYou can download the mod from [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/did-you-mention-me) or the [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me/releases/); any other source will be marked as unofficial.\n\nIf you want to see the source code or report an issue [Click Here](https://github.com/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me/issues).","2025-12-23T21:53:58.089582Z","2026-06-20T20:16:28.000317Z","2026-01-06T06:12:10.731392Z","2025-12-23T22:10:11.525960Z",{"id":31731,"name":31732,"url":31733},"LGPL-3.0-only","GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only","https://github.com/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me/blob/master/LICENSE",[303],[],[346],[31738,31739,31740,31741,31742,31743,31744,31745,31746,31747,31748,31749,31750,31751,31752,31753],"n3l24SCO","5gbsYBtx","azUuZuNT","vLM8BsXz","EwbXKAYs","eAdhro4p","yponXwvY","4Kg95OEI","KDZQQjpe","ZAg6UX78","hW6ceRgu","Lzw1LkEA","VE7BL8WM","T3RiCRmB","GsiLC828","InrUUaDk","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFnD7foe/a2421d068e4681ac5bc366afdfefb4bfa1224024.png","https://github.com/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me/issues","https://github.com/NapsterNPT/Did-You-Mention-Me",[],[31759],{"url":31760,"raw_url":31760,"featured":439,"title":31761,"description":31761,"created":31762,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFnD7foe/images/a2421d068e4681ac5bc366afdfefb4bfa1224024.png","Mod Icon","2026-01-26T14:05:39.375095Z",16516100,"VwMahQZp",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31766,"id":31767,"slug":31768,"project_type":31,"team":31769,"organization":3607,"title":31770,"description":31771,"body":31772,"body_url":3607,"published":31773,"updated":31774,"approved":31775,"queued":31776,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31777,"downloads":30133,"followers":29946,"categories":31778,"additional_categories":31779,"loaders":31780,"versions":31781,"icon_url":31783,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31784,"gallery":31785,"color":31786,"thread_id":31787,"monetization_status":29958},[1058],"AGdq8SzJ","curseberer-(origins-x-enigmatic-legacy)","HxEZtYtm","Curseberer (Origins x Enigmatic Legacy)","Enigmatic Legacy meets Origins","This is a simple datapack for Origins and Enigmatic Legacy. Instead of every player receiving the Ring of Seven Curses, the curses are tied to an origin, the Cursebearer\n\nOrigin: The Cursebearer\n\nPros:\n- +1 Looting Level\n- +1 Fortune Level\n- +400% Experience dropped\n- +10 Enchanting Power in Enchanting Table\n- Unique drops from some creatures.\n- Functionality of Ring of Ender.\n- You can create and use unique relics.\n\nCons:\n- You receive double damage from ANY source.\n- Neutral creatures are aggressive towards you.\n- Armor is 30% less effective.\n- Monsters receive 50% less damage from you.\n- When on fire, you burn forever.\n- Every death tears your soul apart.\n- You suffer from incurable insomnia.\n\nThis origin has not been made with the possibility of breaking the ring or changing your origin in mind","2025-09-29T07:10:17.866928Z","2025-09-29T07:11:49.347811Z","2025-10-01T07:40:10.725758Z","2025-09-30T12:33:57.957943Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},[171,175,303],[],[342],[31782],"CgS5XdRH","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGdq8SzJ/d2eed90c66a10e511e862799ff409f04ec157d6a_96.webp",[],[],2432033,"C3ejqcvM",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31789,"id":31790,"slug":31791,"project_type":12,"team":31792,"organization":3607,"title":31793,"description":31794,"body":31795,"body_url":3607,"published":31796,"updated":31797,"approved":31798,"queued":31799,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31800,"downloads":31801,"followers":31802,"categories":31803,"additional_categories":31804,"loaders":31805,"versions":31806,"icon_url":31808,"issues_url":31809,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31809,"donation_urls":31810,"gallery":31811,"color":31816,"thread_id":31817,"monetization_status":29958},[1286,1187,1112,1058,977,899,856,808,805],"AFl4lkap","re-imagine-tom-simple-storage","pTCiQXA5","Re-Imagine-Tom-Simple-Storage","Re-Imagines the textures of Tom Simple Storage to have a more of an vanilla look!","## Overview  \nRe-Imagines the textures of Tom Simple Storage to have a more of an vanilla look!\n\n\nReport any issue here  \nhttps://discord.gg/UHTbHcdkGx  \n### Items & Blocks  \n![Items&Blocks](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFl4lkap/images/17e5986926f42be0f8e51f5a092bcb5dcbb82a32.png)","2024-09-14T20:53:21.262811Z","2024-09-14T21:08:46.401141Z","2024-09-17T21:15:57.910812Z","2024-09-14T21:09:58.780263Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},681582,30,[15,194,307],[57,139,148,197,292],[377],[31807],"Wt0naTC3","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFl4lkap/f5af2fbed94ba8d6bd0e68415e2bd8e6dc1c7d06.png","https://discord.gg/w5VCHxu6Uv",[],[31812],{"url":31813,"raw_url":31813,"featured":864,"title":31814,"description":3607,"created":31815,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFl4lkap/images/17e5986926f42be0f8e51f5a092bcb5dcbb82a32.png","Items&Blocks","2024-09-14T21:04:33.382334Z",7560754,"BpXF4v5v",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":31819,"id":31820,"slug":31821,"project_type":31,"team":31822,"organization":3607,"title":31823,"description":31824,"body":31825,"body_url":3607,"published":31826,"updated":31827,"approved":31828,"queued":31829,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31830,"downloads":31831,"followers":30024,"categories":31832,"additional_categories":31833,"loaders":31834,"versions":31835,"icon_url":31840,"issues_url":31841,"source_url":31842,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31843,"gallery":31844,"color":31845,"thread_id":31846,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856,808,805,775,727],"AGShh2Na","wynnchattoggle","KG50IQcE","WynnChatToggle","Allows toggling chat in Wynncraft! Use /chat to toggle.","# Wynn Chat Toggle\nA Minecraft mod for the popular Minecraft server Wynncraft!\nThis mod adds a very simple feature to toggle \nbetween different chat channels in game.\nUse `/chat` to toggle between public, party and guild chat.\n\n## Links\n- CurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wynnchattoggle\n- Modrinth: https://modrinth.com/mod/wynnchattoggle\n- Github: https://github.com/harry0805/WynnChatToggle\n\n#### This mod was inspired by Hypixel's chat system.","2024-09-01T19:30:52.891217Z","2024-09-07T00:43:21.311819Z","2024-09-01T23:10:47.797020Z","2024-09-01T19:41:57.890253Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},2639,[275,303],[],[346],[31836,31837,31838,31839],"tEXiKsNe","Nc6GooAB","hYDXIa7T","qTUPKDr4","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGShh2Na/b29298507716e60eff8d484bd8d12bcc6afc210c.png","https://github.com/harry0805/WynnChatToggle/issues","https://github.com/harry0805/WynnChatToggle",[],[],5356231,"VWPZNWgH",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31848,"id":31849,"slug":31850,"project_type":31,"team":31851,"organization":3607,"title":31852,"description":31853,"body":31854,"body_url":3607,"published":31855,"updated":31856,"approved":31857,"queued":31858,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31859,"downloads":31861,"followers":29946,"categories":31862,"additional_categories":31863,"loaders":31864,"versions":31865,"icon_url":31867,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":31868,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31869,"gallery":31872,"color":31877,"thread_id":31878,"monetization_status":29958},[2549,2531,2507,2504,2498,2495,2492,2489,2486,2351,2300,2288,2285,2261,2258,2240,2237,2234,2186,2180,2177,2120,2111,2102,1943,1919,1910,1793,1784,1769,1754,1730,1661,1655,1646,1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574],"AGBTsiqZ","authmetitles","dAjeDqAA","AuthMeTitles","Sends Sounds and Displays Titles (Static or Animated), ActionBars and BossBars during the login and registration.","![First](https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExaTc2ejU4cnVkMXN0MWhnejN4ajBhZTIzOWNjM3duZTdtcW1obWI1ZiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/AEYL1Kjd4rmBt6dchw/giphy.gif)\n\n![CodeFactor](https://www.codefactor.io/repository/github/ivehydra/authmetitles/badge)\n\n# Introduction\nAuthMeTitles is a plugin that allows you to send Sounds and display Titles (Static or Animated), ActionBars and BossBars during the login and registration.\n\n# Features\n- 1.8 - Newer Versions Support.\n- Fully Customizable.\n- HEX Color Codes Support.\n- PlaceholderAPI Support (use placeholders in Titles, ActionBars and BossBars).\n- Sends Sounds during the login and registration.\n- Displays Titles (Static or Animated), ActionBars and BossBars during the login and registration.\n- Automatic Configuration File Updater.\n\n# Requirements\n1. Spigot\n2. AuthMeReloaded\n3. PlaceholderAPI (Optional)\n\n# How To Install\n1. Download AuthMeTitles.jar from this page.\n2. Download AuthMeReloaded.\n3. Download PlaceholderAPI (Optional).\n4. Put AuthMeTitles, AuthMeReloaded and PlaceholderAPI inside your plugins folder.\n5. Start your server.\n\n# Commands\n\n```\n/authmetitles help - Sends a message with all commands and permissions.\n/authmetitles reload | rl - Reloads the configuration file.\n```\n\n# Permissions\n\n```\nauthmetitles.* - Allows to execute all commands.\nauthmetitles.help - Allows to see all commands and permissions.\nauthmetitles.reload - Allows to reload the configuration file.\n```\n\n# Files\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>config.yml\u003C/summary>\n\n\n```\nupdateCheck: true\n\nmessages:\n  prefix: \"&aAuthMeTitles &7>>\"\n  general:\n    noPermission: \"%prefix% &cYou don't have that permission!\"\n    configReloaded: \"%prefix% &aConfig Reloaded!\"\n    wrongArguments: \"%prefix% &cWrong Arguments!\"\n  updateCheck:\n    latestVersion: \"%prefix% &aThis is the latest version(%current_version%) of the plugin.\"\n    newVersionAvailable:\n     - \"%prefix% &eThere is a new version(%new_version%) available.\"\n\nbossBar:\n  enabled: true\n  #If 'progress' is set to true, when the player needs to authenticate, the boss bar will decrease every second.\n  progress: true\n  #Only works for 1.9+ versions.\n  color: RED\n  #Only works for 1.9+ versions.\n  style: SOLID\n  message:\n    noRegister: \"&fYou have &3%authme_time% &fseconds to register!\"\n    noLogin: \"&fYou have &e%authme_time% &fseconds to login!\"\n\nactionBar:\n  enabled: true\n  noRegister: \"&fYou have &3%authme_time% &fseconds to register!\"\n  noLogin: \"&fYou have &e%authme_time% &fseconds to login!\"\n  register: \"&2Successfully registered!\"\n  login: \"&aSuccessful login!\"\n  sessionRestored: \"&6Session Restored!\"\n\ntitles:\n  noRegister:\n    sound: \"ENTITY_EXPERIENCE_ORB_PICKUP;1.0;1.0\"\n    static:\n     #Title;SubTitle;FadeIn;Stay;FadeOut\n      title: \"&3Register;&fPlease, register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;1;30;1\"\n    animated:\n     #If 'animated' is set to false only the static title will be displayed.\n      #If 'animated' is set to true only the animated titles will be displayed.\n      enabled: true\n      #Delay between the end of one title display and the start of the next title in sequence.\n      #Interval is calculated in ticks.\n      #20 Ticks = 1 Second.\n      interval: 1\n      loop: true\n      #Title;SubTitle;FadeIn;Stay;FadeOut;DelayBeforeSendingNext\n      titles:\n       - \"&x&E&0&F&3&F&0R&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fe&x&E&0&F&3&F&0g&x&C&0&E&7&E&1i&x&A&1&D&B&D&2s&x&8&2&D&0&C&3t&x&6&3&C&4&B&4e&x&4&3&B&8&A&5r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&C&0&E&7&E&1R&x&E&0&F&3&F&0e&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fg&x&E&0&F&3&F&0i&x&C&0&E&7&E&1s&x&A&1&D&B&D&2t&x&8&2&D&0&C&3e&x&6&3&C&4&B&4r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&A&1&D&B&D&2R&x&C&0&E&7&E&1e&x&E&0&F&3&F&0g&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fi&x&E&0&F&3&F&0s&x&C&0&E&7&E&1t&x&A&1&D&B&D&2e&x&8&2&D&0&C&3r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&8&2&D&0&C&3R&x&A&1&D&B&D&2e&x&C&0&E&7&E&1g&x&E&0&F&3&F&0i&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fs&x&E&0&F&3&F&0t&x&C&0&E&7&E&1e&x&A&1&D&B&D&2r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&6&3&C&4&B&4R&x&8&2&D&0&C&3e&x&A&1&D&B&D&2g&x&C&0&E&7&E&1i&x&E&0&F&3&F&0s&x&F&F&F&F&F&Ft&x&E&0&F&3&F&0e&x&C&0&E&7&E&1r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&4&3&B&8&A&5R&x&6&3&C&4&B&4e&x&8&2&D&0&C&3g&x&A&1&D&B&D&2i&x&C&0&E&7&E&1s&x&E&0&F&3&F&0t&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fe&x&E&0&F&3&F&0r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&2&4&A&C&9&6R&x&4&3&B&8&A&5e&x&6&3&C&4&B&4g&x&8&2&D&0&C&3i&x&A&1&D&B&D&2s&x&C&0&E&7&E&1t&x&E&0&F&3&F&0e&x&F&F&F&F&F&Fr;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&4&3&B&8&A&5R&x&2&4&A&C&9&6e&x&4&3&B&8&A&5g&x&6&3&C&4&B&4i&x&8&2&D&0&C&3s&x&A&1&D&B&D&2t&x&C&0&E&7&E&1e&x&E&0&F&3&F&0r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&6&3&C&4&B&4R&x&4&3&B&8&A&5e&x&2&4&A&C&9&6g&x&4&3&B&8&A&5i&x&6&3&C&4&B&4s&x&8&2&D&0&C&3t&x&A&1&D&B&D&2e&x&C&0&E&7&E&1r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&8&2&D&0&C&3R&x&6&3&C&4&B&4e&x&4&3&B&8&A&5g&x&2&4&A&C&9&6i&x&4&3&B&8&A&5s&x&6&3&C&4&B&4t&x&8&2&D&0&C&3e&x&A&1&D&B&D&2r;&fPlease,\n        register with the command: &3/register \u003Cpassword> \u003CconfirmPassword>;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&A&1&D&B&D&2R&x&8&2&D&0&C&3e&x&6&3&C&4&B&4g