      - \"&x&F&F&D&5&7&7S&x&F&F&D&0&6&6e&x&F&F&C&A&5&5s&x&F&F&C&5&4&4s&x&F&F&C&0&3&3i&x&F&F&B&B&2&2o&x&F&F&B&5&1&1n &x&F&F&B&0&0&0R&x&F&F&B&5&1&1e&x&F&F&B&B&2&2s&x&F&F&C&0&3&3t&x&F&F&C&5&4&4o&x&F&F&C&A&5&5r&x&F&F&D&0&6&6e&x&F&F&D&5&7&7d;&6Successful login;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&F&F&D&A&8&8S&x&F&F&D&5&7&7e&x&F&F&D&0&6&6s&x&F&F&C&A&5&5s&x&F&F&C&5&4&4i&x&F&F&C&0&3&3o&x&F&F&B&B&2&2n &x&F&F&B&5&1&1R&x&F&F&B&0&0&0e&x&F&F&B&5&1&1s&x&F&F&B&B&2&2t&x&F&F&C&0&3&3o&x&F&F&C&5&4&4r&x&F&F&C&A&5&5e&x&F&F&D&0&6&6d;&6Successful login;0;1;0\"\n        - \"&x&F&F&D&F&9&9S&x&F&F&D&A&8&8e&x&F&F&D&5&7&7s&x&F&F&D&0&6&6s&x&F&F&C&A&5&5i&x&F&F&C&5&4&4o&x&F&F&C&0&3&3n &x&F&F&B&B&2&2R&x&F&F&B&5&1&1e&x&F&F&B&0&0&0s&x&F&F&B&5&1&1t&x&F&F&B&B&2&2o&x&F&F&C&0&3&3r&x&F&F&C&5&4&4e&x&F&F&C&A&5&5d;&6Successful login;0;1;0\"\n```\n\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n# Built In Placeholders\n\n```\n%prefix% - Returns the prefix.\n%authme_time% - Returns the time (in seconds) within the player must authenticate before being kicked. The number is taken directly from the AuthMe plugin configuration file. (Only for ActionBars and BossBars).\n%current_version% - Returns the number of the current version (Only for UpdateCheck Messages).\n%new_version% - Returns the number of the new version (Only for UpdateCheck Messages).\n```\n\n# Gifs\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>Gifs\u003C/summary>\n\n![Gifs](https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExaTc2ejU4cnVkMXN0MWhnejN4ajBhZTIzOWNjM3duZTdtcW1obWI1ZiZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/AEYL1Kjd4rmBt6dchw/giphy.gif)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n# Donation Link: https://www.paypal.me/IVEHydra\nIf you want, you can donate to me. This would help me a lot to continue work on updates. Thank you!\n\n# Terms of Service\nBy downloading this plugin you agree the following terms:\n- You are not allowed to sell or redistribute this plugin.\n- You are not allowed to claim this plugin as your own.\n- You are only allowed to use this plugin for your own servers/networks.\n- I can update this terms of service at any time, without notification.\n\nIf you have any problems or bugs with this plugin, contact me.","2026-04-12T19:22:35.514296Z","2026-04-12T20:16:27.503052Z","2026-04-17T02:32:39.480638Z","2026-04-12T20:28:14.679314Z",{"id":30330,"name":30331,"url":31860},"https://github.com/IVEHydra/AuthMeTitles/blob/master/LICENSE",139,[303],[],[417],[31866],"WTroiLi9","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGBTsiqZ/395bbd910c61f8c18e622748524f23cb14814a7a_96.webp","https://github.com/IVEHydra/AuthMeTitles",[31870],{"id":3158,"platform":30399,"url":31871},"https://www.paypal.me/IVEHydra",[31873],{"url":31874,"raw_url":31874,"featured":439,"title":31875,"description":3607,"created":31876,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGBTsiqZ/images/79641ffdc0f4adccf32cf70b9d7d726fd29db460.gif","Registration","2026-04-12T20:17:54.205576Z",2572107,"lnGTJuXX",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31880,"id":31881,"slug":31882,"project_type":31,"team":31883,"organization":3607,"title":31884,"description":31885,"body":31886,"body_url":3607,"published":31887,"updated":31888,"approved":31889,"queued":31890,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31891,"downloads":31892,"followers":30134,"categories":31893,"additional_categories":31894,"loaders":31895,"versions":31896,"icon_url":31899,"issues_url":31900,"source_url":31901,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31902,"gallery":31903,"color":31939,"thread_id":31940,"monetization_status":29958},[1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899],"AGcQv0ze","moonflower","PtWU1hHx","Moonflower","A mod that adds a new flower and potion effect based on the phase of the moon","\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">**\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Moonflower is a mod that adds a new flower crop, as well as a new potion that gives different effects based on the phase of the moon.\u003C/span>**\u003C/p>\u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Moonflowers can be found growing on unique vines in Jungle biomes, and can be harvested using shears without breaking the block. When fully grown, the flower will open during the night and close during the day. The flower can also be brewed into a Potion of Moon's Blessing, which provides different effects based on the moon's phase. If the sun is out, the potion will do nothing. The potion is most powerful during the full moon, granting haste, speed, strength, jump boost, and night vision. The potion will grant night vision no matter the moon phase, while other effects will be phased out as the moon shrinks. For instance, the gibbous moon will only grant speed, strength, jump boost, and night vision, while the crescent moon will only grant jump boost and night vision.\u003C/span> undefined\u003C/p> \u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">\u003Cspan style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Art was made by the wonderful IcyDwarf!\u003C/span>\u003C/p> \u003Cp style=\"text-align: center;\">If you come across any bugs, you can report them to the GitHub!\u003C/p>","2026-03-07T20:55:02.307888Z","2026-03-09T06:35:26.444290Z","2026-03-22T22:32:29.019335Z","2026-03-07T21:03:04.699490Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},88,[171,316],[],[354,385],[31897,31898],"7YG5aE4A","NuCEkBmg","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/ebac9710955141d2480447c7e8c5726a96d46f1b.png","https://github.com/superlord9362/Moonflower/issues","https://github.com/superlord9362/Moonflower",[],[31904,31909,31914,31919,31924,31929,31934],{"url":31905,"raw_url":31906,"featured":439,"title":31907,"description":3607,"created":31908,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/0e9c8dbddb2cc1c1165d78faaa32754a1c2dda9c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/0e9c8dbddb2cc1c1165d78faaa32754a1c2dda9c.png","Day effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:57:14.939326Z",{"url":31910,"raw_url":31911,"featured":439,"title":31912,"description":3607,"created":31913,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/52bb3f57d7c3ec1f4642688e84ef3de938addfaa_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/52bb3f57d7c3ec1f4642688e84ef3de938addfaa.png","New moon effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:58:57.755657Z",{"url":31915,"raw_url":31916,"featured":864,"title":31917,"description":3607,"created":31918,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/546653ff36325ee4b2f0a492e55ac1b7a62c45de_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/546653ff36325ee4b2f0a492e55ac1b7a62c45de.png","Moonflowers","2026-03-07T20:56:59.424142Z",{"url":31920,"raw_url":31921,"featured":439,"title":31922,"description":3607,"created":31923,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/adc6f7651c31d34e9c835a2f7ed29161e0e1175d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/adc6f7651c31d34e9c835a2f7ed29161e0e1175d.png","Half moon effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:58:12.428673Z",{"url":31925,"raw_url":31926,"featured":439,"title":31927,"description":3607,"created":31928,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/bb91b3265a2571cdf3dc89353c37f15c3cd70252_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/bb91b3265a2571cdf3dc89353c37f15c3cd70252.png","Crescent moon effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:58:30.381446Z",{"url":31930,"raw_url":31931,"featured":439,"title":31932,"description":3607,"created":31933,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/c2056fe8199f078ad082f2f7cbd6c0986c94f778_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/c2056fe8199f078ad082f2f7cbd6c0986c94f778.png","Gibbous moon effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:57:55.485189Z",{"url":31935,"raw_url":31936,"featured":439,"title":31937,"description":3607,"created":31938,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/c8778456423fb640f8afe65b9d644c7ccb8256e4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGcQv0ze/images/c8778456423fb640f8afe65b9d644c7ccb8256e4.png","Full moon effects of the potion","2026-03-07T20:57:30.354481Z",9213004,"818y9anZ",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31942,"id":31943,"slug":31944,"project_type":34,"team":31945,"organization":3607,"title":31946,"description":31947,"body":31948,"body_url":3607,"published":31949,"updated":31950,"approved":31951,"queued":31952,"status":29919,"requested_status":29921,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31953,"downloads":31954,"followers":29946,"categories":31955,"additional_categories":31956,"loaders":31957,"versions":31958,"icon_url":31960,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":31961,"donation_urls":31962,"gallery":31963,"color":31968,"thread_id":31969,"monetization_status":29958},[856],"AH5zVX4A","cherry-cobblemon-modpack","5wraemqj","Cherry Cobblemon Modpack","Official modpack for Cherry Cobblemon","Offical modpack for the Cherry Cobblemon server.\nIP: 74.112.77.164:9060\n\nThis modpack is for features such as mega evolution, trainer battles, and TMs.\n\nThis is a very new simple server that is mostly vanilla with a few settings changed.\n\nThe server features custom mods, raids, npc trainers, a basic ruleset, survival experience, admins that do not cheat, trivia, a GTS, monthly mystery gifts/kits, boosted shiny rate, boosted spawn rate, player and server shops with different currencies, and no pay to win or donations of any kind.\n\nThe intent is for the server to have a survival experience without people getting quickly overpowered but still having not have a ridiculous grind.\n\nWe have a discord server that can join with this link: [https://discord.gg/95mxCabJWf](https://discord.gg/95mxCabJWf). An official website and dedicated IP might be implemented in the future.","2026-01-28T23:21:37.400810Z","2026-02-09T14:59:58.504194Z","2026-02-04T02:01:32.559111Z","2026-02-03T22:28:50.220339Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},217,[200],[],[346],[31959],"vfeLiuzR","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH5zVX4A/920edc2f70c61147504b039401d0f850f4ca3112_96.webp","https://discord.gg/95mxCabJWf",[],[31964],{"url":31965,"raw_url":31966,"featured":864,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31967,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH5zVX4A/images/62acf2175c08389708b72ae6007d0eea07d63c5d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH5zVX4A/images/62acf2175c08389708b72ae6007d0eea07d63c5d.png","2026-02-03T22:18:52.590194Z",6779519,"jUtz7OIE",{"client_side":30008,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":31971,"id":31972,"slug":31973,"project_type":31,"team":31974,"organization":3607,"title":31975,"description":31976,"body":31977,"body_url":3607,"published":31978,"updated":31979,"approved":31980,"queued":31981,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":31982,"downloads":31983,"followers":30480,"categories":31984,"additional_categories":31985,"loaders":31986,"versions":31987,"icon_url":31991,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":31992,"gallery":31993,"color":32006,"thread_id":32007,"monetization_status":29958},[1058,775,727],"AH9frxRj","enhaced-beaches-and-shores","c6UxiYuw","Enhaced Beaches and Shores","A Datapack to Enhance Minecrafts Shore regions","A Datapack that Enhances Minecrafts Shore Regions\nThis is what you can expect from this Datapack:\n\nNew Features:\n-while exploring the Coast regions of Minecraft you will now be able to find Tide Pools !\n-Tide Pools will be different for Beaches and Stony Shores\n\nNew Structure:\n-you will now find \"Fisher Hut\" structures when exploring beaches\n-in the Fisher Huts you will be able to meet a Fisherman Villager\n\nIf you are looking for a Minecraft Beach and Stony Shore Update this might be what youre looking for !\n\nHope you enjoy this Datapack !","2025-01-11T11:11:27.544747Z","2025-03-25T17:03:33.432217Z","2025-01-17T06:33:48.479115Z","2025-01-14T11:43:42.066039Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},312,[30,100,316],[],[342],[31988,31989,31990],"xexiTwzy","WcIMSjvo","8GNpAc6E","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH9frxRj/f8cf409670faf248b6af733471c41e98d485b16e_96.webp",[],[31994,31997,32000,32003],{"url":31995,"raw_url":31995,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31996,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH9frxRj/images/347ee4142310dc06e1494ccd57763f1f922a8954.jpeg","2025-01-11T11:16:29.935269Z",{"url":31998,"raw_url":31998,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":31999,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH9frxRj/images/4449ec7407a0a2ba33aa610638d961e143f881dc.jpeg","2025-01-11T11:16:36.950516Z",{"url":32001,"raw_url":32001,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":32002,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH9frxRj/images/8b7df68aa164587024e24a0177af79416fd358e4.jpeg","2025-01-11T11:16:40.721348Z",{"url":32004,"raw_url":32004,"featured":439,"title":3607,"description":3607,"created":32005,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AH9frxRj/images/dea22c198660ef149e8d84686b53c23c3c4bb0e4.jpeg","2025-01-11T11:16:44.485039Z",5979697,"nUgbIst1",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":32009,"id":32010,"slug":32011,"project_type":31,"team":32012,"organization":3607,"title":32013,"description":32014,"body":32015,"body_url":3607,"published":32016,"updated":32017,"approved":32018,"queued":32019,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32020,"downloads":32021,"followers":29977,"categories":32022,"additional_categories":32023,"loaders":32024,"versions":32025,"icon_url":32027,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":32028,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":32029,"gallery":32030,"color":32031,"thread_id":32032,"monetization_status":29958},[1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899],"AG5Qeijy","aminoauthorizator","OzfjIAtp","AminoAuthorizator","Authorizer for the server via Amino bots","# Amino Authorizator Plugin\n\nAmino Authorizator is a Minecraft plugin that provides a mechanism for user authentication through the Amino API. It includes settings to manage login via email, passwords, proxy servers, and WebSocket connections.\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- **Amino Authentication**: Login via bot code.\n- **Proxy Support**: Easily configurable proxy settings.\n- **WebSocket connection**: Connect to the server via WebSocket with heartbeat interval and reconnection delay settings.\n- **Auto Data Retention**: Configured auto-save interval.\n- **Flexible settings**: Ability to configure logging, messages and other parameters through the configuration file.\n\n![demonstration](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/354c12ae-f131-4987-9a44-9f1c7eb069dc)\n\n## 📥 Installation\n\n1. Download the latest release of the plugin.\n2. Place the '.jar' file in the 'plugins' folder of your Minecraft server.\n3. Restart the server\n\n## ⚙️ Setup\n\nAfter installing the plugin, you need to configure the 'config.yml' configuration file.\n\n### Config File\n\n```yaml\nplugin:\n  enabled: false\n  log_level: \"INFO\"\n\nauth:\n  email: \"default_email@example.com\"\n  password: \"default_password\"\n  device_id: \"197E0C5D7EDB8394DB40D533D65338123CCBBB20DB05CB64192EE428D459D11D1DB143F1BF2CCB4C5C\"\n  max_login_attempts: 3\n  login_timeout_seconds: 30\n\nproxy:\n  enabled: false\n  host: \"0.0.0.0\"\n  port: 0000\n  type: \"HTTP\"\n\nwebsocket:\n  heartbeat_interval: 30000\n  reconnect_delay: 5000\n\ndata:\n  auto_save_interval: 600\n  file_name: \"data.json\"\n\nmessages:\n  login_success: \"Authorization was successful! Welcome!\"\n  login_fail: \"Authorization error. Check your email and password.\"\n  proxy_error: \"Proxy connection error.\"\n  websocket_error: \"WebSocket connection error. Reconnection...\"\n```","2024-12-15T14:37:14.713835Z","2024-12-15T14:40:57.277644Z","2024-12-19T02:04:40.752765Z","2024-12-15T14:54:48.800214Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},60,[175,288],[],[329,401,405,417],[32026],"C18anCNf","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AG5Qeijy/e5cb24dd486f2e21be1842d7fcb71ba07c1c0235_96.webp","https://github.com/AugustLigh/AminoAuthorizator",[],[],15581024,"5FAn3YYo",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":32034,"id":32035,"slug":32036,"project_type":31,"team":32037,"organization":3607,"title":32038,"description":32039,"body":32040,"body_url":3607,"published":32041,"updated":32042,"approved":32043,"queued":32044,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32045,"downloads":32048,"followers":30333,"categories":32049,"additional_categories":32050,"loaders":32051,"versions":32052,"icon_url":32072,"issues_url":32073,"source_url":32074,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":32075,"gallery":32076,"color":32077,"thread_id":32078,"monetization_status":29958},[856,775,727],"AFthCZHM","player-persistence","8L6TwBQl","Player Persistence","!API MOD! Additional Code required\nA simple library that allows to sync player data such as inventories, ender chests and locations between multiple servers","# Player Persistence Mod\n\n## WARNING: This mod is an API, it requires a functioning PostgreSQL Server and additional code to function! It does not work as standalone!\n\nOverview: The Player Persistence mod is a lightweight library designed for Minecraft server developers who want to provide a seamless, persistent experience for players across server restarts and world transitions. This mod handles the automatic saving and loading of player inventory, Ender Chest contents, and positional data to a database, ensuring that players' states are preserved accurately.\n\n## Key Features:\n\n- Optimized for Docker and Kubernetes Deployments: Change which DB to use with what user simply by setting the enviroment variables _DB_URL_ _DB_USER_ _DB_PASS_. To sync coordinates across multiple ServerTypes set the _SERVER_NODE_ variable to the name of your Server.\n\n- Inventory Persistence: Automatically save and load player inventories, including armor and off-hand items, to a database. This ensures that player items are consistent and safe across server sessions.\n\n- Ender Chest Persistence: Similar to inventory persistence, this feature saves and loads the contents of players' Ender Chests, making sure that these valuable items are not lost.\n\n- Player Position Syncing: Maintain the exact player position and dimension data across server restarts or even cross-server transitions, allowing players to continue their journey exactly where they left off.\n\n- PostgreSQL Database Integration: The mod is built to work with PostgreSQL databases, making it ideal for large server networks or custom server setups that require persistent data storage.\n\n## Usage\nThis mod is intended as a backend library for server developers and does not add any direct gameplay features. To use the mod, simply integrate it into your server's mod setup, configure the database connection, and let the mod handle player data persistence automatically.\n\n## Compatibility\nThe mod is designed to work with Fabric API and is compatible with the latest version of Minecraft. It is also modular and can be customized or extended by developers to fit specific server needs.\n\n## How-To-Use\n* Add the dependency to your project: \n  `modApi(\"maven.modrinth:player-persistence:VERSION\")?.let { include(it)}`\n* Create a PlayerPersistence Object e.g `var pp = PlayerPersistence()`\n* Use the methods as needed\n\n## Missing something?\nIf you're missing some feature please open a issue on GitHub and we'll see to it.\n","2024-09-03T18:17:55.860653Z","2025-06-15T15:19:13.417070Z","2024-09-06T03:20:36.744629Z","2024-09-05T17:39:30.375144Z",{"id":32046,"name":32047,"url":3607},"AGPL-3.0-only","GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only",819,[157],[303],[346,409],[32053,32054,32055,32056,32057,32058,32059,32060,32061,32062,32063,32064,32065,32066,32067,32068,32069,32070,32071],"GyG5BrDa","sVlUyB01","fgewPZ7F","70TY8ZMK","jxw067Tc","RVKFOcnL","npVgP6PI","a0NFDChI","mZPm3tIW","Fa0Hiq9y","EtbZBD3c","ELg4xl6m","txZkWJKW","sC13uOnp","vulsopMs","9Uu9IZAd","iHp25tHe","esaYhHg0","EwPdDnQc","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFthCZHM/3bc9377e62b7c347772df426ee22b896a422a21b.png","https://github.com/project-hans/playerpersistance/issues","https://github.com/project-hans/playerpersistance",[],[],12895171,"J4xXrvyZ",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32080,"id":32081,"slug":32082,"project_type":46,"team":32083,"organization":3607,"title":32084,"description":32085,"body":32086,"body_url":3607,"published":32087,"updated":32088,"approved":32089,"queued":32090,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32091,"downloads":32093,"followers":32094,"categories":32095,"additional_categories":32096,"loaders":32097,"versions":32098,"icon_url":32100,"issues_url":32101,"source_url":32102,"wiki_url":32103,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":32104,"gallery":32105,"color":32129,"thread_id":32130,"monetization_status":29958},[2549,2531,2507,2504,2498,2495,2492,2489,2486,2351,2300,2288,2285,2261,2258,2240,2237,2234,2186,2180,2177,2120,2111,2102,1943,1919,1910,1793,1784,1769,1754,1730,1661,1655,1646,1556,1553,1523,1517,1505,1484,1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058,1025,983,977,905,899,862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574],"AGUnjUjy","kute","48Rg6Ouq","Kute","A lightweight shader that’s easy on performance and gives Minecraft a soft, dreamy vibe :D\n\nFirst shader i created :D","This lightweight Minecraft shader gives your game a gentle dreamy glow without slowing things down It’s perfect for players who want a cozy, soft vibe while keeping smooth gameplay and super friendly on performance ^-^","2025-08-11T13:20:45.262055Z","2025-08-11T13:59:13.842377Z","2025-08-13T15:44:36.165891Z","2025-08-11T13:39:02.853115Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":32092},"https://github.com/NotJamesPlayz/Kute/blob/main/LICENSE",47742,32,[45,122,168],[60,180,307],[362,393],[32099],"G74YNoOB","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/0d239b2a5d9cd9474a7fea0d17b1954d16dfb4ff_96.webp","https://github.com/NotJamesPlayz/Kute/issues","https://github.com/NotJamesPlayz/Kute","https://github.com/NotJamesPlayz/Kute/wiki",[],[32106,32110,32115,32119,32124],{"url":32107,"raw_url":32107,"featured":439,"title":32108,"description":3607,"created":32109,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/0d239b2a5d9cd9474a7fea0d17b1954d16dfb4ff.png","Kute (PFP)","2025-08-11T13:32:26.050966Z",{"url":32111,"raw_url":32112,"featured":439,"title":32113,"description":3607,"created":32114,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/1862dac7d7303dd720314ab75be3dcc3b0229d88_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/1862dac7d7303dd720314ab75be3dcc3b0229d88.png","Midnight","2025-08-11T13:37:54.550273Z",{"url":32116,"raw_url":32117,"featured":439,"title":8042,"description":3607,"created":32118,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/8069fa8ab53e27e8a950c66090886c93e2edf1fb_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/8069fa8ab53e27e8a950c66090886c93e2edf1fb.png","2025-08-11T13:37:22.113432Z",{"url":32120,"raw_url":32121,"featured":864,"title":32122,"description":3607,"created":32123,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/bbc3221bbb09017feaaafb6526d7aee04c695ec0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/bbc3221bbb09017feaaafb6526d7aee04c695ec0.png","Day","2025-08-11T13:38:06.790427Z",{"url":32125,"raw_url":32126,"featured":439,"title":32127,"description":3607,"created":32128,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/fd695338ed29be8d1475fa90edbddceb4b57ec84_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGUnjUjy/images/fd695338ed29be8d1475fa90edbddceb4b57ec84.png","Night","2025-08-11T13:37:40.778386Z",15456706,"t6w2kHI6",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32132,"id":32133,"slug":32134,"project_type":31,"team":32135,"organization":3607,"title":32136,"description":32137,"body":32138,"body_url":3607,"published":32139,"updated":32140,"approved":32139,"queued":3607,"status":29920,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32141,"downloads":32142,"followers":32143,"categories":32144,"additional_categories":32145,"loaders":32146,"versions":32147,"icon_url":32155,"issues_url":32156,"source_url":32157,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":32158,"donation_urls":32159,"gallery":32163,"color":32164,"thread_id":32133,"monetization_status":29958},[1409,1391,1328,1313,1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1112,1064,1058],"AFqV4ew3","orientation","nocnoy8S","Orientation","Quilt mod which helps to place ice boats by snapping orientation to cardinal directions ","Looking for a more modern version? Check out **[Align My Boat](https://modrinth.com/mod/alignmyboat)**!\n\n---\n\n**Orientation** is a fork of TheCritic's [Critical Orientation](https://github.com/bshuler/critical-orientation) mod with a few changes made to suit my needs, updated to modern Minecraft versions.\n\nPressing backslash (`\\`) will snap your camera angle to a multiple of 45 degrees. Change the keybind in settings if you so wish. There's also another key (`j`) which can snap to a configurable angle.\n\nThe `/align` command also allows you to align to an arbitrary amount of degrees.\n\n[![Requires Quilt Standard Libraries](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/quilt-standard-libraries_64h.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/qsl)\n---\n[![Support us through GitHub Sponsors](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/ghsponsors-plural_64h.png)](https://github.com/sponsors/triphora)\\\n[![Chat with us on Discord](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png)](https://discord.gg/buPbUvw5FD)","2021-06-09T03:36:26.538947Z","2023-03-18T03:11:41.916455Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},9502,63,[303],[],[346,409],[32148,32149,32150,32151,32152,32153,32154],"itKIJghA","Pe8SoDAF","UQXCON6M","JmITtgmO","jjcYkXfN","ksL4Bjju","atC6Q4ao","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFqV4ew3/f747822eec0e9de3ab11e702e5f9147f4551280d_96.webp","https://github.com/emmods/quilt_mods/issues","https://github.com/emmods/quilt_mods","https://discord.gg/buPbUvw5FD",[32160],{"id":3161,"platform":32161,"url":32162},"Github","https://github.com/sponsors/triphora",[],4414856,{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":32166,"id":32167,"slug":32168,"project_type":34,"team":32169,"organization":3607,"title":32170,"description":32171,"body":32172,"body_url":3607,"published":32173,"updated":32174,"approved":32175,"queued":32176,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32177,"downloads":32143,"followers":29946,"categories":32178,"additional_categories":32179,"loaders":32180,"versions":32181,"icon_url":32183,"issues_url":3607,"source_url":3607,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":32184,"donation_urls":32185,"gallery":32186,"color":32192,"thread_id":32193,"monetization_status":29958},[1058],"AGhnrraW","hyper-automation","CFWUpcB5","Hyper Automation","Hyper Automation is a modpack with mods that focus on automating tasks like mining, processing ore, and harvesting crops.","Hyper Automation is a modpack with a primary focus on Create Mod. This modpack is primarially for people who like to automate things and build crazy machines, but it also has some other cool mods that add their own fun to the game such as:\n\n- Tinker's Construct: Hammers and other 3x3 tools\n- Dank Storage: Large portible storage containers\n- Mekanism: Better ore processing and many other fun machines.\n- Micro Teleporters: Teleport between various locations.\n\nThe full mod list is:\n\n- Create Mod\n- Mekanism\n- Mekanism Generaters\n- Tinker's Construct\n- Mantle\n- Dank Storage\n- Jade\n- JEI\n- Micro Teleporters","2026-03-14T15:50:11.599161Z","2026-03-14T15:53:38.368698Z","2026-04-03T03:59:18.250280Z","2026-03-14T15:55:39.660491Z",{"id":29944,"name":10,"url":3607},[162,200,288],[30],[354],[32182],"iFwOsqVt","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhnrraW/78e6a70d0e9ab44f68702d4d1a451a11b2852448_96.webp","https://discord.gg/KpBdgtccET",[],[32187],{"url":32188,"raw_url":32189,"featured":864,"title":32190,"description":3607,"created":32191,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhnrraW/images/d9e340f5929ac0bf4f9aedab49d7732783fda50c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AGhnrraW/images/d9e340f5929ac0bf4f9aedab49d7732783fda50c.png","Hyper automation thumbnail","2026-03-31T15:33:42.972534Z",9665629,"QrXcWwmW",{"client_side":29960,"server_side":29931,"game_versions":32195,"id":32196,"slug":32197,"project_type":31,"team":32198,"organization":3607,"title":32199,"description":32200,"body":32201,"body_url":3607,"published":32202,"updated":32203,"approved":32204,"queued":32205,"status":29919,"requested_status":29919,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32206,"downloads":32207,"followers":30024,"categories":32208,"additional_categories":32209,"loaders":32210,"versions":32211,"icon_url":32213,"issues_url":32214,"source_url":32215,"wiki_url":3607,"discord_url":3607,"donation_urls":32216,"gallery":32217,"color":32218,"thread_id":32219,"monetization_status":29958},[862,856,808,805,775,727,685,676,670,625,619,574],"AFzLoLK9","playtime-group-luckperms","oPpraq6t","PlayTimeGroup [LuckPerms]","A plugin that assigns roles to players based on their playing time using LuckPerms.","## Functionality\n\nThe plugin tracks players' playtime and automatically assigns them roles via the LuckPerms permissions system based on accumulated time. Roles are configured in the configuration file.\n\n### Key features:\n\n- __Playtime tracking:__ The plugin stores players' login/logout times and summarizes the total time in the `playtime.yml` file.\n- __Automatic role assignment:__ The playtime of online players is checked every 5 minutes and the corresponding roles are assigned.\n- __Role check upon login:__ When a player logs in, their playtime is immediately checked and roles are assigned.\n- __`/playtime` command:__ Allows players to view their playtime or (with the `playtimeroles.admin` permission) the playtime of other players.\n\n### Commands:\n\n- `/playtime` - Show your playtime\n- `/playtime \u003Cplayer>` - Show the playtime of the specified player (requires `playtimeroles.admin`)\n\n### Permissions:\n\n- `playtimeroles.playtime` - Access to the `/playtime` command\n- `playtimeroles.admin` - View other players' playtimes\n\n## Configuration\n\n### config.yml\n\nThis file contains role settings. Each role has a name and a required time in the format:\n\n- `h` - hours\n- `m` - minutes\n- `s` - seconds\n\nExample configuration:\n\n```yaml\nroles:\n  - role: \"novice\"\n    time: \"1m\"\n  - role: \"experienced\" \n    time: \"10h\"\n  - role: \"veteran\"\n    time: \"50h\"\n```\n\n## How the plugin works\n\n1. __When enabled:__ Loads the configuration, initializes the 'playtime.yml' file to store playtime data, and registers events and the command.\n2. __Player tracking:__ Stores the login time upon login, and calculates and stores the session time upon logout. 3. __Role Checking:__ Periodically (every 5 minutes) and upon login, it checks the total playtime of each player and assigns roles via the LuckPerms API.\n4. __Data Saving:__ Playtime is saved in `playtime.yml` in milliseconds by player UUID.\n\nThe plugin requires LuckPerms to be installed to work with roles and works on Paper/Spigot servers with API 1.21.\n","2026-01-20T06:01:51.086594Z","2026-01-20T06:27:54.969740Z","2026-01-24T23:22:09.902588Z","2026-01-20T07:09:39.641057Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},792,[175,288,303],[134],[329,401,417],[32212],"NXC4Eu0D","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFzLoLK9/0600c70a2af7b222218c549903d13b74f6522931_96.webp","https://github.com/Jorget01/PlayTimeGroup-LuckPerms-/issues","https://github.com/Jorget01/PlayTimeGroup-LuckPerms-",[],[],1513237,"sONhPbcS",{"client_side":29931,"server_side":29960,"game_versions":32221,"id":32222,"slug":32223,"project_type":31,"team":32224,"organization":32225,"title":32226,"description":32227,"body":32228,"body_url":3607,"published":32229,"updated":32230,"approved":32229,"queued":3607,"status":29919,"requested_status":3607,"moderator_message":3607,"license":32231,"downloads":32232,"followers":32233,"categories":32234,"additional_categories":32235,"loaders":32236,"versions":32237,"icon_url":32275,"issues_url":32276,"source_url":32277,"wiki_url":32278,"discord_url":32279,"donation_urls":32280,"gallery":32285,"color":32316,"thread_id":32222,"monetization_status":29958},[1286,1229,1196,1187,1151,1058,1028,1025,977,899,862,805,775,727],"AFirzqTJ","purpurclient","1c1PPInF","bWn6wDCq","PurpurClient","Fixes client-side vanilla bugs","![](https://i.imgur.com/UtemmjT.png)\n\n### PurpurClient\n\nPurpurClient is a Fabric client mod that aims to fix various client-side bugs in the game. A lot of these bugfixes end up in the vanilla game eventually, but for those who can't wait, this mod is for you.\n\nPurpurClient is designed to work together with [Purpur](https://purpurmc.org) servers (hence the name), but most features can still be used with any server type, as these are fixes to vanilla bugs that are not caused by Purpur itself.\n\nIf you have any questions, please join us in our Discord at https://purpurmc.org/discord.\n\n[![Discord Shield Label](https://img.shields.io/discord/685683385313919172.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2)](https://purpurmc.org/discord)\n\n### Current Features in 1.20.2:\n\n* Customizable mob passenger offsets\n* Adds bee counts inside beehives to debug screen¹\n* Fancy Purpur-themed Loading Screen (can be disabled in the config)\n* Fancy Window Title that changes based on what kind of server you're in ([translations can be PR'd](./src/main/resources/assets/purpurclient/lang/))\n* Displays Custom Enchantments instead of stripping them from the client\n* Removes the client-side limit of 255 levels\n\n¹ only works when connected to [Purpur](https://github.com/PurpurMC/Purpur) servers\n\n### Past Features (to get an idea of what this mod has done and will do in the future):\n\n* Asynchronous chat processing (removed since Mojang's new chat system is confusing)\n* Fix rain particles appearing under water [MC-131770](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-131770)\n* Fix sky darkening when riding minecart not on tracks [MC-51150](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-51150)\n* Fix chat stutter [MC-218167](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-218167)\n* Fix warnings in logs about invalid flying attributes [Purpur-744](https://github.com/PurpurMC/Purpur/pull/744)\n* Fix debug markers ignoring the blue and red values that are set [MC-234030](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-234030) (Shows as Unresolved even though it's been fixed)\n* Fix client preemptively removing item entities from the world (MC-???)\n\nNote: PurpurClient adds a fancy animated splash screen on game startup alongside a better window title message. Both of these can be disabled in the config if preferred.\n\n### Donate\n\nWe accept donations via [GitHub Sponsors](https://github.com/sponsors/purpurmc) and the [OpenCollective](https://opencollective.com/purpurmc).\n\n[![GitHub Sponsors](https://i.imgur.com/eVDnwCb.png)](https://github.com/sponsors/purpurmc)\n [![OpenCollective](https://i.imgur.com/XLEXIiP.png)](https://opencollective.com/purpurmc)","2022-03-01T09:03:48.777567Z","2025-04-13T23:39:34.197343Z",{"id":30021,"name":30022,"url":3607},106670,177,[211,303],[],[346],[32238,32239,32240,32241,32242,32243,32244,32245,32246,32247,32248,32249,32250,32251,32252,32253,32254,32255,32256,32257,32258,32259,32260,32261,32262,32263,32264,32265,32266,32267,32268,32269,32270,32271,32272,32273,32274],"ugtXbSeF","ebXROafP","VnS1zdd3","mJ3Q4M0p","vD0LPGDe","YisOu3Dc","JxPtjYuu","VotWLgYN","nYEKtP8u","iFrUze7x","BKknQjKl","akLbBocw","rXsUAUb7","sRXRqc5l","oT2EAd5Y","YtPPZlfk","1ZO3uhGK","HYwJSBkg","yWwriCNp","6wevfg0P","igdun7Zr","keQi9vwN","RGN0bUck","eyKQ0552","gAFIPgCn","4dI9G0zX","PsMnmva5","YBoac4Km","YBxOvlej","Rrjfm63i","f2ha5oDc","Jo6cRJiU","rmHsxllf","ldjSpT4Z","Uw2BP61x","exvWatvc","psX2Xx1W","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/d282906efc0284368e322f1a8548fd51c5c95fa8_96.webp","https://github.com/PurpurMC/PurpurClient/issues/","https://github.com/PurpurMC/PurpurClient/","https://github.com/PurpurMC/PurpurClient/wiki/","https://purpurmc.org/discord",[32281,32283],{"id":3161,"platform":32161,"url":32282},"https://github.com/sponsors/purpurmc",{"id":3167,"platform":3168,"url":32284},"https://opencollective.com/purpurmc",[32286,32292,32298,32304,32310],{"url":32287,"raw_url":32288,"featured":864,"title":32289,"description":32290,"created":32291,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/1111914da9a514fcef5b73d7d9f07763e684ba72_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/cb90ee7544da6cd4f274d282d3658f9f2fa3eb7d.png","Purpur Background","Fancy squid","2023-07-07T11:54:14.182250Z",{"url":32293,"raw_url":32294,"featured":439,"title":32295,"description":32296,"created":32297,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/353a20d70bfc991c70e093ce221d1e64cfaf6249_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/353a20d70bfc991c70e093ce221d1e64cfaf6249.png","PurpurClient Ender Dragon","The screen for the seat height controls of the Ender Dragon","2022-03-01T09:07:52.332789Z",{"url":32299,"raw_url":32300,"featured":439,"title":32301,"description":32302,"created":32303,"ordering":29946},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/412241b4aa5518e3991570d1d80e0d36b3bed4d8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/AFirzqTJ/images/412241b4aa5518e3991570d1d80e0d36b3bed4d8.png","PurpurClient Mobs","All mobs have their own settings (only the seat height, for now)","2022-03-01T09:07:51.666596Z",{"url":32305,"raw_url":32306,"featured":439,"title":32307,"descr